, 'Short Sword', 'Siege Striker', 'Sigiled Contender', 'Silent Dart', 'Silversmote Ghoul', 'Skeleton Archer', 'Skyscanner', 'Skyway Sniper', 'Snarespinner', 'Solemn Simulacrum', 'Soul Sear', 'Sparkhunter Masticore', 'Speaker of the Heavens', 'Spellgorger Weird', 'Spined Megalodon', 'Spirit of Malevolence', 'Sporeweb Weaver', 'Staunch Shieldmate', 'Storm Caller', 'Stormwing Entity', 'Subira, Tulzidi Caravanner', 'Sublime Epiphany', 'Sure Strike', 'Swamp', 'Swift Response', 'Swiftwater Cliffs', 'Tavern Swindler', "Teferi's Ageless Insight", "Teferi's Protege", "Teferi's Tutelage", "Teferi's Wavecaster", 'Teferi, Master of Time', 'Teferi, Timeless Voyager', 'Tempered Veteran', 'Temple of Epiphany', 'Temple of Malady', 'Temple of Mystery', 'Temple of Silence', 'Temple of Triumph', 'Terror of the Peaks', "Thieves' Guild Enforcer", 'Thornwood Falls', 'Thrashing Brontodon', 'Thrill of Possibility', 'Tide Skimmer', 'Titanic Growth', 'Tolarian Kraken', 'Tome Anima', "Tormod's Crypt", 'Track Down', 'Traitorous Greed', 'Tranquil Cove', 'Transmogrify', 'Trufflesnout', 'Turn to Slag', 'Turret Ogre', 'Twinblade Assassins', 'Ugin, the Spirit Dragon', 'Unleash Fury', 'Unsubstantiate', 'Valorous Steed', 'Village Rites', 'Vito, Thorn of the Dusk Rose', 'Vodalian Arcanist', 'Volcanic Geyser', 'Volcanic Salvo', 'Vryn Wingmare', 'Waker of Waves', 'Walking Corpse', 'Wall of Runes', 'Warded Battlements', 'Warden of the Woods', 'Watcher of the Spheres', 'Wildwood Patrol', 'Wildwood Scourge', 'Wind-Scarred Crag', 'Wishcoin Crab', "Witch's Cauldron"]
