starter: []
rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "“Protection from Demons and from Dragons” means the following: -- Baneslayer Angel can\'t be blocked by creatures with the creature type Demon or the creature type Dragon. -- Baneslayer Angel can\'t be targeted abilities from sources with the creature type Demon or the creature type Dragon, or by spells with either of those types. -- All damage that would be dealt to Baneslayer Angel by sources with the creature type Demon or the creature type Dragon is prevented. -- Baneslayer Angel can\'t be enchanted by Auras or equipped by artifacts that have somehow gotten the creature type Demon or the creature type Dragon."}]', "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'If you choose to find only one basic land card, you put it onto the battlefield tapped.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "Scry appears on some spells and abilities with one or more targets. If all of the spell or ability\'s targets are illegal when it tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t scry."}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'When you scry, you may put all the cards you look at back on top of your library, you may put all of those cards on the bottom of your library, or you may put some of those cards on top and the rest of them on the bottom.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'You choose how to order cards returned to your library after scrying no matter where you put them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, that means you\'ll scry last. For others, that means you\'ll scry and then perform other actions."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "Any spell you cast that doesn\'t have the type creature will cause prowess to trigger. If a spell has multiple types, and one of those types is creature (such as an artifact creature), casting it won\'t cause prowess to trigger. Playing a land also won\'t cause prowess to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "Once it triggers, prowess isn\'t connected to the spell that caused it to trigger. If that spell is countered, prowess will still resolve."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'Prowess goes on the stack on top of the spell that caused it to trigger. It will resolve before that spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "You draw a card and discard a card all while Jeskai Elder\'s ability is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions."}]', "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You choose the color as Feat of Resistance resolves.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': \'If you choose to put permanent cards with morph onto the battlefield with the third ability, you must put them onto the battlefield face up.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "Ugin, the Spirit Dragon is not a Dragon card; that is, he doesn\'t have the creature type Dragon. Spells and abilities that refer to Dragon cards or Dragons don\'t apply to Ugin."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'A permanent card is an artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If a permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The mana value of a token that isn\'t a copy of another object is 0. A token that is a copy of another object has the same mana cost as that object."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': "Battle-Rattle Shaman\'s ability triggers when the beginning of combat step starts during each of your turns. It resolves before you declare attackers."}, {\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability causes your turn to have multiple combat phases, Battle Rattle Shaman\'s ability triggers during each of them."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "You can\'t activate Tavern Swindler\'s ability if your life total is less than 3. You can activate it if your life total is exactly 3, but it\'s probably a bad idea. You\'ll lose the game before the ability resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Dub can enchant a creature that\'s already a Knight. It will get +2/+2 and have first strike, but it won\'t benefit from becoming a Knight."}]', "[{'date': '2019-04-18', 'text': 'This free card preview was provided to Scryfall by Wizards of the Coast. Thank you!'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "Makeshift Battalion and the other attacking creatures don\'t have to be attacking the same player or planeswalker."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "Once Makeshift Battalion\'s ability has triggered, it doesn\'t matter how many creatures are still attacking when that ability resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Scorching Dragonfire\'s replacement effect will exile the target creature or planeswalker if it would die this turn for any reason, not just due to lethal damage. It applies to the target creature or planeswalker even if Scorching Dragonfire deals no damage to it (most likely due to a prevention effect)."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Scorching Dragonfire\'s replacement effect will exile the target creature or planeswalker if it would die this turn for any reason, not just due to lethal damage."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "A copy is created even if the spell that caused Double Vision\'s ability to trigger has been countered by the time that ability resolves. The copy resolves before the original spell."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Double Vision\'s ability will copy any instant or sorcery spell, not just one with targets."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If the spell that\'s copied has an X whose value was determined as it was cast, the copy has the same value of X."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If the spell that\'s copied is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), the copy will have the same mode or modes. You can\'t choose different ones."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you cast an instant or sorcery spell before Double Vision enters the battlefield during the same turn, its ability can\'t trigger that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The copy that Double Vision\'s ability creates is created on the stack, so it\'s not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The copy will have the same targets as the spell it\'s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. The new targets must be legal."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "You can\'t choose to pay any additional costs for the copy. However, effects based on any additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy too."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "A creature spell that doesn\'t have flying won\'t cost less even if an effect will cause the creature to have flying once on the battlefield. This is also true if the creature spell itself has an ability that gives it flying once on the battlefield under certain conditions, even if those conditions are true."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The cost reduction applies only to generic mana in the cost of creature spells with flying you cast. For example, if you cast a second Watcher of the Spheres, its cost won\'t be reduced below {W}{U}."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Watcher of the Spheres). The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "A legendary permanent that is put into a graveyard because of the “legend rule” isn\'t sacrificed."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Havoc Jester\'s ability is a triggered ability, not an activated ability. It doesn\'t allow you to sacrifice a permanent whenever you want; rather, you need some other way of sacrificing permanents."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Havoc Jester\'s ability triggers when you sacrifice it. If you sacrifice other permanents at the same time, it triggers for them as well."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you sacrifice a permanent as part of casting a spell or activating an ability, Havoc Jester\'s ability will resolve before that spell or ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "A planeswalker with indestructible still loses loyalty counters as it\'s dealt damage and will still be put into its owner\'s graveyard if its loyalty reaches 0."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The set of permanents affected by Heroic Intervention is determined as the spell resolves. Permanents you begin to control later in the turn won\'t gain hexproof and indestructible."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "A battle with indestructible still loses defense counters as it\'s dealt damage. If it\'s a Siege, it will still be exiled when the last defense counter is removed from it, and its controller may still cast it transformed without paying its mana cost."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "A player who has a card in hand can\'t choose to lose 3 life instead of discarding a card."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "As Liliana\'s first ability resolves, first the player whose turn it is chooses a card in hand without revealing it, then each other player in turn order does the same. Then all the chosen cards are discarded at the same time. Finally, each opponent who couldn\'t discard a card loses 3 life."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Creatures put onto the battlefield with Liliana\'s emblem gain haste indefinitely."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you have no cards in hand, you just don\'t discard anything. You don\'t lose 3 life. Other players still discard if able."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, any permanents you control from Liliana\'s emblem are exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The value of X is determined only as Liliana\'s second ability resolves. Once that happens, the value of X won\'t change later in the turn even if the number of cards in your graveyard changes."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "A token\'s name is the concatenation of its creature types assigned at creation. This means that the tokens created by Goblin Wizardry are named Goblin Wizard. These tokens have the same name as the card Goblin Wizard and so can be affected by things that ask players to choose a card name, such as Runed Halo."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Abilities that create replacement effects, such as a permanent entering the battlefield tapped or with counters on it, can\'t be countered. Abilities that apply “as [this creature] enters the battlefield” are also replacement effects and can\'t be countered."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'Activated abilities are written in the form “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keyword abilities (such as equip) are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder texts.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any “As [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[This creature] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the copied creature will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If any of the targets become illegal, the remaining targets are affected as appropriate.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If the copied creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If the copied creature is copying something else, the token enters the battlefield as whatever that creature is copying.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If the copied creature is itself a token, the token created by Sublime Epiphany copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you choose more than one mode, you perform the modes in the order specified. For example, if you choose to counter target spell, return target nonland permanent to its owner\'s hand, and have target player draw a card, that permanent will be on the battlefield while that spell is countered (and may modify, affect, or trigger on that event) but will not be on the battlefield while that player draws a card."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you choose the third and fourth modes and target the same creature you control both times, you\'ll return it and then create a token that\'s a copy of it, using its copiable values as it last appeared on the battlefield. This is because the legality of targets is checked only as the spell begins to resolve, before any actions are performed."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you counter a delayed triggered ability that triggered at the beginning of the “next” occurrence of a specified step or phase, that ability won\'t trigger again the following time that phase or step occurs."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Sublime Epiphany\'s second mode can\'t counter an activated or triggered mana ability. An activated mana ability is one that adds mana to a player\'s mana pool as it resolves, doesn\'t have a target, and isn\'t a loyalty ability. A triggered mana ability is one that adds mana to a player\'s mana pool and triggers on an activated mana ability."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Sublime Epiphany\'s second mode counters only activated and triggered abilities already on the stack. It doesn\'t prevent abilities from being activated or from triggering later in the turn, and it has no effect on static abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The token copies exactly what is printed on the creature and nothing else (unless that creature is a token or is copying something else; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and/or Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that changed its power, toughness, types, color, and so on."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Triggered abilities use the word “when,” “whenever,” or “at.” They\'re often written as “[Trigger condition], [effect].” Some keyword abilities (such as prowess) are triggered abilities and will have “when,” “whenever,” or “at” in their reminder text."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "You can\'t choose any one mode more than once."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Activated abilities contain a colon. They\'re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keyword abilities are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If Conspicuous Snoop gains a set of linked activated abilities (for example, one ability that exiles a card and another that refers to the card “exiled with” the object), that link only lasts as long as Conspicuous Snoop has those abilities. If it loses the abilities and then regains them, the link is lost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If an activated ability of Goblin card on top of your library references the card it\'s printed on by name, treat Conspicuous Snoop\'s instance of that ability as though it referenced Conspicuous Snoop by name instead. For instance, if Conspicuous Snoop has Brash Taunter\'s ability, Conspicuous Snoop fights, not Brash Taunter."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If the top card of your library changes while you\'re casting a spell, playing a land, or activating an ability, you don\'t reveal the new top card until you finish doing so. This means that if you cast the top card of your library, you can\'t look at the next one until you\'re done paying for that spell. While the top card isn\'t revealed, Conspicuous Snoop doesn\'t have any abilities of that card."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'You must follow the normal timing permissions and restrictions of the Goblin spells you cast from your library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'You still pay all costs for a Goblin spell you cast from your library, including additional costs. You may also pay alternative costs.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "After activating Basri\'s second ability, a creature that attacks gets a +1/+1 counter before blockers are chosen."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Basri\'s last ability affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won\'t get +2/+2 or gain flying."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Although the Bird is an attacking creature, it was never declared as an attacking creature. This means that abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks won\'t trigger when it enters the battlefield attacking."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Any effects that say that the Bird can\'t attack (such as that of Propaganda) affect only the declaration of attackers. They won\'t stop the Bird token from entering the battlefield attacking."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "You choose which player or planeswalker the Bird token is attacking. It doesn\'t have to be attacking the same player or planeswalker that Falconer Adept is attacking."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Although the Soldiers are attacking creatures, they were never declared as attacking creatures. This means that abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks won\'t trigger when the Soldiers enter the battlefield attacking."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Any effects that say that the Soldiers can\'t attack (such as that of Propaganda) affect only the declaration of attackers. They won\'t stop the Soldier tokens from entering the battlefield attacking."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The Soldier token created by Basri\'s last ability can\'t attack during the turn you create it unless it gains haste somehow."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The delayed triggered ability of Basri\'s second ability triggers if any nontoken creatures attack, and it counts how many nontoken creatures attacked. Attacking nontoken creatures that leave combat before the triggered ability resolves are counted. Token creatures that are attacking don\'t stop the ability from triggering and aren\'t counted."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "You choose which player or planeswalker each Soldier token is attacking. They don\'t have to be attacking the same players or planeswalkers that the nontoken creatures are attacking, and they don\'t have to be attacking the same player or planeswalker as each other."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Any counters on creatures that die or effects that affect them until end of turn won\'t apply to those cards in their owner\'s graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Carrion Grub\'s first ability applies only while it is on the battlefield. In all other zones, its power is 0."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Any “at the beginning of the next end step” triggered abilities won\'t get the chance to trigger that turn because the end step is skipped. Those abilities will trigger at the beginning of the end step of the next turn."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Ending the turn this way means the following things happen in order: 1) All spells and abilities on the stack are exiled. This includes spells and abilities that can\'t be countered. 2) If there are any attacking and blocking creatures, they\'re removed from combat. 3) State-based actions are checked. No player gets priority, and no triggered abilities are put onto the stack. 4) The current phase and/or step ends. The game skips straight to the cleanup step. 5) The cleanup step happens in its entirety."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If any triggered abilities do trigger during this process, they\'re put onto the stack during the cleanup step. If this happens, players will have a chance to cast spells and activate abilities, then there will be another cleanup step before the turn is over."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Though other spells and abilities that are exiled won\'t get a chance to resolve, they don\'t count as being countered."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Discontinuity). The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "As Bad Deal resolves, first you draw two cards. Then the next opponent in turn order (or, if it\'s an opponent\'s turn, the opponent whose turn it is) chooses two cards in hand without revealing them, then each other opponent in turn order does the same. All the chosen cards are discarded at the same time. Then each player loses 2 life."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'Each player loses 2 life, including you, regardless of how many cards they draw or discard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If an opponent has just one card in hand, that player discards just one card. Other opponents still discard two if able.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Bad Deal causes each team to lose 4 life. Your teammate doesn\'t draw or discard any cards."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'You draw just two cards no matter how many opponents you have.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "As Goremand\'s triggered ability resolves, first the next opponent in turn order (or, if it\'s an opponent\'s turn, the opponent whose turn it is) chooses a creature they control, then each other opponent in turn order does the same knowing the choices made before them. Then all the chosen creatures are sacrificed at the same time."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "As Kinetic Augur\'s triggered ability resolves, you choose whether to discard zero, one, or two cards, discard them, and draw that many. You can\'t discard one card, draw a card, then choose to discard again."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Kinetic Augur\'s power works in all zones, not just on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Azusa\'s ability is cumulative with other effects that allow you to play additional lands, such as that of Song of Creation (from the Ikoria: Lair of Behemoths set)."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Barrin\'s last ability checks the entire turn, even before Barrin was on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If a permanent wasn\'t put into your hand from the battlefield before your end step begins, Barrin\'s ability doesn\'t trigger at all."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If a token is returned to your hand, it\'s put there before it ceases to exist."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The permanent that was returned to your hand doesn\'t have to still be there."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'You draw only one card, no matter how many permanents were put into your hand from the battlefield during that turn.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Basri\'s Lieutenant can be the target of its own enters-the-battlefield triggered ability."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If Basri\'s Lieutenant dies at the same time as other creatures, its last ability will trigger for any of the creatures that had a +1/+1 counter on it, including itself."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If a creature with +1/+1 counters on it receives a greater or equal number of -1/-1 counters and this causes it to be destroyed by lethal damage or put into its owner\'s graveyard for having 0 or less toughness, the last ability triggers. This is because the ability checks the creature as it last existed on the battlefield, and it still had those counters on it at that point."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The second triggered ability of Basri\'s Lieutenant triggers just once if the dying creature has +1/+1 counters on it, no matter how many of those counters it has."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Because Experimental Overload is still on the stack while it\'s resolving, it doesn\'t count towards the value of X."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The value of X is determined only as Experimental Overload resolves. The Weird\'s power and toughness don\'t change if the number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard changes."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "You exile Experimental Overload even if you don\'t return a card to your hand."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Because Frantic Inventory is still on the stack while it\'s resolving, it doesn\'t count towards the number of cards you draw."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Because Teferi\'s Ageless Insight is legendary, it\'s unlikely that one player will control two. However, if that happens, each card that player would draw after the first will result in four cards being drawn. If they control three, they draw eight cards, and so on."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If a spell or ability causes you to put a card into your hand without specifically using the word "draw," it\\\'s not a card drawn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If two or more replacement effects would apply to a card-drawing event, the player drawing the card chooses the order in which to apply them.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Because Vito\'s first ability doesn\'t deal damage, you won\'t gain life when it resolves if Vito has lifelink."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Each creature with lifelink dealing combat damage causes a separate life-gaining event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, Vito\'s first ability will trigger twice and you may choose a different opponent for each trigger. However, if a single creature you control with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), the ability will trigger only once."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If an ability triggers whenever an opponent loses life and causes you to gain life, such as the ability of Exquisite Blood, this will loop until either you win the game or a player takes an action to break the loop.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you gain an amount of life “for each” of something, that life is gained as one event and Vito\'s first ability triggers only once."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, life gained by your teammate won\'t cause the ability to trigger, even though it caused your team\'s life total to increase."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Because it\'s a loyalty ability, Chandra\'s last ability isn\'t a mana ability. It can be activated only any time you could cast a sorcery. It uses the stack and can be responded to."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you don\'t play the exiled cards, they remain exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you have no cards in hand, you still exile three cards while resolving Chandra\'s first ability and you may play them this turn."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "You must follow the normal timing permissions and restrictions for the exiled cards for Chandra\'s first and last abilities. If one is a land, you can\'t play it unless you have land plays available."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "You\'ll still pay all costs for a spell cast this way, including additional costs. You may also pay alternative costs if any are available."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Because the effect of Destructive Tampering\'s second mode doesn\'t change the characteristics of any permanents, the set of creatures affected by it is constantly updated. Creatures without flying that enter the battlefield later in the turn won\'t be able to block."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Canopy Stalker\'s triggered ability counts itself, as well as any other creatures that die before the triggered ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If each creature the defending player controls can\'t block for any reason (such as being tapped), then Canopy Stalker isn\'t blocked. If there\'s a cost associated with blocking Canopy Stalker, the defending player isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to be blocked in that case either."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If your life total is brought to 0 or less at the same time that Canopy Stalker is dealt lethal damage, you lose the game before its last ability goes on the stack.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'Only one creature is required to block Canopy Stalker. Other creatures may also block it, and are free to block other creatures or not block at all.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'The defending player, not you, chooses which creature blocks Canopy Stalker.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Casting Demonic Embrace with the permission granted by its last ability doesn\'t change when you can cast it."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If another effect gives you permission to cast Demonic Embrace from your graveyard, you don\'t pay the additional cost imposed by its last ability if you use that permission."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If the enchanted creature dies during your turn, you receive priority before any other player does. If you\'re allowed to cast Demonic Embrace at that time, you may do so before any player can attempt to remove it from your graveyard."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Chandra\'s Incinerator counts all noncombat damage dealt to your opponents, not the difference in their life totals since the turn began. For example, if an opponent was dealt 5 noncombat damage but gained 3 life, Chandra\'s Incinerator still costs just {R}."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Combat damage is the damage that\'s dealt automatically by attacking and blocking creatures. Any other damage is noncombat damage, even if it\'s dealt during a combat phase by an attacking or blocking creature."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, Chandra\'s Incinerator counts damage dealt to opponents who have lost the game."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The cost reduction applies only to generic mana in the cost of Chandra\'s Incinerator. It can\'t reduce the {R} requirement."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Chandra\'s last ability doesn\'t change when you may cast those spells. For example, you can\'t cast a sorcery spell from your hand during combat."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell “without paying its mana cost,” you can\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, those must be paid to cast the spell."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you have no cards in hand while Chandra\'s last ability is resolving, you still draw seven cards and may cast spells from your hand without paying their mana costs this turn."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you wish to cast the target card, you must cast it while Chandra\'s second ability is resolving. You can\'t cast it later in the turn."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Chandra\'s first ability causes the opposing team to lose 6 life."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "You must pay the costs for the spell you wish to cast with Chandra\'s second ability. If that spell has any alternative costs, you may pay those."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Chrome Replicator\'s ability creates just one Construct, no matter how many namesake pairs of permanents you control."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control two nonland, nontoken permanents with the same name immediately after Chrome Replicator enters the battlefield, its ability doesn\'t trigger. If you don\'t control two as the ability resolves, you don\'t create a token. They don\'t have to be the same pair, however."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Combat damage is the damage that\'s dealt automatically by attacking and blocking creatures. Any other damage is noncombat damage, even if it\'s dealt during a combat phase by an attacking or blocking creature."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The ability of Chandra\'s Pyreling triggers just once per event for each opponent who is dealt noncombat damage by a source you control, regardless of how much damage that player is dealt. For example, if a sorcery you control deals 2 damage to each opponent in a four-player game, the ability will trigger three times."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Conclave Mentor\'s first ability doesn\'t apply to itself if it\'s somehow entering the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If a creature you control would enter the battlefield with a number of +1/+1 counters on it, it enters with that many plus one instead.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If two or more effects attempt to modify how many counters would be put onto a creature you control, you choose the order to apply those effects, no matter who controls the sources of those effects.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If you control two Conclave Mentors, the number of +1/+1 counters put on a creature is two plus the original number. Three Conclave Mentors add three, and so on.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Use Conclave Mentor\'s power as it last existed on the battlefield to determine how much life you gain."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Crash Through affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won\'t gain trample."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "You may cast Crash Through even if you control no creatures. If you control no creatures as the spell resolves, you\'ll just draw a card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Each Shrine has an ability that counts the number of Shrines you control. These abilities include the Shrine they\'re printed on."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Shrines count only enchantments with the subtype Shrine. Other cards with “shrine” in their name (such as Jungle Shrine, Luxa River Shrine, and Nantuko Shrine) don\'t count."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The cost reduction applies only to generic mana in the cost of the activated ability. It can\'t reduce the {W} requirement."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Each Shrine has an ability that counts the number of Shrines you control. These abilities include the Shrine they\'re printed on."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Shrines count only enchantments with the subtype Shrine. Other cards with “shrine” in their name (such as Jungle Shrine, Luxa River Shrine, and Nantuko Shrine) don\'t count."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Each Shrine has an ability that counts the number of Shrines you control. These abilities include the Shrine they\'re printed on."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If Sanctum of Calm Waters leaves the battlefield while its ability is on the stack, you may control no Shrines as the ability resolves. If so, you may choose to draw zero cards and discard one, or you may choose not to draw zero cards and not discard a card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Shrines count only enchantments with the subtype Shrine. Other cards with “shrine” in their name (such as Jungle Shrine, Luxa River Shrine, and Nantuko Shrine) don\'t count."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'You draw X cards and discard a card all while the triggered ability is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Each Shrine has an ability that counts the number of Shrines you control. These abilities include the Shrine they\'re printed on."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If Sanctum of Stone Fangs leaves the battlefield while its ability is on the stack, you may control no Shrines as the ability resolves. In that case, no player gains or loses any life.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Sanctum of Stone Fangs causes the opposing team to lose twice X life and you to gain X life.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Shrines count only enchantments with the subtype Shrine. Other cards with “shrine” in their name (such as Jungle Shrine, Luxa River Shrine, and Nantuko Shrine) don\'t count."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Each opponent loses just 3 life, no matter how much life you\'ve gained past 3 life."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you haven\'t gained 3 life by the time your end step begins, Indulging Patrician\'s last ability won\'t trigger at all."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Indulging Patrician\'s last ability causes the opposing team to lose 6 life."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Indulging Patrician\'s last ability looks at how much life you\'ve gained in the turn, even if it wasn\'t on the battlefield when you gained life. It doesn\'t care if you also lost life, even if you lost more life than you gained."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Frost Breath can target tapped creatures. If a targeted creature is already tapped when the spell resolves, that creature just remains tapped and doesn\'t untap during its controller\'s next untap step."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Furious Rise\'s ability has you exile only one card, no matter how many creatures with power 4 or greater you control beyond the first."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Furious Rise\'s effect doesn\'t change when you can play the exiled card. For example, if you exile a sorcery card, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty. If you exile a land card, you can\'t play it unless you have land plays available."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If Furious Rise leaves the battlefield before you play the most recently exiled card, you can play that card for as long as it remains exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control a creature with power 4 or greater as your end step begins, Furious Rise\'s ability doesn\'t trigger. If you don\'t control one as the ability resolves, it has no effect. It doesn\'t have to be the same creature at both times, however."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Playing an exiled card causes it to leave exile. You can\'t play it multiple times."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Gadrak\'s last ability counts creatures that died during the entire turn, even ones that died before Gadrak entered the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'Once Gadrak has attacked, it will remain an attacking creature even if you no longer control four or more artifacts.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Gaining control of a creature doesn\'t cause you to gain control of any Auras or Equipment attached to it."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Traitorous Greed tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. You won\'t add two mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Traitorous Greed can target any creature, even one that\'s untapped or one you already control."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Gaining control of a permanent doesn\'t cause you to gain control of any Auras or Equipment attached to it. They\'ll remain attached, but an Aura\'s effect that affects “you” still affects its controller rather than you, the controller of an Equipment can move it during their next main phase, and so on."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The middle ability of Enthralling Hold affects only the choice of target as the spell is cast. If the creature becomes untapped before the spell resolves, it still resolves. If a player is allowed to change the spell\'s target while it\'s on the stack, they may choose an untapped creature. If you put Enthralling Hold onto the battlefield without casting it, you may attach it to an untapped creature."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Garruk\'s last ability affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won\'t gain the ability."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If either creature is an illegal target as Garruk\'s second ability tries to resolve, the creature you control won\'t deal damage to any creature."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "When assigning combat damage, you choose for each creature whether you want to assign its damage to the creature blocking it, or if you want to assign it to the player or planeswalker the creature is attacking. You can\'t split the damage assignment between them."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Garruk\'s second ability gives him only one loyalty counter, no matter how many opponents control how many more creatures than you do."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If Garruk has only two loyalty counters, activating his second loyalty ability results in him dying before it resolves. He won\'t be there to get a loyalty counter."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If the creature you put onto the battlefield with Garruk\'s emblem\'s ability during your end step has an ability that triggers at the beginning of your end step, it won\'t trigger during that end step."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Gnarled Sage gets +0/+2 just once, no matter how many cards you\'ve drawn past the second."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If Gnarled Sage gains vigilance after it has attacked, it won\'t become untapped."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability causes you to put a card into your hand without specifically using the word “draw,” it\'s not a card drawn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Griffin Aerie\'s ability looks at how much life you\'ve gained in the turn, even if it wasn\'t on the battlefield when you gained life. It doesn\'t care if you also lost life, even if you lost more life than you gained."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you haven\'t gained 3 life by the time your end step begins, Griffin Aerie\'s ability won\'t trigger at all."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "You create just one Griffin token, no matter how much life you\'ve gained past 3 life."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Hexproof from black means that Garruk\'s Harbinger can\'t be the target of black spells your opponents control or abilities your opponents control of black sources."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If Garruk\'s Harbinger deals damage to a planeswalker greater than their loyalty or to a player greater than their life total, you look at a number of cards equal to that full amount of damage dealt, not just that loyalty or life total."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Hexproof from blue means that Sporeweb Weaver can\'t be the target of blue spells your opponents control or abilities your opponents control of blue sources."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If your life total is brought to 0 or less at the same time that Sporeweb Weaver is dealt damage, you lose the game before the ability goes on the stack.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Sporeweb Weaver\'s last ability triggers even if the damage causes it to die."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Sporeweb Weaver\'s last ability triggers just once, no matter how many things deal how much damage to it at once (most likely because two or more creatures blocked it)."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Hooded Blightfang\'s triggered abilities trigger when it attacks and when it deals damage to a planeswalker, as long as it still has deathtouch."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Hooded Blightfang\'s middle ability causes the opposing team to lose 2 life and you to gain 1 life."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If Archfiend\'s Vessel leaves the battlefield while its triggered ability is on the stack, you can\'t exile it from the zone it\'s put into, so you won\'t create a Demon."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If Drowsing Tyrannodon\'s power is raised to 4 or greater, it will allow itself to attack."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'Once Drowsing Tyrannodon has attacked, it will remain an attacking creature even if you no longer control a creature with power 4 or greater.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If Mazemind Tome leaves the battlefield while its triggered ability is on the stack, you can\'t exile it from the zone it\'s put into."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If Ornery Dilophosaur\'s power is raised to 4 or greater, its ability triggers when it attacks."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control a creature with power 4 or greater immediately after Ornery Dilophosaur attacks, its ability doesn\'t trigger. If you don\'t control one as the ability resolves, it has no effect. It doesn\'t have to be the same creature at both times, however."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Once Ornery Dilophosaur\'s ability has resolved, it keeps +2/+2 for the rest of the turn even if you no longer control a creature with power 4 or greater."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'Ornery Dilophosaur gets just +2/+2, no matter how many creatures you control with power 4 or greater.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If Riddleform becomes a creature the same turn it enters the battlefield, you can\'t attack with it unless it gains haste."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Riddleform\'s first ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger but after targets for that spell are chosen. It will resolve even if that spell is countered."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If Silversmote Ghoul isn\'t in your graveyard as your end step begins, its first ability won\'t trigger at all."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you haven\'t gained 3 life by the time your end step begins, Silversmote Ghoul\'s first ability won\'t trigger at all."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Silversmote Ghoul\'s first ability looks at how much life you\'ve gained in the turn, even if it wasn\'t on the battlefield or in your graveyard when you gained life. It doesn\'t care if you also lost life, even if you lost more life than you gained."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If Thieves\' Guild Enforcer gains deathtouch only after dealing damage (most likely because another creature was dealt lethal damage at the same time that Thieves\' Guild Enforcer dealt damage), the damage it dealt won\'t be from a source with deathtouch."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Thieves\' Guild Enforcer gets +2/+1 just once, no matter how many opponents have eight or more cards in their graveyard and no matter how many cards they have past the eighth."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If a card in a player\'s graveyard has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell with Idol of Endurance\'s last ability, it becomes a new object. If it returns to exile, it\'s no longer exiled with Idol of Endurance, and won\'t be returned to your graveyard once Idol of Endurance leaves the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell “without paying its mana cost,” you can\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, those must be paid to cast the spell."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The exiled cards return to your graveyard immediately after Idol of Endurance leaves the battlefield. Any cards that had left exile before then (most likely because they were cast with Idol of Endurance\'s second ability) remain in their current zone."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The last ability of Idol of Endurance doesn\'t change when you may cast those creature spells. Normally this means during your main phase while the stack is empty, but you can cast a creature spell with flash at other times."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If a creature affected by the Pirate token can\'t attack for any reason (such as being tapped or having come under that player\'s control that turn), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having it attack, the player isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack in that case either."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases (such as that of Pursued Whale), then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If a creature an opponent controls dies at the same time as Massacre Wurm, Massacre Wurm\'s last ability triggers for that creature."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If your life total is brought to 0 or less at the same time that a creature an opponent controls is dealt lethal damage, you lose the game before Massacre Wurm\'s last ability goes on the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Massacre Wurm\'s first ability affects only creatures your opponents control at the time it resolves. Creatures they begin to control later in the turn won\'t get -2/-2."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Massacre Wurm\'s triggered ability triggers if a creature an opponent controls dies for any reason, including from its first ability reducing its toughness to 0, as long as Massacre Wurm remains on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If a creature didn\'t die before your end step begins, Sabertooth Mauler\'s ability doesn\'t trigger at all. The creature may have died before Sabertooth Mauler entered the battlefield, however."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'The triggered ability triggers just once, no matter how many creatures died this turn.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If a creature didn\'t die before your end step begins, the ability of Liliana\'s Scrounger doesn\'t trigger at all. The creature may have died before Liliana\'s Scrounger entered the battlefield, however."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you control more than one Liliana planeswalker, you choose which one receives a loyalty counter as the ability of Liliana\'s Scrounger resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'The triggered ability triggers just once, no matter how many creatures died this turn.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If a creature didn\'t die before your end step begins, the ability of Twinblade Assassins doesn\'t trigger at all. The creature may have died before Twinblade Assassins entered the battlefield, however."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'The triggered ability triggers just once, no matter how many creatures died this turn.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If a creature didn\'t die before your end step begins, the last ability of Liliana\'s Devotee doesn\'t trigger at all. The creature may have died before Liliana\'s Devotee entered the battlefield, however."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'The triggered ability triggers just once, no matter how many creatures died this turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "While resolving the triggered ability, you can\'t pay more than {1}{B} to get more than one Zombie token."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If a creature is entering the battlefield under your control, consider static abilities to determine whether its power is 4 or greater. Spells, activated abilities, and triggered abilities can\'t be used to raise the creature\'s power in time to have Garruk\'s Uprising\'s last ability trigger or to lower it in time to stop it from triggering."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control a creature with power 4 or greater immediately after Garruk\'s Uprising enters the battlefield, its first ability won\'t trigger. If you don\'t control one as the ability resolves, you don\'t draw a card. They don\'t have to be the same creature both times, however."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Once the last ability of Garruk\'s Uprising has triggered, lowering the power of the creature won\'t stop you from drawing a card."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The first ability of Garruk\'s Uprising has you draw just one card, no matter how many creatures you control with power 4 or greater."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If a creature\'s power is somehow less than 0, it subtracts from the total power of your other creatures. If the total power of your creatures is 0 or less, the cost remains {10}{R}{R}."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Once you begin to cast Volcanic Salvo, players can\'t take other actions until you\'ve finished casting it. Notably, they can\'t try to change the total power of your creatures."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The cost reduction applies only to generic mana in the cost of Volcanic Salvo. It can\'t reduce the {R}{R} requirement."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'The total cost to cast Volcanic Salvo is locked in before you pay that cost. For example, if you control three 2/2 creatures, including one you can sacrifice to add {C} to your mana pool, the total cost is {4}{R}{R}. Then you can sacrifice the creature when you activate mana abilities just before paying the cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Volcanic Salvo). The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "You can\'t target the same creature or planeswalker twice with Volcanic Salvo to deal 12 damage to it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If a spell is returned to its owner\'s hand, it\'s removed from the stack and thus will not resolve. The spell isn\'t countered; it just no longer exists. This works against a spell that can\'t be countered."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability causes a player to put a card into their hand without specifically using the word “draw,” it\'s not a card drawn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability causes you to put a card into your hand without specifically using the word “draw,” it\'s not a card drawn."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The triggered ability can trigger only once each turn. It doesn\'t matter Mystic Skyfish was on the battlefield when the first card was drawn. If it\'s not on the battlefield when the second card is drawn, the ability can\'t trigger at all that turn. It won\'t trigger when the third or fourth card is drawn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability causes you to put a card into your hand without specifically using the word “draw,” it\'s not a card drawn."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "While resolving Tolarian Kraken\'s ability, you can\'t pay more than {1} to tap or untap more than one creature."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If an effect copies See the Truth while it\'s on the stack, the copy wasn\'t cast at all, so you only get one of the cards it has you look at."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "See the Truth doesn\'t give you permission to cast it from a zone other than your hand. You\'ll need to find another way to do so."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If an effect instructs you to “double” a creature\'s power, that creature gets +X/+0, where X is its power as that effect begins to apply. If its power is negative, instead it gets -X/-0 where X is how far below 0 its power is. The value of X won\'t change if another effect alters the creature\'s power later in the turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If damage that a source would deal to you can\'t be prevented, you still put an incarnation counter on Nine Lives."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If more than one source deals damage to you at once, prevent the damage from each of them and put that many incarnation counters on Nine Lives, even if this causes more than nine incarnation counters to be on Nine Lives. Leave it to cats to abuse loopholes.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If you counter the first triggered ability or otherwise remove it from the stack, it will just trigger again immediately if Nine Lives still has nine or more incarnation counters on it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Once the first triggered ability is on the stack, it won\'t trigger again, even if more damage is prevented and more incarnation counters are put onto it."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'The last ability of Nine Lives triggers no matter how it leaves the battlefield.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If do you choose targets and each target creature is an illegal target by the time Basri\'s Aegis tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. You won\'t search for Basri. If just one target is still legal, however, you do put a +1/+1 counter on it and search for Basri."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "You can cast Basri\'s Aegis without any target creatures. You\'ll just search for Basri, Devoted Paladin."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If either creature is an illegal target as Hunter\'s Edge tries to resolve, the creature you control won\'t deal damage."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If the creature you don\'t control is an illegal target as Hunter\'s Edge tries to resolve but the creature you control is a legal target, you just put a +1/+1 counter on the creature you control."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "You can\'t cast Hunter\'s Edge unless you choose both a creature you control and a creature you don\'t control as targets."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If the Shrine you put onto the battlefield with Sanctum of All\'s first ability during your upkeep has an ability that triggers at the beginning of your upkeep, it won\'t trigger during that upkeep."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Triggered abilities use the word “when,” “whenever,” or “at.” They\'re often written as “[Trigger condition], [effect].” Replacement effects, using “instead” or “as,” aren\'t affected. Activated abilities (written as “Cost: Effect”) of Shrines you control are also not affected."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If the creature Rousing Read would enchant is an illegal target by the time the Aura spell resolves, the entire spell doesn\'t resolve. It won\'t enter the battlefield, so its ability won\'t trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If the creature Setessan Training would enchant is an illegal target by the time the Aura spell resolves, the entire spell doesn\'t resolve. It won\'t enter the battlefield, so its ability won\'t trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If the creature that blocked Gloom Sower leaves the battlefield before Gloom Sower\'s triggered ability resolves, the player who controlled it before it left is the player who loses 2 life."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If the creature you control is an illegal target as Primal Might tries to resolve, no creature gets +X/+X. If that creature is a legal target but the creature you don\'t control isn\'t, it still gets +X/+X."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If you choose two target creatures and either target is an illegal target as Primal Might tries to resolve, neither creature will deal or be dealt damage.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'You can cast Primal Might targeting only the creature you control.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'You can cast Primal Might with 0 as the value of X to just have the two target creatures fight.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If the enchanted creature can\'t attack for any reason (such as being tapped or having come under that player\'s control that turn), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having it attack, the player isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack in that case either."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If the spell is an illegal target when Rewind tries to resolve, perhaps because it was countered by another spell or ability, Rewind won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t untap any lands."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Rewind targets only a spell. It doesn\'t target any lands. The lands are chosen as Rewind resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "You can choose up to four lands, no matter who controls any of them. Those lands untap once. You can\'t choose one land and have it untap four times, for example."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If the target card is an illegal target when the ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. No +1/+1 counter will be put on Scavenging Ooze and you won\'t gain life. Notably, this means that if you activate Scavenging Ooze\'s ability multiple times targeting the same creature card, only the first instance of the ability to resolve will have any effect."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Defiant Strike tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. You won\'t draw a card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Liliana\'s Scorn tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. You won\'t search for Liliana, Death Mage. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), you do search for Liliana."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Liliana\'s second ability tries to resolve, the ability won\'t resolve. No player loses 2 life. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), its controller does lose 2 life."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Turn to Slag tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. You won\'t destroy any Equipment."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'Turn to Slag can target a creature that has no Equipment attached to it.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If the target creature\'s power is greater than 2 as the first activated ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn\'t resolve. However, if instead the creature\'s power is raised above 2 after the ability resolves, it still can\'t be blocked that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Once Subira\'s last ability resolves, check to see if the delayed triggered ability should trigger based on the power of the creatures immediately after damage is dealt, not based on their power as the ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Once a creature with power 2 or less has been blocked, Subira\'s middle ability won\'t cause it to become unblocked."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "You can activate Subira\'s last ability if your hand is empty. You simply discard zero cards."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If the target nonland permanent is an illegal target by the time Secure the Scene tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. No player will create a Soldier token."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If the target permanent is an illegal target by the time Angelic Ascension tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. No player will create an Angel token."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you control four or more lands, the basic land doesn\'t enter the battlefield untapped; it enters tapped and then you untap it."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'The land that you put onto the battlefield will be counted when determining whether you control four or more lands, but Fabled Passage will not.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you create a Beast token, that token can\'t attack or block during the same combat, even if it gains haste."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Players can cast spells after Elder Gargaroth\'s triggered ability has resolved but before blockers are declared (if it\'s attacking) or before combat damage is dealt (if it\'s blocking)."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control another creature with power 4 or greater immediately after Turret Ogre enters the battlefield, its ability doesn\'t trigger, even if you can raise a creature\'s power right away. If you control no other creature with power 4 or greater as the ability resolves, nothing happens. These don\'t have to be the same creature, though."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Turret Ogre\'s ability causes the opposing team to lose 4 life."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Turret Ogre\'s ability doesn\'t deal more than 2 damage to each opponent if you control more than one other creature with power 4 or greater."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you don\'t draw the card you reveal, it remains on top of your library."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'The card you reveal will be the card you draw, if applicable.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Caged Zombie\'s ability causes the opposing team to lose 4 life."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Storm Caller\'s ability causes the opposing team to lose 4 life."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, you can activate the ability only if your team\'s life total is at least 7 more than your team\'s starting life total."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Obsessive Stitcher can\'t be the target of its last ability."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "You draw a card and discard a card all while Obsessive Stitcher\'s first ability is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Once Tome Anima has become blocked, it won\'t become unblocked if you draw a second card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Once you begin activating Celestial Enforcer\'s ability, players can\'t take any other actions until you\'re done activating it. Notably, they can\'t try to remove your creatures with flying to make it illegal to activate the ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Pestilent Haze\'s first mode affects only creatures on the battlefield at the time it resolves. Creatures that enter the battlefield later in the turn won\'t get -2/-2."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Players can\'t take any actions between the time you begin to activate Heartfire Immolator\'s last ability and the time it\'s sacrificed. Notably, opponents can\'t try to lower its power."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Use Heartfire Immolator\'s power as it last existed on the battlefield to determine how much damage its last ability deals."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Runed Halo can\'t protect you from tokens unless those tokens have the same name as the card name you choose."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Some cards can have alternative names, such as split cards, adventurer cards, double-faced cards, and so on. You may choose one of the two names the card can have; Runed Halo won\'t protect you from the other name."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Sanguine Indulgence\'s first ability looks at how much life you\'ve gained in the turn. It doesn\'t care if you also lost life, even if you lost more life than you gained."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Sanguine Indulgence). The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Soul Sear can target a creature or planeswalker that doesn\'t have indestructible."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Stormwing Entity\'s cost reduction applies even if the instant or sorcery spell you cast was countered or didn\'t resolve."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Stormwing Entity\'s cost reduction applies just once, no matter how many instant and sorcery spells you\'ve cast this turn."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Stormwing Entity). The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The ability affects each spell that\'s not a creature spell, including your own. Creature spells with another type, such as artifact creature spells, aren\'t affected."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases (such as that of Vryn Wingmare), then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The amount of damage Terror of the Peaks deals is the entering creature\'s power as the triggered ability resolves. If that creature leaves the battlefield before the ability resolves, use its power as it last existed on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The amount of life you gain is determined only as Aven Gagglemaster\'s triggered ability resolves. If Aven Gagglemaster is still on the battlefield at that time, it will be counted by its own ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The value of X is determined only as Alpine Houndmaster\'s last ability resolves. Once that happens, the value of X won\'t change later in the turn even if the number of attacking creatures changes."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The value of X is determined only as the triggered ability resolves. If Liliana\'s Standard Bearer dies while that ability\'s on the stack, it will count itself."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Tide Skimmer\'s ability triggers just once, no matter how many creatures with flying attack beyond the second."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "You draw a card even if some or all of the attacking creatures lose flying or leave combat before Tide Skimmer\'s ability resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "While resolving Dire Fleet Warmonger\'s ability, you can\'t sacrifice multiple creatures to give it more than +2/+2 and trample."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "You choose whether to sacrifice a creature and which to sacrifice as Dire Fleet Warmonger\'s ability resolves. No player can take action between the time you make that choice and the time it gets +2/+2 and has trample, if appropriate."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "You can activate Seasoned Hallowblade\'s ability even if nothing\'s about to destroy it, even if it\'s already tapped, and even if it already has indestructible."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "You can activate the last ability of Waker of Waves only if it\'s in your hand."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "You can\'t target the same creature twice with the triggered ability of Basri\'s Acolyte to give it two +1/+1 counters."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "You don\'t reveal the card you search for."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "You draw a card and discard a card all while the first ability is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions. This means that the second ability is put onto the stack after you\'ve finished resolving the first ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "You won\'t gain more than 8 life if more than one creature died this turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'A creature can be dealt an amount of damage greater than its toughness. For example, if Brash Taunter is dealt 3 damage, its middle ability deals 3 damage, not 1, to the target opponent.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target when Brash Taunter\'s last ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn\'t resolve. If Brash Taunter is no longer on the battlefield, the target creature won\'t deal or be dealt damage."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If your life total is brought to 0 or less at the same time that Brash Taunter is dealt damage, you lose the game before its middle ability goes on the stack.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'A permanent card is an artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Fungal Rebirth checks only whether a creature died this turn. It doesn\'t give you additional Saprolings if more than one creature died."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If a creature died this turn, you get Saproling tokens in addition to the permanent card being returned to your hand.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'Abilities that trigger when counters are put on a creature trigger when a creature enters the battlefield with counters and when a player puts counters on a creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you have two non-Hydra creatures with Wildwood Scourge\'s ability (perhaps because they were mutated using the Ikoria: Lair of Behemoths mutate ability), putting a +1/+1 counter on any non-Hydra creature you control will cause the two abilities to trigger each other indefinitely. If no player takes an action to break this loop, the game ends in a draw."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'Wildwood Scourge gets just one +1/+1 counter, no matter how many counters were put on the non-Hydra creature.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Ghostly Pilferer\'s first ability triggers during your untap step, but it\'s put onto the stack at the same time as abilities that trigger at the beginning of your upkeep step. Even though the ability triggered first, you may order it before or after other abilities you control that are put onto the stack at this time."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Once Ghostly Pilferer has been blocked, activating its last ability doesn\'t cause it to become unblocked."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'Players can cast spells and activate abilities after the second triggered ability resolves but before the spell that caused it to trigger does.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "While resolving Ghostly Pilferer\'s first ability, you can\'t pay more than {2} to draw more than one card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If some of the attacking creatures leave the battlefield while Mangara\'s triggered ability is on the stack, use the player or planeswalker they were attacking before they left to determine whether you draw a card. On the other hand, if they\'re removed from combat without leaving the battlefield, use their current information to determine that they\'re not attacking you or a planeswalker you control anymore."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If your opponent attacks you with one creature and your planeswalker with another, you draw a card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'Players can cast spells and activate abilities after the triggered ability resolves but before the spell that caused it to trigger does.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'You draw just one card, no matter how many creatures are attacking you and your planeswalkers beyond the second.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If the chosen target is an illegal target by the time Rin and Seri\'s last ability tries to resolve, the ability won\'t resolve. You won\'t gain life."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Rin and Seri\'s first two abilities don\'t trigger when you cast Rin and Seri."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The amount of damage Rin and Seri\'s last ability deals is determined only as that ability resolves. If Rin and Seri is still on the battlefield, it\'ll count itself."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell that\'s more than one color, Quirion Dryad\'s ability triggers just once."}]', "[{'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when something becomes the target of a spell or ability resolves before the spell or ability that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell or ability is countered.'}, {'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'Players can cast spells and activate abilities after the triggered ability resolves but before the spell that caused it to trigger does.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'An attacking creature that phases out is removed from combat.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'Any continuous effects with a “for as long as” duration such as that of Awakener Druid ignore phased-out objects. Any such effects will expire if their conditions are no longer met after ignoring the phased-out objects.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Any creatures that phase in during their controller\'s untap step will be able to attack and pay a cost of {T} during that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Any one-shot effects that are waiting “until [this] leaves the battlefield,” such as that of Kitesail Freebooter, won\'t happen when a permanent phases out."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'Choices made for permanents as they entered the battlefield are remembered when they phase in.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Each Aura and Equipment attached to a permanent that\'s phasing out also phases out. They will phase in with that permanent and still be attached to it. Similarly, permanents that phase out with counters phase in with those counters."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If an opponent gains control of your creature and it phases out and the duration of the control-change effect expires before it phases in, that permanent phases in under your control as that opponent\'s appropriate untap step begins. If they leave the game before that untap step, it phases in as the next untap step begins after that turn would have begun."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, if you leave the game after Teferi\'s last ability resolves but before your next turn ends, its effect lasts until your next turn would have begun. It neither expires immediately nor lasts indefinitely."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Normally, phased-out permanents phase in during their controller\'s untap step. Teferi\'s last ability causes the phased-out permanents to not phase in until the duration has expired; they\'ll phase in during their controller\'s next untap step after your next turn."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Phasing out doesn\'t cause any “leaves the battlefield” abilities to trigger. Similarly, phasing in won\'t cause any “enters the battlefield” abilities to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "While a permanent is phased out, it\'s treated as though it doesn\'t exist. It can\'t be the target of spells or abilities, its static abilities have no effect on the game, its triggered abilities can\'t trigger, it can\'t attack or block, and so on."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'An attacking creature that phases out is removed from combat.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'Any continuous effects with a “for as long as” duration such as that of Awakener Druid ignore phased-out objects. Any such effects will expire if their conditions are no longer met after ignoring the phased-out objects.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Any creatures that phase in during their controller\'s untap step will be able to attack and pay a cost of {T} during that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Any one-shot effects that are waiting “until [this] leaves the battlefield,” such as that of Kitesail Freebooter, won\'t happen when a permanent phases out."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'Choices made for permanents as they entered the battlefield are remembered when they phase in.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Each Aura and Equipment attached to a permanent that\'s phasing out also phases out. They will phase in with that permanent and still be attached to it. Similarly, permanents that phase out with counters phase in with those counters."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If an opponent gains control of your creature and it phases out and the duration of the control-change effect expires before it phases in, that permanent phases in under your control as that opponent\'s next untap step begins. If they leave the game before their next untap step, it phases in as the next untap step begins after their turn would have begun."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Phasing out doesn\'t cause any “leaves the battlefield” abilities to trigger. Similarly, phasing in won\'t cause any “enters the battlefield” abilities to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Teferi\'s first ability doesn\'t change how many of his abilities you can activate during each turn."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "While a permanent is phased out, it\'s treated as though it doesn\'t exist. It can\'t be the target of spells or abilities, its static abilities have no effect on the game, its triggered abilities can\'t trigger, it can\'t attack or block, and so on."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "You draw a card and discard a card all while Teferi\'s first loyalty ability is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions."}]', "[{'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to Predatory Wurm may become lethal if you controlled a Garruk planeswalker and he leaves the battlefield during that turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a Cat you control may become lethal if Feline Sovereign leaves the battlefield during that turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a Dog you control may become lethal if Pack Leader leaves the battlefield during that turn.'}, {'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'Once Pack Leader attacks, its effect prevents damage that would be dealt to Dogs you control even if Pack Leader leaves the battlefield.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to creatures may become lethal if Kaervek enters the battlefield during that turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you control more than one Kaervek, each will give each other creature -1/-1. If these effects cause a creature\'s toughness to become less than or equal to 0 or the amount of damage marked on it, those creatures die at the same time that the “legend rule” remove your excess Kaerveks."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'Chromatic Orrery\\\'s last ability can have you draw at most five cards. "Colorless," "artifact," and "gold" are not colors.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'Crypt Lurker can be sacrificed to pay the cost of its own triggered ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "While resolving Crypt Lurker\'s ability, you can\'t sacrifice more than one creature, discard more than one card, or do both to draw more than one card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'Each creature with lifelink dealing combat damage causes a separate life-gaining event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, the ability will trigger twice. However, if a single creature you control with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), the ability will trigger only once.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If enchanted creature is dealt lethal damage at the same time that you gain life, it won\'t receive a counter from its ability in time to save it."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If you gain an amount of life “for each” of something, that life is gained as one event and the ability triggers only once.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, life gained by your teammate won\'t cause the ability to trigger, even though it caused your team\'s life total to increase."}]', "[{'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'If Infernal Scarring and the enchanted creature are destroyed at the same time, the player will draw a card.'}, {'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'The player who controlled the creature when it died is the one who will draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'If Kitesail Freebooter leaves the battlefield before its enters-the-battlefield ability resolves, the opponent will reveal their hand, but no card will be exiled.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'If Leafkin Avenger leaves the battlefield while its last ability is on the stack, use its power as it last existed on the battlefield to determine how much damage it deals.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If Siege Striker gains vigilance and attacks or attacks and becomes untapped before its last ability resolves, it can be tapped for its own ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If an attacking creature with vigilance is tapped for Siege Striker\'s ability, that creature remains an attacking creature."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Once Siege Striker\'s ability has resolved, it keeps the power-and-toughness bonus even if some of the tapped creatures leave the battlefield or become untapped."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "You choose how many and which creatures to tap while Siege Striker\'s ability is resolving. No player may take other actions between the time you make this choice and the time Siege Striker\'s power and toughness are raised."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If a creature on the battlefield has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Niambi\'s triggered ability tries to resolve, the ability won\'t resolve. You won\'t return the card from the zone it moved to or gain any life."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If a creature or planeswalker on the battlefield has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The mana value of a token that isn\'t a copy of another object is 0. A token that is a copy of another object has the same mana cost as that object."}]', "[{'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'If a creature with trample you control would deal combat damage to a blocking creature while you control Fiery Emancipation, you must assign its unmodified damage. For example, a 3/3 creature with trample blocked by a 2/2 creature can have 2 damage assigned to the blocking creature and 1 damage assigned to the defending player. It will then deal 6 damage to the blocking creature and 3 damage to the defending player.'}, {'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'If an effect asks you to divide damage among targets, you must divide the unmodified damage before tripling it.'}, {'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'If multiple replacement or prevention effects try to modify damage that would be dealt to a permanent or player, the player or the controller of the permanent chooses the order in which they apply.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If a spell or ability causes you to put a card into your hand without specifically using the word "draw," it\\\'s not a card drawn.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If one target creature becomes an illegal target before Rookie Mistake resolves, the other is affected as appropriate.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "You can\'t cast Rookie Mistake unless you choose two creatures as targets."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If the player reveals their entire library without revealing a creature card, that player just shuffles their library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Transmogrify tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. No player reveals cards or shuffles their library."}]', "[{'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'If you control more than one creature with flying, Lofty Denial still requires only {4}.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'If your life total is brought to 0 or less at the same time that Pitchburn Devils is dealt lethal damage, you lose the game before the ability goes on the stack.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If your life total is brought to 0 or less at the same time that Spirit of Malevolence is dealt lethal damage, you lose the game before its ability goes on the stack.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Spirit of Malevolence\'s ability causes the opposing team to lose 2 life and you to gain 1 life."}]', "[{'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, the ability of Keral Keep Disciples causes the opposing team to lose 2 life.'}, {'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'The ability of Keral Keep Disciples resolves before the ability that caused it to trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'Portcullis Vine can be sacrificed to pay the cost of its last ability.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'Pridemalkin can be the target of its own first ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Pridemalkin\'s second ability applies to Pridemalkin as long as it has a +1/+1 counter on it."}]', "[{'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'The life lost is rounded up, not the remaining life total. For example, if the target player has 7 life, they lose 4 life and end up with 3. Similarly, the number of cards drawn is rounded up, not the number of cards remaining in the library.'}, {'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'To draw the cards, first the player determines how many cards to draw, then draws them. This event may be modified so that a different number of cards are actually drawn.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'To double the number of +1/+1 counters on a creature, put a number of +1/+1 counters on it equal to the number it already has. Other cards that interact with putting counters on it will interact with this effect accordingly.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'You draw a card and discard a card all while the ability is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'You may cast spells and activate abilities after the card has been drawn but before blockers are declared.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If a card in a player\'s library has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Activated abilities contain a colon. They\\\'re generally written "[Cost]: [Effect]." Some keywords (such as equip) are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text. Loyalty abilities of planeswalkers are activated abilities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Faith\'s Fetters doesn\'t stop static abilities, triggered abilities, or mana abilities from working. A mana ability is an ability that produces mana, not an ability that costs mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If the target permanent is an illegal target by the time Faith\'s Fetters tries to resolve, it doesn\'t resolve. It won\'t enter the battlefield, so its enters-the-battlefield ability won\'t trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': "You must sacrifice exactly one creature to cast this spell; you can\'t cast it without sacrificing a creature, and you can\'t sacrifice additional creatures."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Containment Priest\'s last ability won\'t affect any creatures that were cast, including ones cast from unusual zones such as your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If Containment Priest enters the battlefield at the same time as other creatures, its ability won\'t affect those creatures."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If Containment Priest enters the battlefield without being cast, its ability won\'t exile itself."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a noncreature card wasn\'t cast and is entering the battlefield as a creature (due to an effect such as that of March of the Machines), it will be exiled. Conversely, if a creature card wasn\'t cast and is entering the battlefield as a noncreature permanent (for example, Heliod, Sun-Crowned with insufficient devotion), it won\'t be exiled."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "Effects that modify an affected creature\'s power and/or toughness without setting them to specific values will apply no matter when those effects began. The same is true for counters that change the creature\'s power and/or toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "Jolrael\'s last ability overwrites all previous effects that set the affected creatures\' power and/or toughness to specific values. If other effects that set these characteristics to specific values start to apply after Jolrael\'s ability resolves, they will overwrite that part of the effect."}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "The triggered ability can trigger only once each turn. It doesn\'t matter if Jolrael was on the battlefield when the first card was drawn: if it\'s not on the battlefield when the second card is drawn, the ability can\'t trigger at all that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "The value of X is determined only as Jolrael\'s last ability resolves. Once that happens, the value of X won\'t change later in the turn even if the number of cards in your hand changes."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "You must discard exactly one card to cast Thrill of Possibility; you can\'t cast it without discarding a card, and you can\'t discard additional cards."}]']
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': "Grimoire du dédale de l\'esprit", \'text\': "{T}, mettez un marqueur « page » sur le Grimoire du dédale de l\'esprit : Regard 1.\\n{2},{T}, mettez un marqueur « page » sur le Grimoire du dédale de l\'esprit : Piochez une carte.\\nQuand il y a au moins quatre marqueurs « page » sur le Grimoire du dédale de l\'esprit, exilez-le. Si vous faites ainsi, vous gagnez 4 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488334&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82597c49-f8e2-436f-900b-517e60edec35\', \'multiverseId\': 488334}, \'multiverseid\': 488334}, {\'name\': \'精神迷わせの秘本\', \'text\': \'{T}, 精神迷わせの秘本の上にページ・カウンターを１個置く：占術１を行う。\\n{2}, {T}, 精神迷わせの秘本の上にページ・カウンターを１個置く：カードを１枚引く。\\n精神迷わせの秘本の上にページ・カウンターが４個以上置かれているとき、これを追放する。そうしたなら、あなたは４点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488386&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f8efdce-4367-41c4-a136-f12e96dbc228\', \'multiverseId\': 488386}, \'multiverseid\': 488386}]', '[{\'name\': "Idole de l\'endurance", \'text\': "Quand l\'Idole de l\'endurance arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez toutes les cartes de créature avec un coût converti de mana inférieur ou égal à 3 de votre cimetière jusqu\'à ce que l\'Idole de l\'endurance quitte le champ de bataille.\\n{1}{W}, {T} : Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, vous pouvez lancer un sort de créature parmi les cartes exilées par l\'Idole de l\'endurance sans payer son coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488293&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdf45988-e68a-4008-8909-18974985bd9d\', \'multiverseId\': 488293}, \'multiverseid\': 488293}, {\'name\': \'忍耐の偶像\', \'text\': \'忍耐の偶像が戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地から点数で見たマナ・コストが３以下のクリーチャー・カードをすべて、忍耐の偶像が戦場を離れるまで追放する。\\n{1}{W}, {T}：ターン終了時まで、あなたは忍耐の偶像によって追放されたカードの中からクリーチャー・呪文１つを、そのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488345&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7ef6729-295f-4ebd-a981-ac2725dfdb9b\', \'multiverseId\': 488345}, \'multiverseid\': 488345}]', '[{\'name\': "Masticore traqueuse d\'étincelle", \'text\': "En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, défaussez-vous d\'une carte.\\nProtection contre les planeswalkers\\n{1} : La Masticore traqueuse d\'étincelle inflige 1 blessure à un planeswalker ciblé.\\n{3} : La Masticore traqueuse d\'étincelle acquiert l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : masticore\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488335&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b26aa44e-b191-4b2a-998a-fc479fd87979\', \'multiverseId\': 488335}, \'multiverseid\': 488335}, {\'name\': \'灯狩人のマスティコア\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、カード１枚を捨てる。\\nプロテクション（プレインズウォーカー）\\n{1}：プレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。灯狩人のマスティコアはそれに１点のダメージを与える。\\n{3}：ターン終了時まで、灯狩人のマスティコアは破壊不能を得る。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — マスティコア\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488387&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91184f51-3fd5-4e34-8398-dcea9c6573f6\', \'multiverseId\': 488387}, \'multiverseid\': 488387}]', '[{\'name\': "Sonder l\'abysse", \'text\': "Le joueur ciblé pioche un nombre de cartes égal à la moitié du nombre de cartes de sa bibliothèque et perd la moitié de ses points de vie. Arrondissez à l\'unité supérieure à chaque fois.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488311&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e5866ce-9705-4f0b-9afc-01b355eb98bd\', \'multiverseId\': 488311}, \'multiverseid\': 488311}, {\'name\': \'深淵への覗き込み\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは、自分のライブラリーにあるカードの枚数の半分に等しい枚数のカードを引き、自分のライフの半分を失う。それぞれの端数は切り上げる。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488363&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f24b40c3-b445-4210-909a-ccb3b9244ce1\', \'multiverseId\': 488363}, \'multiverseid\': 488363}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aasfressender Schlamm\', \'text\': \'{G}: Schicke eine Karte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof ins Exil. Falls es eine Kreaturenkarte war, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Aasfressenden Schlamm und du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schlammwesen\', \'flavor\': \'In der Natur wird kein Knochen und kein Fleischfetzen je verschwendet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485786&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01e51624-7464-499f-80b7-1adbb3c05457\', \'multiverseId\': 485786}, \'multiverseid\': 485786}, {\'name\': \'Cieno carroñero\', \'text\': \'{G}: Exilia la carta objetivo de un cementerio. Si era una carta de criatura, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Cieno carroñero y gana 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cieno\', \'flavor\': \'En la naturaleza, ni un hueso ni un jirón de carne se desperdician.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486045&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45e562af-8a4e-4d12-b87e-16610609fcba\', \'multiverseId\': 486045}, \'multiverseid\': 486045}, {\'name\': \'Limon nécrophage\', \'text\': "{G} : Exilez une carte ciblée depuis un cimetière. Si c\'était une carte de créature, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Limon nécrophage et vous gagnez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : limon\', \'flavor\': \'La nature ne gaspille pas un os, pas un bout de chair.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486304&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd2a6658-4e68-4632-9b2c-9a53b5b531b7\', \'multiverseId\': 486304}, \'multiverseid\': 486304}, {\'name\': \'Melma Mangiacarogne\', \'text\': \'{G}: Esilia una carta bersaglio da un cimitero. Se era una carta creatura, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla Melma Mangiacarogne e guadagni 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Melma\', \'flavor\': \'In natura, non un solo ossicino o pezzo di carne viene sprecato.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d8bd800-e22d-4bd6-b498-c42856dbb4a9\', \'multiverseId\': 486563}, \'multiverseid\': 486563}, {\'name\': \'漁る軟泥\', \'text\': \'{G}：墓地からカード１枚を対象とし、それを追放する。それがクリーチャー・カードであるなら、漁る軟泥の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置き、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ウーズ\', \'flavor\': \'自然では、骨の一本、肉の一切れとて無駄にはならない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486822&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afe92c6f-0502-46c9-99d4-80267c35e0a7\', \'multiverseId\': 486822}, \'multiverseid\': 486822}, {\'name\': \'청소부 점액괴물\', \'text\': \'{G}: 무덤에 있는 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 추방한다. 추방한 카드가 생물 카드라면, 청소부 점액괴물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올리고 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 점액괴물\', \'flavor\': \'자연은 뼈 한 조각, 살 한 점도 낭비하지 않는다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487081&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23ccfa02-c9eb-4c81-bfaf-a08279b61676\', \'multiverseId\': 487081}, \'multiverseid\': 487081}, {\'name\': \'Lodo Necrófago\', \'text\': \'{G}: Exile o card alvo de um cemitério. Se era um card de criatura, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Lodo Necrófago e ganhe 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lodo\', \'flavor\': \'Na natureza, nem um único osso ou pedaço de carne é desperdiçado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487340&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5c027cd-8f3c-430c-affa-5d2627794ab3\', \'multiverseId\': 487340}, \'multiverseid\': 487340}, {\'name\': \'Трупоедная Слизь\', \'text\': \'{G}: изгоните целевую карту из кладбища. Если это была карта существа, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Трупоедную Слизь, и вы получаете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Тина\', \'flavor\': \'В природе ничего не пропадает без пользы — ни кость, ни клок мяса.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487599&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17d22460-9eba-4dc0-bba1-946b1e88a7ce\', \'multiverseId\': 487599}, \'multiverseid\': 487599}, {\'name\': \'腐食流浆\', \'text\': \'{G}：将目标牌从坟墓场放逐。如果它是生物牌，则在腐食流浆上放置一个+1/+1指示物，且你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～流浆\', \'flavor\': \'在自然界中，没有半块骨头或半片肉会被浪费掉。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487858&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7037a06f-9a81-43e5-a327-87bdc340b586\', \'multiverseId\': 487858}, \'multiverseid\': 487858}, {\'name\': \'腐食流漿\', \'text\': \'{G}：將目標牌從墳墓場放逐。如果它是生物牌，則在腐食流漿上放置一個+1/+1指示物，且你獲得1點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～流漿\', \'flavor\': \'在自然界中，沒有半塊骨頭或半片肉會被浪費掉。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8492a7fe-230f-47fd-9fae-110dc59794c7\', \'multiverseId\': 488117}, \'multiverseid\': 488117}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aasfressender Schlamm\', \'text\': \'{G}: Schicke eine Karte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof ins Exil. Falls es eine Kreaturenkarte war, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Aasfressenden Schlamm und du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schlammwesen\', \'flavor\': \'In der Natur wird kein Knochen und kein Fleischfetzen je verschwendet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488405&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d9eed61-ce6d-4239-82ca-3b3eb5895981\', \'multiverseId\': 488405}, \'multiverseid\': 488405}, {\'name\': \'Cieno carroñero\', \'text\': \'{G}: Exilia la carta objetivo de un cementerio. Si era una carta de criatura, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Cieno carroñero y gana 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cieno\', \'flavor\': \'En la naturaleza, ni un hueso ni un jirón de carne se desperdician.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488411&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c6ce5ac-4be9-4981-a565-cca2f212b25a\', \'multiverseId\': 488411}, \'multiverseid\': 488411}, {\'name\': \'Limon nécrophage\', \'text\': "{G} : Exilez une carte ciblée depuis un cimetière. Si c\'était une carte de créature, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Limon nécrophage et vous gagnez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : limon\', \'flavor\': \'La nature ne gaspille pas un os, pas un bout de chair.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488417&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc37b796-e089-4731-bb7c-96716b5cc37b\', \'multiverseId\': 488417}, \'multiverseid\': 488417}, {\'name\': \'Melma Mangiacarogne\', \'text\': \'{G}: Esilia una carta bersaglio da un cimitero. Se era una carta creatura, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla Melma Mangiacarogne e guadagni 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Melma\', \'flavor\': \'In natura, non un solo ossicino o pezzo di carne viene sprecato.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488423&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9794e925-6841-4fed-95a9-dd293623806c\', \'multiverseId\': 488423}, \'multiverseid\': 488423}, {\'name\': \'漁る軟泥\', \'text\': \'{G}：墓地からカード１枚を対象とし、それを追放する。それがクリーチャー・カードであるなら、漁る軟泥の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置き、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ウーズ\', \'flavor\': \'自然では、骨の一本、肉の一切れとて無駄にはならない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488429&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3530acd9-c4f7-493d-b0db-bdec00432761\', \'multiverseId\': 488429}, \'multiverseid\': 488429}, {\'name\': \'청소부 점액괴물\', \'text\': \'{G}: 무덤에 있는 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 추방한다. 추방한 카드가 생물 카드라면, 청소부 점액괴물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올리고 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 점액괴물\', \'flavor\': \'자연은 뼈 한 조각, 살 한 점도 낭비하지 않는다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488435&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e3f45c0-e57c-4e01-a18e-eac5bf566d70\', \'multiverseId\': 488435}, \'multiverseid\': 488435}, {\'name\': \'Lodo Necrófago\', \'text\': \'{G}: Exile o card alvo de um cemitério. Se era um card de criatura, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Lodo Necrófago e ganhe 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lodo\', \'flavor\': \'Na natureza, nem um único osso ou pedaço de carne é desperdiçado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488441&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ad446ce-e61f-46d8-9513-216bb79d5202\', \'multiverseId\': 488441}, \'multiverseid\': 488441}, {\'name\': \'Трупоедная Слизь\', \'text\': \'{G}: изгоните целевую карту из кладбища. Если это была карта существа, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Трупоедную Слизь, и вы получаете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Тина\', \'flavor\': \'В природе ничего не пропадает без пользы — ни кость, ни клок мяса.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488447&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dfcd23b-d37b-490b-87e4-0d68e178ffce\', \'multiverseId\': 488447}, \'multiverseid\': 488447}, {\'name\': \'腐食流浆\', \'text\': \'{G}：将目标牌从坟墓场放逐。如果它是生物牌，则在腐食流浆上放置一个+1/+1指示物，且你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～流浆\', \'flavor\': \'在自然界中，没有半块骨头或半片肉会被浪费掉。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488453&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc5f899c-f474-4a9f-a6d0-b7afdbde0908\', \'multiverseId\': 488453}, \'multiverseid\': 488453}, {\'name\': \'腐食流漿\', \'text\': \'{G}：將目標牌從墳墓場放逐。如果它是生物牌，則在腐食流漿上放置一個+1/+1指示物，且你獲得1點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～流漿\', \'flavor\': \'在自然界中，沒有半塊骨頭或半片肉會被浪費掉。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488459&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08dd747e-99b8-4fab-b638-f2a19d475339\', \'multiverseId\': 488459}, \'multiverseid\': 488459}]', "[{'name': 'Aasmade', 'text': 'Die Aasmade erhält +X/+0, wobei X gleich der höchsten Stärke unter den Kreaturenkarten in deinem Friedhof ist.\\nWenn die Aasmade ins Spiel kommt, millst du vier Karten. (Lege die obersten vier Karten deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof.)', 'type': 'Kreatur — Insekt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485674&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '622f6fef-0d4f-4754-a397-9afb608c5dab', 'multiverseId': 485674}, 'multiverseid': 485674}, {'name': 'Larva carroñera', 'text': 'La Larva carroñera obtiene +X/+0, donde X es la mayor fuerza entre las cartas de criatura en tu cementerio.\\nCuando la Larva carroñera entre al campo de batalla, muele cuatro cartas. (Pon las cuatro primeras cartas de tu biblioteca en tu cementerio.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Insecto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485933&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd56c4cf6-4bf0-4cb9-8793-1860ecead2d1', 'multiverseId': 485933}, 'multiverseid': 485933}, {'name': 'Larve charognarde', 'text': 'La Larve charognarde gagne +X/+0, X étant la force la plus élevée parmi les cartes de créature de votre cimetière.\\nQuand la Larve charognarde arrive sur le champ de bataille, meulez quatre cartes. (Mettez les quatre cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans votre cimetière.)', 'type': 'Créature : insecte', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486192&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '389e178e-5b68-4930-8d27-48dcc936da24', 'multiverseId': 486192}, 'multiverseid': 486192}, {'name': 'Larva delle Carogne', 'text': 'La Larva delle Carogne prende +X/+0, dove X è la forza maggiore tra le carte creatura nel tuo cimitero.\\nQuando la Larva delle Carogne entra nel campo di battaglia, macina quattro carte. (Metti nel tuo cimitero le prime quattro carte del tuo grimorio.)', 'type': 'Creatura — Insetto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486451&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '02b0373a-4de8-4617-aeac-b1d3ff78398b', 'multiverseId': 486451}, 'multiverseid': 486451}, {'name': '屍肉地虫', 'text': '屍肉地虫は＋Ｘ/＋０の修整を受ける。Ｘはあなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カードの中で最大のパワーに等しい。\\n屍肉地虫が戦場に出たとき、カードを４枚切削する。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを４枚あなたの墓地に置く。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 昆虫', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486710&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3bc82473-8205-45d7-b128-dfda8718db31', 'multiverseId': 486710}, 'multiverseid': 486710}, {'name': '시체 유충', 'text': '시체 유충은 +X/+0을 받는다. X는 당신의 무덤에 있는 생물 카드 중 공격력이 제일 높은 생물 카드의 공격력이다.\\n시체 유충이 전장에 들어올 때, 카드 네 장을 민다. (당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 네 장을 당신의 무덤에 넣는다.)', 'type': '생물 — 곤충', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486969&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '55ce7840-04ae-4d55-a996-2cfff9d75758', 'multiverseId': 486969}, 'multiverseid': 486969}, {'name': 'Larva Necrófaga', 'text': 'Larva Necrófaga recebe +X/+0, sendo X o maior poder entre os dos cards de criatura em seu cemitério.\\nQuando Larva Necrófaga entrar no campo de batalha, triture quatro cards. (Coloque os quatro cards do topo de seu grimório em seu cemitério.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Inseto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487228&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9056be85-4184-47d1-beb1-6339eda9c7c7', 'multiverseId': 487228}, 'multiverseid': 487228}, {'name': 'Личинка-Падальщик', 'text': 'Личинка-Падальщик получает +X/+0, где Х — наибольшее значение силы среди карт существ на вашем кладбище.\\nКогда Личинка-Падальщик выходит на поле битвы, скрутите четыре карты. (Положите четыре верхние карты вашей библиотеки на ваше кладбище.)', 'type': 'Существо — Насекомое', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487487&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2d53631b-e09b-4104-afe4-85484d0ddb11', 'multiverseId': 487487}, 'multiverseid': 487487}, {'name': '腐肉幼虫', 'text': '腐肉幼虫得+X/+0，X为你坟墓场里的生物牌中力量最大者的数值。\\n当腐肉幼虫进战场时，磨四张牌。（将你牌库顶的四张牌置入你的坟墓场。）', 'type': '生物 ～昆虫', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487746&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cf16e229-34ff-40cf-a3e3-07463bb56b9a', 'multiverseId': 487746}, 'multiverseid': 487746}, {'name': '腐肉幼蟲', 'text': '腐肉幼蟲得+X/+0，X為你墳墓場裡的生物牌中力量最大者的數值。\\n當腐肉幼蟲進戰場時，磨四張牌。（將你牌庫頂的四張牌置入你的墳墓場。）', 'type': '生物 ～昆蟲', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488005&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a5709c91-032e-4bf4-a4d6-74145c899f95', 'multiverseId': 488005}, 'multiverseid': 488005}]", '[{\'name\': \'Abbrechen\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich entscheide, was mir im Wege steht."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485628&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e268c7ea-5868-460e-bef8-e331a45ee4da\', \'multiverseId\': 485628}, \'multiverseid\': 485628}, {\'name\': \'Deshacer\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Yo decido lo que me detiene".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485887&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3dc5e5c1-b6bc-41ac-bde3-5359784d6e7c\', \'multiverseId\': 485887}, \'multiverseid\': 485887}, {\'name\': \'Révocation\', \'text\': \'Contrecarrez le sort ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Je décide de ce qui me barre la route. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486146&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b71eb56-9cd7-42a4-bb45-bfdbce6320e6\', \'multiverseId\': 486146}, \'multiverseid\': 486146}, {\'name\': \'Eliminare\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Sono io a decidere gli ostacoli sul mio percorso."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a6a6ca4-b190-4c30-8324-b79e677d0e0d\', \'multiverseId\': 486405}, \'multiverseid\': 486405}, {\'name\': \'取り消し\', \'text\': \'呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「私を阻むものは、私が決める。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486664&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6c33784-6306-47c0-94fc-b299b5c6b5b3\', \'multiverseId\': 486664}, \'multiverseid\': 486664}, {\'name\': \'주문 취소\', \'text\': \'주문을 목표로 정한다. 그 주문을 무효화한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"뭐가 나를 방해하는지는 내가 정해."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486923&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47473f8f-1275-4af5-b6e1-7069ae85e1cf\', \'multiverseId\': 486923}, \'multiverseid\': 486923}, {\'name\': \'Cancelar\', \'text\': \'Anule a mágica alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu decido o que fica em meu caminho."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487182&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfbea9e9-8e12-4c43-9ded-da9dbc3ff955\', \'multiverseId\': 487182}, \'multiverseid\': 487182}, {\'name\': \'Отмена\', \'text\': \'Отмените целевое заклинание.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Я сама решаю, чему стоять у меня на пути».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487441&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4099782e-1e43-41d1-9d1b-5fb0c7edf902\', \'multiverseId\': 487441}, \'multiverseid\': 487441}, {\'name\': \'取消\', \'text\': \'反击目标咒语。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「谁能阻挠由我来定。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487700&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f166d5f9-5ecd-4138-aa56-db005fcaa662\', \'multiverseId\': 487700}, \'multiverseid\': 487700}, {\'name\': \'取消\', \'text\': \'反擊目標咒語。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「誰能阻撓由我來定。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487959&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74dace42-1049-4a26-951f-9597894804a4\', \'multiverseId\': 487959}, \'multiverseid\': 487959}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abgott der Zähigkeit\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Abgott der Zähigkeit ins Spiel kommt, schicke alle Kreaturenkarten mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 3 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil, bis der Abgott der Zähigkeit das Spiel verlässt.\\n{1}{W}, {T}: Bis zum Ende des Zuges kannst du von den Karten, die mit dem Abgott der Zähigkeit ins Exil geschickt wurden, einen Kreaturenzauber wirken, ohne seine Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485605&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41c14b7c-d585-4d2d-a419-5a073d173692\', \'multiverseId\': 485605}, \'multiverseid\': 485605}, {\'name\': \'Ídolo de la resistencia\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Ídolo de la resistencia entre al campo de batalla, exilia todas las cartas de criatura con coste de maná convertido de 3 o menos de tu cementerio hasta que el Ídolo de la resistencia deje el campo de batalla.\\n{1}{W}, {T}: Hasta el final del turno, puedes lanzar un hechizo de criatura de entre las cartas exiliadas con el Ídolo de la resistencia sin pagar su coste de maná.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485864&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f576a83-2551-4cb9-b0e4-57802337b021\', \'multiverseId\': 485864}, \'multiverseid\': 485864}, {\'name\': "Idole de l\'endurance", \'text\': "Quand l\'Idole de l\'endurance arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez toutes les cartes de créature avec un coût converti de mana inférieur ou égal à 3 de votre cimetière jusqu\'à ce que l\'Idole de l\'endurance quitte le champ de bataille.\\n{1}{W}, {T} : Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, vous pouvez lancer un sort de créature parmi les cartes exilées par l\'Idole de l\'endurance sans payer son coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486123&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'745c055c-ccc4-4765-8d30-3a0d12cad325\', \'multiverseId\': 486123}, \'multiverseid\': 486123}, {\'name\': \'Idolo della Perseveranza\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Idolo della Perseveranza entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia tutte le carte creatura con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a 3 dal tuo cimitero finché l\'Idolo della Perseveranza non lascia il campo di battaglia.\\n{1}{W}, {T}: Fino alla fine del turno, puoi lanciare una magia creatura tra le carte esiliate con l\'Idolo della Perseveranza senza pagare il suo costo di mana.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486382&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca2885f7-f077-4f99-9be7-03e874380acd\', \'multiverseId\': 486382}, \'multiverseid\': 486382}, {\'name\': \'忍耐の偶像\', \'text\': \'忍耐の偶像が戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地から点数で見たマナ・コストが３以下のクリーチャー・カードをすべて、忍耐の偶像が戦場を離れるまで追放する。\\n{1}{W}, {T}：ターン終了時まで、あなたは忍耐の偶像によって追放されたカードの中からクリーチャー・呪文１つを、そのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486641&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'830f87fd-84c5-4937-913d-fec7164ac204\', \'multiverseId\': 486641}, \'multiverseid\': 486641}, {\'name\': \'인내의 우상\', \'text\': \'인내의 우상이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신의 무덤에 있는 전환마나비용이 3 이하인 모든 생물 카드를 인내의 우상이 전장을 떠날 때까지 추방한다.\\n{1}{W}, {T}: 턴종료까지, 당신은 인내의 우상으로 추방된 카드들 중 생물 주문 한 장을 마나 비용을 지불하지 않고 발동할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486900&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fc79562-e8d3-41a2-b8dd-6b514ce3933b\', \'multiverseId\': 486900}, \'multiverseid\': 486900}, {\'name\': \'Ídolo de Resistência\', \'text\': \'Quando Ídolo de Resistência entrar no campo de batalha, exile todos os cards de criatura com custo de mana convertido igual ou inferior a 3 de seu cemitério até que Ídolo de Resistência deixe o campo de batalha.\\n{1}{W}, {T}: Até o final do turno, você pode conjurar uma mágica de criatura dentre os cards exilados com Ídolo de Resistência sem pagar seu custo de mana.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487159&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db29c565-8a7d-48ef-aa95-e9d1d65121d2\', \'multiverseId\': 487159}, \'multiverseid\': 487159}, {\'name\': \'Идол Выносливости\', \'text\': \'Когда Идол Выносливости выходит на поле битвы, изгоните все карты существ с конвертированной мана-стоимостью не более 3 из вашего кладбища до тех пор, пока Идол Выносливости не покинет поле битвы.\\n{1}{W}, {T}: до конца хода вы можете разыграть одно находящееся среди изгнанных Идолом Выносливости карт заклинание существа без уплаты его мана-стоимости.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487418&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9aadc0f5-904d-47f3-ab1a-7acf1c3b1cdf\', \'multiverseId\': 487418}, \'multiverseid\': 487418}, {\'name\': \'坚白雕像\', \'text\': \'当坚白雕像进战场时，放逐你坟墓场中所有总法术力费用等于或小于3的生物牌，直到坚白雕像离开战场为止。\\n{1}{W}，{T}：直到回合结束，你可以从以坚白雕像放逐的牌中施放一个生物咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487677&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd352719-111f-4507-8a89-7cd67b549fa3\', \'multiverseId\': 487677}, \'multiverseid\': 487677}, {\'name\': \'堅白雕像\', \'text\': \'當堅白雕像進戰場時，放逐你墳墓場中所有總魔法力費用等於或小於3的生物牌，直到堅白雕像離開戰場為止。\\n{1}{W}，{T}：直到回合結束，你可以從以堅白雕像放逐的牌中施放一個生物咒語，且不需支付其魔法力費用。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487936&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2117886-58bf-4f97-9e5d-ca83ed6dd787\', \'multiverseId\': 487936}, \'multiverseid\': 487936}]', '[{\'name\': \'Alpiner Hundeführer\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Alpine Hundeführer ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Karte namens Alpiner Wachhund und/oder einer Karte namens Feuertöle durchsuchen, sie offen vorzeigen, auf deine Hand nehmen und dann deine Bibliothek mischen.\\nImmer wenn der Alpine Hundeführer angreift, erhält er bis zum Ende des Zuges +X/+0, wobei X gleich der Anzahl der anderen angreifenden Kreaturen ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485797&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c80c66f7-b67b-4666-8d74-2238eeceb42b\', \'multiverseId\': 485797}, \'multiverseid\': 485797}, {\'name\': \'Especialista en perros alpino\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Especialista en perros alpino entre al campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta llamada Perro guardián alpino y/o una carta llamada Perro callejero ígneo, revelarlas, ponerlas en tu mano y luego barajar tu biblioteca.\\nSiempre que el Especialista en perros alpino ataque, obtiene +X/+0 hasta el final del turno, donde X es la cantidad de otras criaturas atacantes.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486056&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86fe4419-d50b-4cbb-827d-a67e3b95e016\', \'multiverseId\': 486056}, \'multiverseid\': 486056}, {\'name\': \'Maître-chien alpin\', \'text\': "Quand le Maître-chien alpin arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte appelée Chien de garde alpin et/ou une carte appelée Cabot ignescent, les révéler, les mettre dans votre main, puis mélanger votre bibliothèque.\\nÀ chaque fois que le Maître-chien alpin attaque, il gagne +X/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant le nombre d\'autres créatures attaquantes.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486315&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8397f72-b8d4-4d7e-8651-054ae36bb1a5\', \'multiverseId\': 486315}, \'multiverseid\': 486315}, {\'name\': \'Signore dei Segugi Alpestre\', \'text\': \'Quando il Signore dei Segugi Alpestre entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta chiamata Cane da Guardia Alpestre e/o una carta chiamata Randagio Igneo, rivelarle, aggiungerle alla tua mano e poi rimescolare il tuo grimorio.\\nOgniqualvolta il Signore dei Segugi Alpestre attacca, prende +X/+0 fino alla fine del turno, dove X è il numero di altre creature attaccanti.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486574&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46cc5bd2-4c35-4453-9411-dfa056297705\', \'multiverseId\': 486574}, \'multiverseid\': 486574}, {\'name\': \'高山の犬師\', \'text\': \'高山の犬師が戦場に出たとき、あなたは「あなたのライブラリーから、『高山の番犬』という名前のカード１枚か、『炎血の野犬』という名前のカード１枚か、その両方を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加え、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\\n高山の犬師が攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、これは＋Ｘ/＋０の修整を受ける。Ｘは他の攻撃クリーチャーの総数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486833&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'041bac3f-b2aa-406a-a685-d632d7aacd55\', \'multiverseId\': 486833}, \'multiverseid\': 486833}, {\'name\': \'고산지대 사냥개조련사\', \'text\': \'고산지대 사냥개조련사가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 당신의 서고에서 이름이 고산지대 파수견 및/또는 불타오르는 광견인 카드를 찾아, 그 카드들을 공개하고, 당신의 손에 넣을 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 당신의 서고를 섞는다.\\n고산지대 사냥개조련사가 공격할 때마다, 고산지대 사냥개조련사는 턴종료까지 +X/+0을 받는다. X는 다른 공격 중인 생물들의 수이다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 전사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487092&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d74ac10-55b5-4d57-aed6-1233c0731e60\', \'multiverseId\': 487092}, \'multiverseid\': 487092}, {\'name\': \'Mestre dos Sabujos Alpino\', \'text\': \'Quando Mestre dos Sabujos Alpino entra no campo de batalha, você pode procurar em seu grimório um card com o nome Cão de Guarda Alpino e/ou um card com o nome Cão Ígneo, revelá-los, colocá-los em sua mão e depois embaralhar seu grimório.\\nToda vez que Mestre dos Sabujos Alpino ataca, ele recebe +X/+0 até o final do turno, sendo X o número de outras criaturas atacantes.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487351&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20db627d-219d-415c-8605-2c10a53068b0\', \'multiverseId\': 487351}, \'multiverseid\': 487351}, {\'name\': \'Горный Псарь\', \'text\': \'Когда Горный Псарь выходит на поле битвы, вы можете найти в вашей библиотеке карту с именем Горный Сторожевой Пес и/или карту с именем Огневая Псина, показать их, положить их в вашу руку, затем перетасовать вашу библиотеку.\\nКаждый раз, когда Горный Псарь атакует, он получает +X/+0 до конца хода, где Х — количество других атакующих существ.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Воин\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e490dd3-f8eb-4dd3-af15-f31e77de8a09\', \'multiverseId\': 487610}, \'multiverseid\': 487610}, {\'name\': \'山地驯犬师\', \'text\': \'当山地驯犬师进战场时，你可以从你的牌库中搜寻一张名称为山地看护犬的牌和／或一张名称为火热杂狗的牌，展示它们，将它们置于你手上，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\\n每当山地驯犬师攻击时，它得+X/+0直到回合结束，X为其他进行攻击的生物数量。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487869&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'059cbe41-dee8-4e47-9459-9be6768514fc\', \'multiverseId\': 487869}, \'multiverseid\': 487869}, {\'name\': \'山地馴犬師\', \'text\': \'當山地馴犬師進戰場時，你可以從你的牌庫中搜尋一張名稱為山地看護犬的牌和／或一張名稱為火熱雜狗的牌，展示它們，將它們置於你手上，然後將你的牌庫洗牌。\\n每當山地馴犬師攻擊時，它得+X/+0直到回合結束，X為其他進行攻擊的生物數量。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／戰士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488128&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c088cf03-492f-4cce-986f-3169691b4308\', \'multiverseId\': 488128}, \'multiverseid\': 488128}]', '[{\'name\': \'Alpiner Wachhund\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit (Diese Kreatur wird beim Angreifen nicht getappt.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Hund\', \'flavor\': \'„Am achten Tag überraschte uns ein Schneesturm. Die Vorräte gingen verloren und die Moral stürzte in den Keller. Am neunten Tag fand uns Dover."\\n—*Gipfelsturm: Eine Überlebensgeschichte*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485584&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c93f8d98-ab1a-4c32-a76e-97849e2047d2\', \'multiverseId\': 485584}, \'multiverseid\': 485584}, {\'name\': \'Perro guardián alpino\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia. (Esta criatura no se gira al atacar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Perro\', \'flavor\': \'"El octavo día, estalló una tormenta. Nos quedamos sin suministros y el ánimo mermó. El noveno día, Dover nos encontró".\\n—*Hacia la cima: una historia de supervivencia*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485843&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c56e93b-b837-42f2-9073-f70887b73eb6\', \'multiverseId\': 485843}, \'multiverseid\': 485843}, {\'name\': \'Chien de garde alpin\', \'text\': "Vigilance (Attaquer avec cette créature ne la fait pas s\'engager.)", \'type\': \'Créature : chien\', \'flavor\': "« Au huitième jour, nous fûmes pris dans un blizzard. Nous avions perdu nos provisions, notre moral était au plus bas. Au neuvième jour, Dover nous retrouva. »\\n—*Jusqu\'au sommet : récit de survie*", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486102&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f626754f-e59b-440b-b2f1-5520d826efba\', \'multiverseId\': 486102}, \'multiverseid\': 486102}, {\'name\': \'Cane da Guardia Alpestre\', \'text\': \'Cautela (Questa creatura attacca senza TAPpare.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Canide\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'ottavo giorno, ci sorprese una bufera. Le scorte andarono perdute e il morale era sotto i tacchi. Il nono giorno, Dover ci trovò."\\n—*Verso la Vetta: Una Storia di Sopravvivenza*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486361&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd124c7d-099f-45da-b7e9-889f83ee4a6f\', \'multiverseId\': 486361}, \'multiverseid\': 486361}, {\'name\': \'高山の番犬\', \'text\': \'警戒（このクリーチャーは攻撃してもタップしない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 犬\', \'flavor\': \'「８日目。猛吹雪に襲われる。資材を失い、士気が低下。９日目。ドーバーが我々を発見。」\\n――*山頂を目指して：生存の物語*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486620&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9253c45b-bdbd-403f-b5f1-c7a16aa5d01b\', \'multiverseId\': 486620}, \'multiverseid\': 486620}, {\'name\': \'고산지대 파수견\', \'text\': \'경계 (이 생물은 공격하면서 탭되지 않는다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 개\', \'flavor\': \'"8일째에, 눈보라가 몰아쳤다. 보급품을 모두 잃었고, 사기는 곤두박질쳤다. 9일째에, 도버가 우리를 찾아냈다."\\n—*정상으로: 생존에 대한 이야기*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486879&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd2f51b6-1034-4937-b30d-f976612ec7b6\', \'multiverseId\': 486879}, \'multiverseid\': 486879}, {\'name\': \'Cão de Guarda Alpino\', \'text\': \'Vigilância (Atacar não faz com que esta criatura seja virada.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cão\', \'flavor\': \'"No oitavo dia veio a nevasca. Os suprimentos se foram. O moral despencou. No nono dia Dover nos achou."\\n— *Ao Topo: Uma História de Sobrevivência*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff72980f-b495-4564-9849-8fd1e296f5e6\', \'multiverseId\': 487138}, \'multiverseid\': 487138}, {\'name\': \'Горный Сторожевой Пес\', \'text\': \'Бдительность (Атакуя, это существо не поворачивается.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Собака\', \'flavor\': \'«На восьмой день налетела снежная буря. Мы потеряли припасы и пали духом. На девятый день нас нашел Довер».\\n— *«Покорение вершины: история о выживании»*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487397&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4da548c4-4716-44c8-9275-190b8733afbf\', \'multiverseId\': 487397}, \'multiverseid\': 487397}, {\'name\': \'山地看护犬\', \'text\': \'警戒（此生物攻击时不需横置。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～狗\', \'flavor\': \'「第八天，我们遭到暴风雪袭击。慌乱中补给尽失，干劲也跌至谷底。第九天，多福找到了我们。」\\n～*《勇攀巅峰：生存纪实》*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487656&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d83a9a86-aa53-4a97-baba-26ee9c90a047\', \'multiverseId\': 487656}, \'multiverseid\': 487656}, {\'name\': \'山地看護犬\', \'text\': \'警戒（此生物攻擊時不需橫置。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～狗\', \'flavor\': \'「第八天，我們遭到暴風雪襲擊。慌亂中補給盡失，幹勁也跌至谷底。第九天，多福找到了我們。」\\n～*《勇攀巔峰：生存紀實》*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487915&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'931aff55-55e2-4d79-82e7-08989989012a\', \'multiverseId\': 487915}, \'multiverseid\': 487915}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ancêtre gargaroth\', \'text\': "Vigilance, portée, piétinement\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Ancêtre gargaroth attaque ou bloque, choisissez l\'un —\\n• Créez un jeton de créature 3/3 verte Bête.\\n• Vous gagnez 3 points de vie.\\n• Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488324&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b0c2ed1-b568-401f-81a0-a806c329e701\', \'multiverseId\': 488324}, \'multiverseid\': 488324}, {\'name\': \'長老ガーガロス\', \'text\': \'警戒、到達、トランプル\\n長老ガーガロスが攻撃するかブロックするたび、以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• 緑の３/３のビースト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\n• あなたは３点のライフを得る。\\n• カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e5c5a18-0bf5-4a5e-bcf7-05f7aa5951e6\', \'multiverseId\': 488376}, \'multiverseid\': 488376}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anfängerfehler\', \'text\': \'Bis zum Ende des Zuges erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl +0/+2 und eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl -2/-0.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Knie beim Schlag locker halten! Jetzt steh auf und versuche es nochmal."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485648&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0dc5258-7511-40b6-ad4c-d6b5f88b63c0\', \'multiverseId\': 485648}, \'multiverseid\': 485648}, {\'name\': \'Error de novato\', \'text\': \'Hasta el final del turno, la criatura objetivo obtiene +0/+2 y otra criatura objetivo obtiene -2/-0.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¡No bloquees las rodillas cuando ataques! Levántate y vuelve a intentarlo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485907&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8e76e08-15a2-467f-b017-18073a3733b4\', \'multiverseId\': 485907}, \'multiverseid\': 485907}, {\'name\': \'Erreur de débutant\', \'text\': "Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, une créature ciblée gagne +0/+2 et une autre créature ciblée gagne -2/-0.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Ne reste pas planté sur tes genoux quand tu frappes ! Relève-toi et réessaie. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486166&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3de90ace-fe9f-4739-be77-169458d7e7d2\', \'multiverseId\': 486166}, \'multiverseid\': 486166}, {\'name\': \'Errore da Principiante\', \'text\': "Fino alla fine del turno, una creatura bersaglio prende +0/+2 e un\'altra creatura bersaglio prende -2/-0.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Smettila di irrigidire le ginocchia quando colpisci! Ora alzati e riprova."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486425&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f14d43b-1241-4bab-85e7-8ecd5f52bb17\', \'multiverseId\': 486425}, \'multiverseid\': 486425}, {\'name\': \'初心者の過ち\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体と、他のクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、その前者は＋０/＋２の修整を受けその後者は－２/－０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「打撃の際に膝を伸ばしてはならぬ！立て。もう一度だ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486684&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6eff9d2-a0e1-42c1-b55b-ee903333af0e\', \'multiverseId\': 486684}, \'multiverseid\': 486684}, {\'name\': \'초심자의 실수\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정하고 또 다른 생물을 목표로 정한다. 턴종료까지, 첫 번째 목표는 +0/+2를 받고 두 번째 목표는 -2/-0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"때릴 때 무릎을 쭉 펴지 마! 이제 일어나서 다시 해 봐."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486943&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77e614c4-aab7-4a3a-8f18-7d2c19706940\', \'multiverseId\': 486943}, \'multiverseid\': 486943}, {\'name\': \'Erro de Novato\', \'text\': \'Até o final do turno, a criatura alvo recebe +0/+2 e outra criatura alvo recebe -2/-0.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Pare de travar os joelhos na hora do golpe! Agora levante e tente de novo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487202&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b64b282-7f83-4059-9a22-fc0b7bf3d413\', \'multiverseId\': 487202}, \'multiverseid\': 487202}, {\'name\': \'Ошибка Новичка\', \'text\': \'До конца хода целевое существо получает +0/+2, а другое целевое существо получает -2/-0.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Не выпрямляй ногу в колене, когда бьешь! А теперь встань и попробуй еще раз».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487461&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebb74d13-ce24-43e8-8669-ec68c9d02413\', \'multiverseId\': 487461}, \'multiverseid\': 487461}, {\'name\': \'新手失误\', \'text\': \'直到回合结束，目标生物得+0/+2且另一个目标生物得-2/-0。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「攻击时膝盖别僵着！起身再试一次。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487720&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d02ccd52-a4af-4f1b-a52c-34ad172ba46f\', \'multiverseId\': 487720}, \'multiverseid\': 487720}, {\'name\': \'新手失誤\', \'text\': \'直到回合結束，目標生物得+0/+2且另一個目標生物得-2/-0。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「攻擊時膝蓋別僵著！起身再試一次。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487979&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6cd3026-d840-4572-bb81-bc02afe47eb1\', \'multiverseId\': 487979}, \'multiverseid\': 487979}]', "[{'name': 'Ange pourfendeur', 'text': 'Vol, initiative, lien de vie, protection contre les démons et contre les dragons', 'type': 'Créature : ange', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488291&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cadd6042-a129-4a76-9040-0291ad7387a5', 'multiverseId': 488291}, 'multiverseid': 488291}, {'name': '悪斬の天使', 'text': '飛行、先制攻撃、絆魂、プロテクション（デーモン）、プロテクション（ドラゴン）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 天使', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488343&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b98cfda3-fa0d-45b5-a93e-d489f39b7566', 'multiverseId': 488343}, 'multiverseid': 488343}]", '[{\'name\': \'Anhängerin der Hoffnung\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug und falls du einen Basri-Planeswalker kontrollierst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Anhängerin der Hoffnung.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Basri hat mir den Weg nach vorn gezeigt und ich werde folgen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488647&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa6ce495-3624-49e6-aa90-ca34f830c750\', \'multiverseId\': 488647}, \'multiverseid\': 488647}, {\'name\': \'Seguidora de la esperanza\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, si controlas un planeswalker Basri, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la Seguidora de la esperanza.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Basri me mostró el camino a seguir y yo lo recorreré".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a619ee23-ce57-411b-b9df-88580ea330c1\', \'multiverseId\': 488667}, \'multiverseid\': 488667}, {\'name\': "Militante de l\'espoir", \'text\': "Au début du combat pendant votre tour, si vous contrôlez un planeswalker Basri, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur la Militante de l\'espoir.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« Basri m\'a montré le chemin, et je le suivrai. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488687&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f238bcde-3ef4-4678-8f21-3f0567fc2587\', \'multiverseId\': 488687}, \'multiverseid\': 488687}, {\'name\': \'Seguace della Speranza\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, se controlli un planeswalker Basri, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla Seguace della Speranza.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Basri mi ha mostrato il cammino da percorrere e io lo seguirò."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488707&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b77983f-7770-4096-9cf4-a2c2764fc566\', \'multiverseId\': 488707}, \'multiverseid\': 488707}, {\'name\': \'希望の支持者\', \'text\': \'あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたがバスリ・プレインズウォーカーをコントロールしている場合、希望の支持者の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「バスリが先の道を示してくれている。私はそれに従う。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488727&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f9064f6-1bb1-4c95-a8bc-cb4ad688c855\', \'multiverseId\': 488727}, \'multiverseid\': 488727}, {\'name\': \'희망의 지지자\', \'text\': \'당신의 턴 전투 시작에, 당신이 바스리 플레인즈워커를 조종한다면, 희망의 지지자에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 병사\', \'flavor\': \'"바스리는 내게 나아갈 길을 보여주었고, 나는 그 길을 따를 것이다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488747&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4515bdc8-eb12-4896-9f98-d760f273afac\', \'multiverseId\': 488747}, \'multiverseid\': 488747}, {\'name\': \'Adepta da Esperança\', \'text\': \'No início do combate no seu turno, se você controlar um planeswalker Basri, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Adepta da Esperança.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Basri me mostrou o caminho, e eu o seguirei."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'668b7ef9-703b-4c1b-a039-7f1f1018d145\', \'multiverseId\': 488767}, \'multiverseid\': 488767}, {\'name\': \'Приверженка Надежды\', \'text\': "В начале боя во время вашего хода, если вы контролируете planeswalker\'а Базри, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Приверженку Надежды.", \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'«Базри показал мне путь вперед, и я пойду по этому пути».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488787&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53291dd4-f241-4e13-87a9-e9e0f73ecc10\', \'multiverseId\': 488787}, \'multiverseid\': 488787}, {\'name\': \'希望吏士\', \'text\': \'在你回合的战斗开始时，若你操控巴席利鹏洛客，则在希望吏士上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「巴席利照亮前路，我必会循光而行。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ded86d7-8778-4bae-b088-4b85da799dbf\', \'multiverseId\': 488807}, \'multiverseid\': 488807}, {\'name\': \'希望吏士\', \'text\': \'在你回合的戰鬥開始時，若你操控巴席利鵬洛客，則在希望吏士上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「巴席利照亮前路，我必會循光而行。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488827&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2d4443d-448f-4d63-baae-b13678ba83e7\', \'multiverseId\': 488827}, \'multiverseid\': 488827}]', "[{'name': 'Antienne glorieuse', 'text': 'Les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.', 'type': 'Enchantement', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488292&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd70523f5-b556-4a1b-8958-ab47848cff9d', 'multiverseId': 488292}, 'multiverseid': 488292}, {'name': '栄光の頌歌', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488344&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '05bb5a13-d48b-4115-8da0-40cbb9c1d03c', 'multiverseId': 488344}, 'multiverseid': 488344}]", '[{\'name\': \'Arglist des Waldläufers\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, erhält +1/+1 und Fluchsicherheit bis zum Ende des Zuges. (Sie kann nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein, die deine Gegner kontrollieren.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„In der Wildnis überlebt man nicht, indem man sich für alle sichtbar mitten in die Landschaft stellt."\\n—Garruk Wildsprecher\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485781&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8faa2fd-d3d0-4e77-bc7f-77681e9f0ba3\', \'multiverseId\': 485781}, \'multiverseid\': 485781}, {\'name\': \'Astucia del guardabosque\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo que controlas obtiene +1/+1 y gana la habilidad de antimaleficio hasta el final del turno. (No puede ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades que controlan tus oponentes.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"No sobrevives en los bosques quedándote parado a plena luz del día".\\n—Garruk Portavoz Salvaje\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486040&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'107bad3e-fc2b-4ff5-bfeb-db70cc0a11ea\', \'multiverseId\': 486040}, \'multiverseid\': 486040}, {\'name\': \'Sagacité du ranger\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez gagne +1/+1 et acquiert la défense talismanique jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (Elle ne peut pas être la cible de sorts ou de capacités que vos adversaires contrôlent.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Pour survivre en pleine nature, mieux vaut se mettre à couvert. »\\n—Garruk Languebestion\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486299&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70035548-af3a-4193-bfc0-f85520eb9e5a\', \'multiverseId\': 486299}, \'multiverseid\': 486299}, {\'name\': \'Astuzia del Ranger\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio che controlli prende +1/+1 e ha anti-malocchio fino alla fine del turno. (Non può essere bersaglio di magie o abilità controllate dai tuoi avversari.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Nelle terre selvagge, non sopravviverai piazzandoti in bella vista."\\n—Garruk Lingua Selvaggia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486558&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a59d0d59-bace-4c55-a95a-7962673eedc7\', \'multiverseId\': 486558}, \'multiverseid\': 486558}, {\'name\': \'レインジャーの悪知恵\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋１/＋１の修整を受け呪禁を得る。（それは対戦相手がコントロールしている呪文や能力の対象にならない。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「自分の姿を晒していては、荒野で生き延びることはできない。」\\n――野生語りのガラク\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486817&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2517beb4-a230-4d2a-9f78-2f3b2b66df3c\', \'multiverseId\': 486817}, \'multiverseid\': 486817}, {\'name\': \'레인저의 간계\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받고 방호를 얻는다. (부여된 생물은 상대가 조종하는 주문이나 능력의 목표로 정해질 수 없다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"야생지에서는 몸을 숨기지 않고서는 살아남지 못하지."\\n—개럭 와일드스피커\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbf051c0-c950-45b6-9aaf-9f09bc9cf470\', \'multiverseId\': 487076}, \'multiverseid\': 487076}, {\'name\': \'Ardil do Patrulheiro\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo que você controla recebe +1/+1 e ganha resistência a magia até o final do turno. (Ela não pode ser alvo de mágicas nem de habilidades que seus oponentes controlam.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Ninguém sobrevive na natureza ficando parado à vista."\\n— Garruk Falabravo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487335&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78bf9989-79ff-43b5-9e96-4b0ea30f9b7a\', \'multiverseId\': 487335}, \'multiverseid\': 487335}, {\'name\': \'Хитрость Лесничего\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо под вашим контролем получает +1/+1 и Порчеустойчивость до конца хода. (Оно не может быть целью заклинаний или способностей под контролем ваших оппонентов.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Хочешь выжить в лесу — не стой на виду».\\n— Гаррук Дикоречивый\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487594&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c1b6152-03e5-4717-9aaa-0d869c7e5d37\', \'multiverseId\': 487594}, \'multiverseid\': 487594}, {\'name\': \'护林人的智谋\', \'text\': \'直到回合结束，目标由你操控的生物得+1/+1且获得辟邪异能。（它不能成为由对手操控之咒语或异能的目标。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「如果丝毫不掩蔽行踪，你将无法在野地存活。」\\n～召兽使贾路\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2c50dd4-d5c2-4b00-9145-1e54fc1ea644\', \'multiverseId\': 487853}, \'multiverseid\': 487853}, {\'name\': \'護林人的智謀\', \'text\': \'直到回合結束，目標由你操控的生物得+1/+1且獲得辟邪異能。（它不能成為由對手操控之咒語或異能的目標。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「如果絲毫不掩蔽行蹤，你將無法在野地存活。」\\n～召獸使賈路\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488112&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cbec8a4-e209-4f8e-9684-bda99e0bcf4b\', \'multiverseId\': 488112}, \'multiverseid\': 488112}]', '[{\'name\': \'Argousine de la guilde des voleurs\', \'text\': "Flash\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Argousine de la guilde des voleurs ou un autre gredin arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, chaque adversaire meule deux cartes.\\nTant qu\'un adversaire a au moins huit cartes dans son cimetière, l\'Argousine de la guilde des voleurs gagne +2/+1 et a le contact mortel.", \'type\': \'Créature : Humain et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488312&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17b3d499-58c2-4da7-b042-43f079f0f046\', \'multiverseId\': 488312}, \'multiverseid\': 488312}, {\'name\': \'盗賊ギルドの処罰者\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n盗賊ギルドの処罰者か他のならず者が１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれカードを２枚切削する。\\n対戦相手１人の墓地にカードが８枚以上あるかぎり、盗賊ギルドの処罰者は＋２/＋１の修整を受け接死を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba8106c3-d479-4806-ac97-51afd3b80681\', \'multiverseId\': 488364}, \'multiverseid\': 488364}]', "[{'name': 'Auffälliger Schnüffler', 'text': 'Die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ist offen.\\nDu kannst Goblin-Zaubersprüche oben von deiner Bibliothek wirken.\\nSolange die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek eine Goblin-Karte ist, hat der Auffällige Schnüffler alle aktivierten Fähigkeiten jener Karte.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Goblin, Räuber', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485721&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3fcfad05-2827-4ab6-9c66-81249ae29c1b', 'multiverseId': 485721}, 'multiverseid': 485721}, {'name': 'Fisgón evidente', 'text': 'Juega mostrando la primera carta de tu biblioteca.\\nPuedes lanzar hechizos de Trasgo desde la parte superior de tu biblioteca.\\nMientras la primera carta de tu biblioteca sea una carta de Trasgo, el Fisgón evidente tiene todas las habilidades activadas de esa carta.', 'type': 'Criatura — Bribón trasgo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485980&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9a6c5dce-f0f8-491a-b363-e73ed6f38858', 'multiverseId': 485980}, 'multiverseid': 485980}, {'name': 'Fouineur flagrant', 'text': 'Jouez avec la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque révélée.\\nVous pouvez lancer des sorts de gobelin depuis le dessus de votre bibliothèque.\\nTant que la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque est une carte de gobelin, le Fouineur flagrant a toutes les capacités activées de cette carte.', 'type': 'Créature : gobelin et gredin', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486239&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4a02264a-1ac0-43a0-8818-07f95b11a7f3', 'multiverseId': 486239}, 'multiverseid': 486239}, {'name': 'Ficcanaso Sfacciato', 'text': 'Gioca con la prima carta del tuo grimorio rivelata.\\nPuoi lanciare magie Goblin dalla cima del tuo grimorio.\\nFintanto che la prima carta del tuo grimorio è una carta Goblin, il Ficcanaso Sfacciato ha tutte le abilità attivate di quella carta.', 'type': 'Creatura — Farabutto Goblin', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486498&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '31dd4434-acd6-4320-b751-56f05d011d22', 'multiverseId': 486498}, 'multiverseid': 486498}, {'name': '人目を引く詮索者', 'text': 'あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを公開したままプレイする。\\nあなたはあなたのライブラリーの一番上からゴブリン・呪文を唱えてもよい。\\nあなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードがゴブリン・カードであるかぎり、人目を引く詮索者はそのカードの起動型能力をすべて持つ。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・ならず者', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486757&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2d499727-3a29-4ce6-bd55-7c8719fc1087', 'multiverseId': 486757}, 'multiverseid': 486757}, {'name': '눈에 띄는 염탐꾼', 'text': '당신의 서고 맨 위 카드를 공개한 채로 게임을 진행한다.\\n당신은 당신의 서고 맨 위에서 고블린 주문들을 발동할 수 있다.\\n당신의 서고 맨 위 카드가 고블린 카드인 한, 눈에 띄는 염탐꾼은 그 카드의 모든 활성화능력을 가진다.', 'type': '생물 — 고블린 도적', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487016&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8341cfea-cb99-476b-99a9-03f9bbfe2a03', 'multiverseId': 487016}, 'multiverseid': 487016}, {'name': 'Bisbilhoteiro Chamativo', 'text': 'Jogue com o card do topo de seu grimório revelado.\\nVocê pode conjurar mágicas de Goblin do topo de seu grimório.\\nEnquanto o card do topo de seu grimório for um card de Goblin, Bisbilhoteiro Chamativo terá todas as habilidades ativadas daquele card.', 'type': 'Criatura — Goblin Ladino', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487275&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f7e1f4fc-fe9a-4733-a7bc-544b25394c2e', 'multiverseId': 487275}, 'multiverseid': 487275}, {'name': 'Примечательный Шпик', 'text': 'Играйте с открытой верхней картой вашей библиотеки.\\nВы можете разыгрывать заклинания Гоблинов с верха вашей библиотеки.\\nПока верхняя карта вашей библиотеки является картой Гоблина, Примечательный Шпик имеет все активируемые способности той карты.', 'type': 'Существо — Гоблин Бродяга', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487534&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b1459974-57be-420e-8d17-1090d69b7b5d', 'multiverseId': 487534}, 'multiverseid': 487534}, {'name': '张扬嗅探客', 'text': '你以展示牌库顶牌的方式进行游戏。\\n你可以从你的牌库顶施放鬼怪咒语。\\n只要你的牌库顶牌是鬼怪牌，张扬嗅探客便具有该牌的所有起动式异能。', 'type': '生物 ～鬼怪／浪客', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487793&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '161506ff-1ef5-42b7-b915-be92e45a825a', 'multiverseId': 487793}, 'multiverseid': 487793}, {'name': '張揚嗅探客', 'text': '你以展示牌庫頂牌的方式進行遊戲。\\n你可以從你的牌庫頂施放鬼怪咒語。\\n只要你的牌庫頂牌是鬼怪牌，張揚嗅探客便具有該牌的所有起動式異能。', 'type': '生物 ～鬼怪／浪客', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488052&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '55a2a50b-7da8-4a41-b6ad-69f6e580276e', 'multiverseId': 488052}, 'multiverseid': 488052}]", '[{\'name\': \'Auflodern\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +2/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Die grenzenlose Wut der ersten Gruul wurde durch ein riesiges Feuer am Anbeginn der Zeit gespeist. Dieselbe Flamme brennt auch in dir."\\n—Kroshkar, Gruul-Schamane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485716&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'346ce472-0b56-40ab-8046-b874b45231c0\', \'multiverseId\': 485716}, \'multiverseid\': 485716}, {\'name\': \'Arder de rabia\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas que controlas obtienen +2/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"En una gran hoguera en el albor de los tiempos, los primeros gruul encendieron su ira. La misma llama arde en ti".\\n—Kroshkar, chamán gruul\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485975&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45bc802f-66c0-4514-a1d0-9fc192eb2748\', \'multiverseId\': 485975}, \'multiverseid\': 485975}, {\'name\': \'Pleins feux\', \'text\': "Les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« À l\'aube des temps, le premier Gruul a attisé sa rage dans un grand feu de joie. Cette même flamme brûle en vous. »\\n—Kroshkar, shamane gruul", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486234&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dae151d1-165d-455e-a9e7-a1f5a17a29e5\', \'multiverseId\': 486234}, \'multiverseid\': 486234}, {\'name\': \'Avvampare\', \'text\': \'Le creature che controlli prendono +2/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Da un grande rogo all\\\'alba dei tempi, i primi Gruul accesero la loro furia. La stessa fiamma brucia dentro di te."\\n—Kroshkar, sciamano Gruul\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486493&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6216e8c9-8809-4f83-8b8f-250a7e3c105a\', \'multiverseId\': 486493}, \'multiverseid\': 486493}, {\'name\': \'燃えさかる炎\', \'text\': \'ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「太古の昔の大かがり火で、最初のグルールは怒りを燃え立たせた。お前の中には同じ炎が燃えている。」\\n――グルールのシャーマン、クロシュカー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486752&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'deddf7b4-2794-4073-a14a-1e20c53d642d\', \'multiverseId\': 486752}, \'multiverseid\': 486752}, {\'name\': \'밝게 태우기\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물들은 턴종료까지 +2/+0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"여명의 시간에 일어난 거대한 불길 속에서, 최초의 그룰이 분노에 불을 지폈다. 그때와 같은 불길이 네 안에서도 불타고 있다."\\n—그룰 주술사 크로슈카르\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487011&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'226be84c-da72-456f-bfeb-bcb342456bf7\', \'multiverseId\': 487011}, \'multiverseid\': 487011}, {\'name\': \'Ira Ardente\', \'text\': \'As criaturas que você controla recebem +2/+0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Da grande fogueira da aurora dos tempos os primeiros Gruul inflamaram a própria fúria. A mesma chama arde em você."\\n— Kroshkar, xamã Gruul\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e4d7cb2-2f45-411a-aa1c-4d55b37df035\', \'multiverseId\': 487270}, \'multiverseid\': 487270}, {\'name\': \'Яркий Огонь\', \'text\': \'Существа под вашим контролем получают +2/+0 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Из великого костра на заре времен Груулы почерпнули огонь своей ярости. То же пламя горит и в тебе».\\n— Крошкар, шаман Груулов\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a51766ad-9469-4296-b08a-891f8d53939d\', \'multiverseId\': 487529}, \'multiverseid\': 487529}, {\'name\': \'怒火冲天\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物得+2/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「古鲁人血液中的怒火，从先人在创世之初升起第一簇盛大篝火起就开始燃烧，一直延续至今。这股怒火同样也在你的体内燃烧。」\\n～古鲁祭师克许卡\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487788&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'858bcf3a-b7bb-4633-a81a-d66f1931737a\', \'multiverseId\': 487788}, \'multiverseid\': 487788}, {\'name\': \'怒火沖天\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物得+2/+0直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「古魯人血液中的怒火，從先人在創世之初升起第一簇盛大篝火起就開始燃燒，一直延續至今。這股怒火同樣也在你的體內燃燒。」\\n～古魯祭師克許卡\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488047&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84ffc17a-067c-40c1-99e3-858c836eb632\', \'multiverseId\': 488047}, \'multiverseid\': 488047}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufspüren\', \'text\': \'Hellsicht 3, decke dann die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek auf. Falls es eine Kreaturen- oder Länderkarte ist, ziehe eine Karte. (Schaue dir für Hellsicht 3 die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst eine beliebige Anzahl davon unter deine Bibliothek legen und den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge oben darauf.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Gerüche verblassen und Fußspuren verschwinden, aber einige Spuren können nie gelöscht werden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485793&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e89b6ab-59c2-456e-9602-39912a05bceb\', \'multiverseId\': 485793}, \'multiverseid\': 485793}, {\'name\': \'Rastrear\', \'text\': \'Adivina 3, luego muestra la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Si es una carta de criatura o de tierra, roba una carta. (Para adivinar 3, mira las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, luego pon cualquier cantidad de ellas en el fondo de tu biblioteca y el resto en la parte superior en cualquier orden.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los olores y las pisadas desaparecen, pero algunos rastros no se pueden borrar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486052&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e012f29-df11-4f75-b955-0d3bd9b89207\', \'multiverseId\': 486052}, \'multiverseid\': 486052}, {\'name\': \'Traque\', \'text\': "Regard 3, puis révélez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Si c\'est une carte de créature ou de terrain, piochez une carte. (Pour appliquer regard 3, regardez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez n\'importe quel nombre d\'entre elles au-dessous de votre bibliothèque et le reste au-dessus, dans un ordre aléatoire.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Les odeurs s\'estompent et les empreintes s\'effacent, mais certaines pistes ne disparaissent jamais.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486311&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c76a4499-fb3f-46f7-b374-15a87d850ac4\', \'multiverseId\': 486311}, \'multiverseid\': 486311}, {\'name\': \'Rintracciare\', \'text\': \'Profetizza 3, poi rivela la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Se è una carta creatura o terra, pesca una carta. (Per profetizzare 3, guarda le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio, poi mettine un qualsiasi numero in fondo al tuo grimorio e le altre in cima in qualsiasi ordine.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Gli odori si dileguano e le impronte svaniscono, ma alcune tracce sono indelebili.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486570&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cde50ba-7459-4298-a631-33e12ede7974\', \'multiverseId\': 486570}, \'multiverseid\': 486570}, {\'name\': \'突き止め\', \'text\': \'占術３を行い、その後あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを公開する。それがクリーチャーや土地であるカードなら、カードを１枚引く。（占術３とは、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを３枚見て、そのうち望む枚数をあなたのライブラリーの一番下に、残りを一番上に、それぞれ望む順番で置くことである。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'匂いは薄れ足跡は洗い流されるが、決して消せない痕跡もある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486829&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8dcc4942-9c54-4d4a-8d72-6adf4b54f0bf\', \'multiverseId\': 486829}, \'multiverseid\': 486829}, {\'name\': \'추적하기\', \'text\': \'점술 3을 한 후, 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드를 공개한다. 그 카드가 생물 또는 대지 카드라면, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다. (점술 3을 하려면, 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 세 장을 본다. 당신은 그 카드들 중 원하는 만큼을 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓고 나머지를 당신의 서고 맨 위에 원하는 순서대로 놓을 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'냄새는 희미해지고 발자국은 씻겨 사라지지만, 어떤 흔적들은 절대로 없어지지 않는다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487088&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4218e20b-9c19-469f-96ae-642dd05dde81\', \'multiverseId\': 487088}, \'multiverseid\': 487088}, {\'name\': \'Rastrear\', \'text\': \'Use vidência 3 e depois revele o card do topo do seu grimório. Se for um card de criatura ou terreno, compre um card. (Para usar vidência 3, olhe os três cards do topo do seu grimório. Depois, coloque qualquer número deles no fundo do seu grimório e o resto no topo em qualquer ordem.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Cheiros desvanecem e pegadas somem, mas alguns rastros jamais se apagam.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487347&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e30b3af4-80cb-4a2e-88d1-a0ea8ad6c929\', \'multiverseId\': 487347}, \'multiverseid\': 487347}, {\'name\': \'Выслеживание\', \'text\': \'Предскажите 3, затем покажите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Если это карта существа или земли, возьмите карту. (Чтобы предсказать 3, посмотрите три верхние карты вашей библиотеки, затем положите любое количество из них в низ вашей библиотеки, а остальные на верх вашей библиотеки в любом порядке.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Запахи пропадают, а отпечатки лап смывает дождь, но некоторые следы не стереть никогда.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487606&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d207ffaa-8013-4db8-bf45-22de56fd2eb2\', \'multiverseId\': 487606}, \'multiverseid\': 487606}, {\'name\': \'追查行踪\', \'text\': \'占卜3，然后展示你的牌库顶牌。如果它是生物或地牌，则抓一张牌。（占卜3的流程是检视你牌库顶的三张牌，然后将其中任意数量的牌以任意顺序置于你牌库底，其余则以任意顺序置于你牌库顶。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'虽然气味会消散，足印会模糊，但有些踪迹永不会被抹灭。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487865&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4b4e03e-63cd-4178-b286-249dbfcce446\', \'multiverseId\': 487865}, \'multiverseid\': 487865}, {\'name\': \'追查行蹤\', \'text\': \'占卜3，然後展示你的牌庫頂牌。如果它是生物或地牌，則抽一張牌。（占卜3的流程是檢視你牌庫頂的三張牌，然後將其中任意數量的牌以任意順序置於你牌庫底，其餘則以任意順序置於你牌庫頂。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'雖然氣味會消散，足印會模糊，但有些蹤跡永不會被抹滅。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c777a17d-d829-463a-bae3-b629b5d548a3\', \'multiverseId\': 488124}, \'multiverseid\': 488124}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufwühlende Lektüre\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nWenn die Aufwühlende Lektüre ins Spiel kommt, ziehe zwei Karten und wirf dann eine Karte ab.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1 und hat Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Große Literatur kann den Leser beflügeln.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485649&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fe6e6f8-41c0-441d-a72e-501444b2aa7b\', \'multiverseId\': 485649}, \'multiverseid\': 485649}, {\'name\': \'Lectura estimulante\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nCuando la Lectura estimulante entre al campo de batalla, roba dos cartas, luego descarta una carta.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1 y tiene la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Una gran lectura puede transportar a su lector.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485908&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b103708-e035-4eb3-8dd5-e6b3ed906d20\', \'multiverseId\': 485908}, \'multiverseid\': 485908}, {\'name\': \'Envolée lyrique\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nQuand l\'Envolée lyrique arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez deux cartes, puis défaussez-vous d\'une carte.\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+1 et a le vol.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': \'Les meilleurs livres transportent le lecteur.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486167&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'240df77d-e9e1-4374-ae91-d7103ebfe3fa\', \'multiverseId\': 486167}, \'multiverseid\': 486167}, {\'name\': \'Lettura Stimolante\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nQuando la Lettura Stimolante entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca due carte, poi scarta una carta.\\nLa creatura incantata prende +1/+1 e ha volare.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'La grande letteratura riesce a trasportare lontano il lettore.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97d4a844-6b77-45f9-a1cf-58c8e2bf2339\', \'multiverseId\': 486426}, \'multiverseid\': 486426}, {\'name\': \'高揚する書物\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\n高揚する書物が戦場に出たとき、カードを２枚引き、その後カード１枚を捨てる。\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは、＋１/＋１の修整を受け飛行を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'名著は読者を浮き浮きさせる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486685&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c64eee60-d842-4962-a5f0-75e557434f1d\', \'multiverseId\': 486685}, \'multiverseid\': 486685}, {\'name\': \'열렬한 독서\', \'text\': \'생물에게 부여\\n열렬한 독서가 전장에 들어올 때, 카드 두 장을 뽑은 후, 카드 한 장을 버린다.\\n부여된 생물은 +1/+1을 받고 비행을 가진다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'위대한 저서는 독자를 움직일 수 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486944&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b32da03-34e6-4021-8390-69d8697151d2\', \'multiverseId\': 486944}, \'multiverseid\': 486944}, {\'name\': \'Leitura Estimulante\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nQuando Leitura Estimulante entrar no campo de batalha, compre dois cards e depois descarte um card.\\nA criatura encantada recebe +1/+1 e tem voar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'A boa literatura eleva o leitor.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e226b127-7b25-4665-82ee-f1356214f14c\', \'multiverseId\': 487203}, \'multiverseid\': 487203}, {\'name\': \'Окрыляющее Чтиво\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nКогда Окрыляющее Чтиво выходит на поле битвы, возьмите две карты, затем сбросьте карту.\\nЗачарованное существо получает +1/+1 и имеет Полет.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'Хорошая книга увлекает читателя за собой.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487462&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44a8b6cb-9848-4514-934d-0b93eac87e49\', \'multiverseId\': 487462}, \'multiverseid\': 487462}, {\'name\': \'开卷有得\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n当开卷有得进战场时，抓两张牌，然后弃一张牌。\\n所结附的生物得+1/+1且具有飞行异能。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'伟大的书籍能令读者通天。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487721&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32ccc4ee-ec3d-4ed9-98e2-55090848aa22\', \'multiverseId\': 487721}, \'multiverseid\': 487721}, {\'name\': \'開卷有得\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n當開卷有得進戰場時，抽兩張牌，然後棄一張牌。\\n所結附的生物得+1/+1且具有飛行異能。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'偉大的書籍能令讀者通天。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487980&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'943c30fa-8dd2-48a5-a520-136ab5944731\', \'multiverseId\': 487980}, \'multiverseid\': 487980}]', '[{\'name\': \'Avior-Scharmeister\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Avior-Scharmeister ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du für jede fliegende Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Die Ausrüstung eines Aviors ist verzaubert, damit sie ihn bei luftigen Manövern nicht nach unten zieht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485587&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9602c9aa-1ebb-46ed-a6c9-09dd4080f457\', \'multiverseId\': 485587}, \'multiverseid\': 485587}, {\'name\': \'Líder de la bandada aven\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Líder de la bandada aven entre al campo de batalla, ganas 2 vidas por cada criatura que controlas con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero ave\', \'flavor\': \'El equipo de un aven está encantado para aligerar su peso durante las maniobras aéreas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485846&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'661e2957-363d-4bee-8eb0-0a19c86fcbca\', \'multiverseId\': 485846}, \'multiverseid\': 485846}, {\'name\': \'Maître du troupeau avemain\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nQuand le Maître du troupeau avemain arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 2 points de vie pour chaque créature avec le vol que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "L\'équipement avemain est enchanté pour rester léger lors des manœuvres aériennes.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486105&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'377c3d11-8502-46bd-8982-bbb48421833c\', \'multiverseId\': 486105}, \'multiverseid\': 486105}, {\'name\': \'Capostormo Aviano\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando il Capostormo Aviano entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 2 punti vita per ogni creatura con volare che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Uccello\', \'flavor\': "L\'equipaggiamento degli aviani è incantato per evitare di appesantirli durante le manovre aeree.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79485799-a6be-4188-8c9a-ae6f7dfd1a06\', \'multiverseId\': 486364}, \'multiverseid\': 486364}, {\'name\': \'エイヴンの鳥群使い\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nエイヴンの鳥群使いが戦場に出たとき、あなたはあなたがコントロールしていて飛行を持つクリーチャー１体につき２点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'エイヴンの装備には魔法が掛かっており、空中行動中の負担を軽くしてある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a06f70e9-c437-4ccd-8960-70d1745c5dd4\', \'multiverseId\': 486623}, \'multiverseid\': 486623}, {\'name\': \'에이븐 대장거위\', \'text\': \'비행\\n에이븐 대장거위가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 당신이 조종하는 비행을 가진 생물 한 개당 생명 2점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 조류 전사\', \'flavor\': \'에이븐의 장비는 공중 전술을 펼칠 때 무게가 방해되지 않도록 마법이 부여되어 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486882&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0777283d-bf79-40d0-9231-42db4ab8c777\', \'multiverseId\': 486882}, \'multiverseid\': 486882}, {\'name\': \'Grasnomestre Aviano\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Grasnomestre Aviano entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 2 pontos de vida para cada criatura que você controla com voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'O equipamento aviano é encantado para não pesar durante as manobras aéreas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487141&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bb5424a-25ef-4cab-bff3-4edeb3df949a\', \'multiverseId\': 487141}, \'multiverseid\': 487141}, {\'name\': \'Авен, Гогочущий Командир\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Авен, Гогочущий Командир выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете 2 жизни за каждое существо с Полетом под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Птица Воин\', \'flavor\': \'Снаряжение авенов зачаровано, чтобы не тянуть их к земле во время воздушных маневров.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487400&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe2aa5b8-b043-45e2-893c-a1d4c8d49f55\', \'multiverseId\': 487400}, \'multiverseid\': 487400}, {\'name\': \'艾文头鹅\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当艾文头鹅进战场时，你每操控一个具飞行异能的生物，便获得2点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鸟／战士\', \'flavor\': \'艾文装备都经过轻盈魔法加持，避免拖累他们在空中的灵活行动。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487659&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ddbf9019-887b-4fee-8593-c81b4c6d972a\', \'multiverseId\': 487659}, \'multiverseid\': 487659}, {\'name\': \'艾文頭鵝\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當艾文頭鵝進戰場時，你每操控一個具飛行異能的生物，便獲得2點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鳥／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'艾文裝備都經過輕盈魔法加持，避免拖累他們在空中的靈活行動。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487918&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad36ca33-db7d-4d00-a022-b9b1ffce1f46\', \'multiverseId\': 487918}, \'multiverseid\': 487918}]', '[{\'name\': \'Azusa die Suchende\', \'text\': \'Du darfst in jedem deiner Züge zwei zusätzliche Länder spielen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Mönch\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich vermisse den Jukai-Wald nicht. Er ist nicht meine Heimat. Meine Heimat ist Kamigawa, seine Bewohner meine Familie. Wo auch immer ich mein Bündel absetze und mich ausruhe, bin ich zu Hause."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485755&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'308cb9f9-5e14-43a1-84b8-ef7196a14250\', \'multiverseId\': 485755}, \'multiverseid\': 485755}, {\'name\': \'Azusa, perdida pero buscando\', \'text\': \'Puedes jugar dos tierras adicionales en cada uno de tus turnos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Monje humano\', \'flavor\': \'"No echo de menos el bosque Jukai; no es mi hogar. Mi hogar es Kamigawa; su gente es mi familia. Mi hogar es allí donde dejo mis cosas para descansar".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486014&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f2fc1ef-7554-4183-a972-774778845f0c\', \'multiverseId\': 486014}, \'multiverseid\': 486014}, {\'name\': \'Azusa, égarée mais en quête\', \'text\': \'Vous pouvez jouer deux terrains supplémentaires pendant chacun de vos tours.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et moine\', \'flavor\': "« La forêt de Jukai ne me manque pas. Ce n\'est pas mon foyer. Kamigawa est mon foyer, et son peuple est ma famille. Peu importe où je pose mes affaires et où je me repose, je suis chez moi. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486273&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef3a535a-305f-43c4-a998-c5e5c677adca\', \'multiverseId\': 486273}, \'multiverseid\': 486273}, {\'name\': \'Azusa, Smarrita ma Cercatrice\', \'text\': \'Puoi giocare due terre addizionali in ognuno dei tuoi turni.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Monaco Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Non rimpiango la Foresta Jukai. Non è la mia casa. La mia casa è Kamigawa, la sua gente è la mia famiglia. Ovunque io ponga il mio sacco e la mia testa, quella è casa mia."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486532&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b90b34b5-77c1-44bb-8aa3-847f89cbf3e4\', \'multiverseId\': 486532}, \'multiverseid\': 486532}, {\'name\': \'迷える探求者、梓\', \'text\': \'あなたの各ターンに、あなたは追加で土地を２つプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・モンク\', \'flavor\': \'「樹海が恋しくなどない。あれはわが故郷にあらず。わが故郷は神河であり、そこに住む者こそ家族。荷を解いて頭を横たえた場所こそわが故郷。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486791&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5057a14-3492-4731-a818-80ef8bd8a7d3\', \'multiverseId\': 486791}, \'multiverseid\': 486791}, {\'name\': \'방황하는 탐구자, 아즈사\', \'text\': \'당신은 당신의 매 턴마다 대지 두 개를 추가로 플레이할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 인간 승려\', \'flavor\': \'"난 주카이 숲이 그립지 않아. 내 고향은 그곳이 아니야. 내 고향은 카미가와이고, 카미가와의 사람들 모두가 내 가족이야. 언제든 내가 짐을 풀고 머리를 누이면, 그곳이 내 고향이야."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487050&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ebc97fe-fd9d-4f04-8c48-f41519ff949a\', \'multiverseId\': 487050}, \'multiverseid\': 487050}, {\'name\': \'Azusa, Perdida mas Procurando\', \'text\': \'Você pode jogar dois terrenos adicionais em cada um de seus turnos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Monge\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu não tenho saudade da Floresta de Jukai. Ela não é o meu lar. O meu lar é Kamigawa, e seu povo é minha família. Onde quer que pare para descansar, estou em casa."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487309&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85af2185-d385-472a-abd8-604f38c9be53\', \'multiverseId\': 487309}, \'multiverseid\': 487309}, {\'name\': \'Азуса, Потерянная, но Ищущая\', \'text\': \'Вы можете разыгрывать две дополнительные земли в каждом из ваших ходов.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Монах\', \'flavor\': \'«Я не скучаю по лесу Дзюкай. Это не мой дом. Мой дом — Камигава, а ее народ — моя семья. Там, где я ставлю свой мешок и укладываюсь спать, — там и есть мой дом».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e700c8a-9b69-44fd-a043-4509962be92b\', \'multiverseId\': 487568}, \'multiverseid\': 487568}, {\'name\': \'云游者梓纱\', \'text\': \'你在自己的每个回合中可以额外使用两个地。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／修行僧\', \'flavor\': \'「我并不怀念树海。我的家乡不是树海，而是整个神河；神河子民都是我的家人。不论我栖身何处，都像是回到了家。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487827&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'289a695b-bb24-43f5-a6a6-5c380549486a\', \'multiverseId\': 487827}, \'multiverseid\': 487827}, {\'name\': \'雲遊者梓紗\', \'text\': \'你在自己的每個回合中可以額外使用兩個地。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～人類／修行僧\', \'flavor\': \'「我並不懷念樹海。我的家鄉不是樹海，而是整個神河；神河子民都是我的家人。不論我棲身何處，都像是回到了家。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f67e16e2-e7dc-47d6-b6bb-3ffafcecff90\', \'multiverseId\': 488086}, \'multiverseid\': 488086}]', "[{'name': 'Azusa, égarée mais en quête', 'text': 'Vous pouvez jouer deux terrains supplémentaires pendant chacun de vos tours.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire : humain et moine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488323&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fa6baff8-90f8-4d0d-8b08-1cf18d1cf20c', 'multiverseId': 488323}, 'multiverseid': 488323}, {'name': '迷える探求者、梓', 'text': 'あなたの各ターンに、あなたは追加で土地を２つプレイしてもよい。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・モンク', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488375&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0b4245aa-9dbb-4c79-94c8-0caaf404806c', 'multiverseId': 488375}, 'multiverseid': 488375}]", "[{'name': 'Baleine pourchassée', 'text': 'Quand la Baleine pourchassée arrive sur le champ de bataille, chaque adversaire crée un jeton de créature 1/1 rouge Pirate avec « Cette créature ne peut pas bloquer » et « Les créatures que vous contrôlez attaquent à chaque combat si possible. »\\nLes sorts que vos adversaires lancent qui ciblent la Baleine pourchassée coûtent {3} de plus à lancer.', 'type': 'Créature : baleine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488302&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c66a61e8-3e46-4b4e-ac5b-080383059924', 'multiverseId': 488302}, 'multiverseid': 488302}, {'name': '追われる鯨', 'text': '追われる鯨が戦場に出たとき、各対戦相手はそれぞれ、「このクリーチャーではブロックできない。」と「各戦闘で、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーは可能なら攻撃する。」を持つ赤の１/１の海賊・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\n対戦相手が追われる鯨を対象として呪文を唱えるためのコストは{3}多くなる。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 鯨', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488354&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '42643e09-2ebd-43ce-9982-bf21e950225a', 'multiverseId': 488354}, 'multiverseid': 488354}]", '[{\'name\': \'Bannender Engel\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Erstschlag, Lebensverknüpfung, Schutz vor Dämonen und vor Drachen\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': \'Einige Engel beschützen die Schwachen und Unschuldigen. Andere stöbern das Böse auf und erschlagen es.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485588&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4868b58a-117a-4864-8dac-57e3a3fc4f02\', \'multiverseId\': 485588}, \'multiverseid\': 485588}, {\'name\': \'Ángel matademonios\', \'text\': \'Vuela, daña primero, vínculo vital, protección contra Demonios y contra Dragones.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel\', \'flavor\': \'Algunos ángeles protegen a los débiles e inocentes. Otros buscan y destruyen el mal donde sea que se esconda.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485847&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5ea87dc-baf9-4f95-8971-18d5ee7a4be8\', \'multiverseId\': 485847}, \'multiverseid\': 485847}, {\'name\': \'Ange pourfendeur\', \'text\': \'Vol, initiative, lien de vie, protection contre les démons et contre les dragons\', \'type\': \'Créature : ange\', \'flavor\': "Certains anges protègent les faibles et les innocents. D\'autres traquent sans cesse le mal pour le pourfendre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486106&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f86e7db4-400b-4a25-9edf-9123de70f356\', \'multiverseId\': 486106}, \'multiverseid\': 486106}, {\'name\': \'Angelo Flagellatore\', \'text\': \'Volare, attacco improvviso, legame vitale, protezione da Demoni e da Draghi\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Angelo\', \'flavor\': \'Alcuni angeli proteggono gli umili e gli innocenti. Altri scovano e puniscono il male ovunque si annidi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486365&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2929e276-5bf5-4b66-8d36-ccec19e2d867\', \'multiverseId\': 486365}, \'multiverseid\': 486365}, {\'name\': \'悪斬の天使\', \'text\': \'飛行、先制攻撃、絆魂、プロテクション（デーモン）、プロテクション（ドラゴン）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': \'弱く罪無き者を守る天使もいる。あるいは、潜む邪悪を探し滅する天使もいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15a2b046-eec7-4207-ac13-1bc03bf080fd\', \'multiverseId\': 486624}, \'multiverseid\': 486624}, {\'name\': \'악을 베는 천사\', \'text\': \'비행, 선제공격, 생명연결, 악마와 용으로부터 보호\', \'type\': \'생물 — 천사\', \'flavor\': \'힘없고 무고한 사람들을 보호하는 천사가 있는가 하면, 악을 징벌하러 나서는 천사도 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486883&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7491da8-3a1f-47b0-ba7b-5884c1ab3fb3\', \'multiverseId\': 486883}, \'multiverseid\': 486883}, {\'name\': \'Anjo Exterminador do Mal\', \'text\': \'Voar, iniciativa, vínculo com a vida, proteção contra Demônios e contra Dragões\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anjo\', \'flavor\': \'Alguns anjos protegem os fracos e os inocentes. Outros perseguem e destroem o mal onde quer que se esconda.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'caef9be3-906b-4255-a8bb-c7cd3d9216d1\', \'multiverseId\': 487142}, \'multiverseid\': 487142}, {\'name\': \'Ангел, Истребитель Зла\', \'text\': \'Полет, Первый удар, Цепь жизни, Защита от Демонов и от Драконов\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ангел\', \'flavor\': \'Одни ангелы защищают смиренных и невинных. Другие же преследуют и карают зло, где бы оно ни притаилось.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487401&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'359a9a7b-f33c-4524-8ec3-183907f2314f\', \'multiverseId\': 487401}, \'multiverseid\': 487401}, {\'name\': \'破邪天使\', \'text\': \'飞行，先攻，系命，反恶魔保护，反龙保护\', \'type\': \'生物 ～天使\', \'flavor\': \'有些天使负责保护弱小与无辜者。其他的则征伐邪恶潜藏处。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487660&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90befde9-ed61-47a5-9a13-33a946b73675\', \'multiverseId\': 487660}, \'multiverseid\': 487660}, {\'name\': \'破邪天使\', \'text\': \'飛行，先攻，繫命，反惡魔保護，反龍保護\', \'type\': \'生物 ～天使\', \'flavor\': \'有些天使負責保護弱小與無辜者。其他的則征伐邪惡潛藏處。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487919&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'682962d1-46d9-4ffc-8947-16f1670fad74\', \'multiverseId\': 487919}, \'multiverseid\': 487919}]', '[{\'name\': \'Barrin, archimage tolarian\', \'text\': "Quand Barrin, archimage tolarian arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez jusqu\'à une autre cible, créature ou planeswalker, dans la main de son propriétaire.\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, si un permanent a été mis dans votre main depuis le champ de bataille ce tour-ci, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488299&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0d96cf5-293d-440e-bda6-bc8a9185c4f0\', \'multiverseId\': 488299}, \'multiverseid\': 488299}, {\'name\': \'トレイリアの大魔導師、バリン\', \'text\': \'トレイリアの大魔導師、バリンが戦場に出たとき、他の、クリーチャーかプレインズウォーカー最大１体を対象とし、それをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、このターンにパーマネントが戦場からあなたの手札に加えられていた場合、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488351&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15b334a0-bd3a-403d-8e02-a9cb8b921f9a\', \'multiverseId\': 488351}, \'multiverseid\': 488351}]', '[{\'name\': \'Barrin, tolarianischer Erzmagier\', \'text\': \'Wenn Barrin, tolarianischer Erzmagier, ins Spiel kommt, bringe bis zu eine andere Kreatur oder einen anderen Planeswalker deiner Wahl auf die Hand ihres bzw. seines Besitzers zurück.\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments und falls in diesem Zug eine bleibende Karte aus dem Spiel auf deine Hand gebracht wurde, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Es gibt kein Alter, in dem man aufhört zu lernen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485627&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4e44004-ac78-4cfa-9c04-97a8c24afb32\', \'multiverseId\': 485627}, \'multiverseid\': 485627}, {\'name\': \'Barrin, archimago tolariano\', \'text\': \'Cuando Barrin, archimago tolariano entre al campo de batalla, regresa hasta una otra criatura o planeswalker objetivo a la mano de su propietario.\\nAl comienzo de tu paso final, si un permanente se puso en tu mano desde el campo de batalla este turno, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"No hay una edad a la cual dejas de aprender".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485886&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa5e0455-1e78-4303-b378-d3cf3e0df394\', \'multiverseId\': 485886}, \'multiverseid\': 485886}, {\'name\': \'Barrin, archimage tolarian\', \'text\': "Quand Barrin, archimage tolarian arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez jusqu\'à une autre cible, créature ou planeswalker, dans la main de son propriétaire.\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, si un permanent a été mis dans votre main depuis le champ de bataille ce tour-ci, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Il n\'y a pas d\'âge pour apprendre. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486145&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68613a60-8498-47d2-86a8-c87159af970f\', \'multiverseId\': 486145}, \'multiverseid\': 486145}, {\'name\': \'Barrin, Arcimago di Tolaria\', \'text\': "Quando Barrin, Arcimago di Tolaria entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare fino a un\'altra creatura o planeswalker bersaglio in mano al suo proprietario.\\nAll\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, se hai ripreso in mano un permanente dal campo di battaglia in questo turno, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Non esiste un\\\'età a cui si smette di imparare."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486404&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fca624ac-9ab3-4004-a422-7c8a46c0da4e\', \'multiverseId\': 486404}, \'multiverseid\': 486404}, {\'name\': \'トレイリアの大魔導師、バリン\', \'text\': \'トレイリアの大魔導師、バリンが戦場に出たとき、他の、クリーチャーかプレインズウォーカー最大１体を対象とし、それをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、このターンにパーマネントが戦場からあなたの手札に加えられていた場合、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「学びを止める年齢など存在しない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486663&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1fe8d7e-da63-4fd8-924d-a6870f3bd2e5\', \'multiverseId\': 486663}, \'multiverseid\': 486663}, {\'name\': \'톨라리아의 대마도사, 바린\', \'text\': \'톨라리아의 대마도사, 바린이 전장에 들어올 때, 다른 생물 또는 플레인즈워커를 최대 한 개까지 목표로 정한다. 그 목표를 소유자의 손으로 되돌린다.\\n당신의 종료단 시작에, 이번 턴에 지속물이 전장에서 당신의 손에 놓였다면, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 인간 마법사\', \'flavor\': \'"배움이 멈추는 나이란 건 없다네."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486922&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52f15091-329d-4d76-a7fa-43a5a68e9700\', \'multiverseId\': 486922}, \'multiverseid\': 486922}, {\'name\': \'Barrin, Arquimago Tolariano\', \'text\': \'Quando Barrin, Arquimago Tolariano, entrar no campo de batalha, devolva até uma outra criatura ou planeswalker alvo para a mão de seu dono.\\nNo início de sua etapa final, se uma permanente tiver sido colocada em sua mão do campo de batalha neste turno, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"O aprendizado não tem idade."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9dd38ada-76ea-45db-8792-b301265be9e0\', \'multiverseId\': 487181}, \'multiverseid\': 487181}, {\'name\': \'Баррин, Толарианский Архимаг\', \'text\': "Когда Баррин, Толарианский Архимаг выходит на поле битвы, верните не более одного другого целевого существа или planeswalker\'а в руку его владельца.\\nВ начале вашего заключительного шага, если перманент был положен в вашу руку с поля битвы в этом ходу, возьмите карту.", \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Учиться никогда не поздно».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487440&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ee4917d-5cc4-4cbf-b931-ddcc08cd3e5e\', \'multiverseId\': 487440}, \'multiverseid\': 487440}, {\'name\': \'陶拉里亚大法师巴林\', \'text\': \'当陶拉里亚大法师巴林进战场时，将至多另一个目标生物或鹏洛客移回其拥有者手上。\\n在你的结束步骤开始时，若本回合中有永久物从战场置于你手上，则抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「没有老到学不动的时候。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487699&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66fc6b22-8ba4-4435-8a3d-659be71b4a5b\', \'multiverseId\': 487699}, \'multiverseid\': 487699}, {\'name\': \'陶拉里亞大法師巴林\', \'text\': \'當陶拉里亞大法師巴林進戰場時，將至多另一個目標生物或鵬洛客移回其擁有者手上。\\n在你的結束步驟開始時，若本回合中有永久物從戰場置於你手上，則抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～人類／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'「沒有老到學不動的時候。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487958&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0356fab3-0f52-4bc7-8961-f3b3ee67b350\', \'multiverseId\': 487958}, \'multiverseid\': 487958}]', '[{\'name\': \'Basri Ket\', \'text\': \'+1: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Sie erhält Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n−2: Immer wenn eine oder mehrere Nichtspielsteinkreaturen in diesem Zug angreifen, erzeuge entsprechend viele getappte und angreifende 1/1 weiße Soldat-Kreaturenspielsteine.\\n−6: Du erhältst ein Emblem mit „Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug erzeugst du einen 1/1 weißen Soldat-Kreaturenspielstein und legst dann auf jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, eine +1/+1-Marke."\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Basri\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485589&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84625882-41a1-44e1-b6bb-43e3e581c625\', \'multiverseId\': 485589}, \'multiverseid\': 485589}, {\'name\': \'Basri Ket\', \'text\': \'+1: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre hasta una criatura objetivo. Gana la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno.\\n−2: Siempre que una o más criaturas que no sean fichas ataquen este turno, crea esa misma cantidad de fichas de criatura Soldado blancas 1/1 giradas y atacando.\\n−6: Obtienes un emblema con "Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, crea una ficha de criatura Soldado blanca 1/1, luego pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada criatura que controlas".\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Basri\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485848&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61de000d-9ce0-414c-a717-4a39893bba12\', \'multiverseId\': 485848}, \'multiverseid\': 485848}, {\'name\': \'Basri Ket\', \'text\': "+1: Ciblez jusqu\'à une créature. Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle. Elle acquiert l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n-2: À chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature non-jeton attaque ce tour-ci, créez autant de jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Soldat, engagés et attaquants.\\n-6: Vous gagnez un emblème avec « Au début du combat pendant votre tour, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Soldat, puis mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature que vous contrôlez. »", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Basri\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486107&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5cbc4b2-a7b4-4c13-a039-1280f9840852\', \'multiverseId\': 486107}, \'multiverseid\': 486107}, {\'name\': \'Basri Ket\', \'text\': \'+1: Scegli fino a una creatura bersaglio. Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa. Ha indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno.\\n-2: Ogniqualvolta una o più creature non pedina attaccano in questo turno, crea altrettante pedine creatura Soldato 1/1 bianche TAPpate e attaccanti.\\n-6: Ottieni un emblema con "All\\\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, crea una pedina creatura Soldato 1/1 bianca, poi metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni creatura che controlli".\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Basri\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486366&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9a4f1a3-925b-49da-8732-5f71622a624b\', \'multiverseId\': 486366}, \'multiverseid\': 486366}, {\'name\': \'バスリ・ケト\', \'text\': \'+1：クリーチャー最大１体を対象とし、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。ターン終了時まで、それは破壊不能を得る。\\n-2：このターン、トークンでないクリーチャーが１体以上攻撃するたび、その数に等しい数の白の１/１の兵士・クリーチャー・トークンをタップ状態かつ攻撃している状態で生成する。\\n-6：あなたは「あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、白の１/１の兵士・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成し、その後あなたがコントロールしている各クリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをそれぞれ１個置く。」を持つ紋章を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — バスリ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fa53ad0-1791-47ed-910f-1baf5d357ced\', \'multiverseId\': 486625}, \'multiverseid\': 486625}, {\'name\': \'바스리 케트\', \'text\': \'+1: 생물을 최대 한 개까지 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 무적을 얻는다.\\n−2: 이번 턴에 토큰이 아닌 생물 한 개 이상이 공격할 때마다, 탭되어 공격 중인 1/1 백색 병사 생물 토큰을 그 수만큼 만든다.\\n−6: 당신은 "당신의 턴 전투 시작에, 1/1 백색 병사 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든 후, 당신이 조종하는 각 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개씩을 올려놓는다."를 가진 휘장을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 플레인즈워커 — 바스리\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486884&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92999c66-b071-434a-8512-6c481af391d9\', \'multiverseId\': 486884}, \'multiverseid\': 486884}, {\'name\': \'Basri Ket\', \'text\': \'+1: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em até uma criatura alvo. Ela ganha indestrutível até o final do turno.\\n−2: Toda vez que uma ou mais criaturas que não sejam fichas atacarem neste turno, crie aquela quantidade de fichas de criatura branca 1/1 do tipo Soldado viradas e atacando.\\n−6: Você recebe um emblema com "No início do combate no seu turno, crie uma ficha de criatura branca 1/1 do tipo Soldado e, em seguida, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada criatura que você controla".\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Lendário — Basri\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487143&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c330cd5d-ca8b-4870-8089-2dbcab4bb0f8\', \'multiverseId\': 487143}, \'multiverseid\': 487143}, {\'name\': \'Базри Кет\', \'text\': \'+1: положите один жетон +1/+1 на не более чем одно целевое существо. Оно получает Неразрушимость до конца хода.\\n−2: каждый раз, когда одно или несколько не являющихся фишками существ атакуют в этом ходу, создайте столько же фишек существа 1/1 белый Солдат повернутыми и атакующими.\\n−6: вы получаете эмблему со способностью «В начале боя во время вашего хода создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 белый Солдат, затем положите один жетон +1/+1 на каждое существо под вашим контролем».\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Planeswalker — Базри\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de2857e7-3ada-451b-a8d4-57bf9321c6dd\', \'multiverseId\': 487402}, \'multiverseid\': 487402}, {\'name\': \'巴席利柯特\', \'text\': \'+1：在至多一个目标生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。它获得不灭异能直到回合结束。\\n−2：本回合中，每当一个或数个非衍生物的生物攻击时，派出等量的1/1白色士兵衍生生物，其为横置且正进行攻击。\\n−6：你获得具有「在你回合的战斗开始时，派出一个1/1白色士兵衍生生物，然后在每个由你操控的生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物」的徽记。\', \'type\': \'传奇鹏洛客 ～巴席利\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487661&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c637defe-9d83-4ca8-b4bb-f88aba8e7360\', \'multiverseId\': 487661}, \'multiverseid\': 487661}, {\'name\': \'巴席利柯特\', \'text\': \'+1：在至多一個目標生物上放置一個+1/+1指示物。它獲得不滅異能直到回合結束。\\n−2：本回合中，每當一個或數個非衍生物的生物攻擊時，派出等量的1/1白色士兵衍生生物，其為橫置且正進行攻擊。\\n−6：你獲得具有「在你回合的戰鬥開始時，派出一個1/1白色士兵衍生生物，然後在每個由你操控的生物上各放置一個+1/+1指示物」的徽記。\', \'type\': \'傳奇鵬洛客 ～巴席利\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487920&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'688608fa-5661-4f31-934a-1b5b342c693f\', \'multiverseId\': 487920}, \'multiverseid\': 487920}]', '[{\'name\': \'Basri Ket\', \'text\': \'+1: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Sie erhält Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n−2: Immer wenn eine oder mehrere Nichtspielsteinkreaturen in diesem Zug angreifen, erzeuge entsprechend viele getappte und angreifende 1/1 weiße Soldat-Kreaturenspielsteine.\\n−6: Du erhältst ein Emblem mit „Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug erzeugst du einen 1/1 weißen Soldat-Kreaturenspielstein und legst dann auf jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, eine +1/+1-Marke."\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Basri\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488180&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5f3b56b-1437-446d-b81f-f7dea5d1e575\', \'multiverseId\': 488180}, \'multiverseid\': 488180}, {\'name\': \'Basri Ket\', \'text\': \'+1: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre hasta una criatura objetivo. Gana la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno.\\n−2: Siempre que una o más criaturas que no sean fichas ataquen este turno, crea esa misma cantidad de fichas de criatura Soldado blancas 1/1 giradas y atacando.\\n−6: Obtienes un emblema con "Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, crea una ficha de criatura Soldado blanca 1/1, luego pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada criatura que controlas".\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Basri\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488186&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee02b843-16cc-4a73-935e-d8ca687b84c1\', \'multiverseId\': 488186}, \'multiverseid\': 488186}, {\'name\': \'Basri Ket\', \'text\': "+1 : Ciblez jusqu\'à une créature. Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle. Elle acquiert l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n-2: À chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature non-jeton attaque ce tour-ci, créez autant de jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Soldat, engagés et attaquants.\\n-6: Vous gagnez un emblème avec « Au début du combat pendant votre tour, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Soldat, puis mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature que vous contrôlez. »", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Basri\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488192&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c6ed4f3-a0a9-43fd-87f6-70ab0ce44190\', \'multiverseId\': 488192}, \'multiverseid\': 488192}, {\'name\': \'Basri Ket\', \'text\': \'+1: Scegli fino a una creatura bersaglio. Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa. Ha indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno.\\n-2: Ogniqualvolta una o più creature non pedina attaccano in questo turno, crea altrettante pedine creatura Soldato 1/1 bianche TAPpate e attaccanti.\\n-6: Ottieni un emblema con "All\\\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, crea una pedina creatura Soldato 1/1 bianca, poi metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni creatura che controlli".\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Basri\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488198&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbdfc243-f080-4559-8455-7399c26b3367\', \'multiverseId\': 488198}, \'multiverseid\': 488198}, {\'name\': \'バスリ・ケト\', \'text\': \'+1：クリーチャー最大１体を対象とし、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。ターン終了時まで、それは破壊不能を得る。\\n-2：このターン、トークンでないクリーチャーが１体以上攻撃するたび、その数に等しい数の白の１/１の兵士・クリーチャー・トークンをタップ状態かつ攻撃している状態で生成する。\\n-6：あなたは「あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、白の１/１の兵士・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成し、その後あなたがコントロールしている各クリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをそれぞれ１個置く。」を持つ紋章を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — バスリ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488204&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ee40ac3-4cca-4f62-bf62-50bdeff3a2fe\', \'multiverseId\': 488204}, \'multiverseid\': 488204}, {\'name\': \'바스리 케트\', \'text\': \'+1: 생물을 최대 한 개까지 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 무적을 얻는다.\\n−2: 이번 턴에 토큰이 아닌 생물 한 개 이상이 공격할 때마다, 탭되어 공격 중인 1/1 백색 병사 생물 토큰을 그 수만큼 만든다.\\n−6: 당신은 "당신의 턴 전투 시작에, 1/1 백색 병사 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든 후, 당신이 조종하는 각 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개씩을 올려놓는다."를 가진 휘장을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 플레인즈워커 — 바스리\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488210&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36295a95-5fb7-451c-9484-567c6f645397\', \'multiverseId\': 488210}, \'multiverseid\': 488210}, {\'name\': \'Basri Ket\', \'text\': \'+1: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em até uma criatura alvo. Ela ganha indestrutível até o final do turno.\\n−2: Toda vez que uma ou mais criaturas que não sejam fichas atacarem neste turno, crie aquela quantidade de fichas de criatura branca 1/1 do tipo Soldado viradas e atacando.\\n−6: Você recebe um emblema com "No início do combate no seu turno, crie uma ficha de criatura branca 1/1 do tipo Soldado e, em seguida, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada criatura que você controla".\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Lendário — Basri\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb99ff0a-1a39-4722-aa04-4a1987193788\', \'multiverseId\': 488216}, \'multiverseid\': 488216}, {\'name\': \'БАЗРИ КЕТ\', \'text\': \'+1: положите один жетон +1/+1 на не более чем одно целевое существо. Оно получает Неразрушимость до конца хода.\\n−2: каждый раз, когда одно или несколько не являющихся фишками существ атакуют в этом ходу, создайте столько же фишек существа 1/1 белый Солдат повернутыми и атакующими.\\n−6: вы получаете эмблему со способностью «В начале боя во время вашего хода создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 белый Солдат, затем положите один жетон +1/+1 на каждое существо под вашим контролем».\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Planeswalker — БАЗРИ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba658c71-2195-48f9-b40d-cddfd957e38c\', \'multiverseId\': 488222}, \'multiverseid\': 488222}, {\'name\': \'巴席利柯特\', \'text\': \'+1：在至多一个目标生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。它获得不灭异能直到回合结束。\\n−2：本回合中，每当一个或数个非衍生物的生物攻击时，派出等量的1/1白色士兵衍生生物，其为横置且正进行攻击。\\n−6：你获得具有「在你回合的战斗开始时，派出一个1/1白色士兵衍生生物，然后在每个由你操控的生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物」的徽记。\', \'type\': \'传奇鹏洛客 ～巴席利\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98db0194-3c6e-4e8d-bee2-a9ca0efe05fd\', \'multiverseId\': 488228}, \'multiverseid\': 488228}, {\'name\': \'巴席利柯特\', \'text\': \'+1：在至多一個目標生物上放置一個+1/+1指示物。它獲得不滅異能直到回合結束。\\n−2：本回合中，每當一個或數個非衍生物的生物攻擊時，派出等量的1/1白色士兵衍生生物，其為橫置且正進行攻擊。\\n−6：你獲得具有「在你回合的戰鬥開始時，派出一個1/1白色士兵衍生生物，然後在每個由你操控的生物上各放置一個+1/+1指示物」的徽記。\', \'type\': \'傳奇鵬洛客 ～巴席利\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5588f6bf-cadd-4e72-bdeb-0c218d86dc3f\', \'multiverseId\': 488234}, \'multiverseid\': 488234}]', '[{\'name\': \'Basri Ket\', \'text\': \'+1: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Sie erhält Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n−2: Immer wenn eine oder mehrere Nichtspielsteinkreaturen in diesem Zug angreifen, erzeuge entsprechend viele getappte und angreifende 1/1 weiße Soldat-Kreaturenspielsteine.\\n−6: Du erhältst ein Emblem mit „Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug erzeugst du einen 1/1 weißen Soldat-Kreaturenspielstein und legst dann auf jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, eine +1/+1-Marke."\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Basri\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488926&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28fbeda0-771d-4975-9ad8-00b978ee3880\', \'multiverseId\': 488926}, \'multiverseid\': 488926}, {\'name\': \'Basri Ket\', \'text\': \'+1: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre hasta una criatura objetivo. Gana la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno.\\n−2: Siempre que una o más criaturas que no sean fichas ataquen este turno, crea esa misma cantidad de fichas de criatura Soldado blancas 1/1 giradas y atacando.\\n−6: Obtienes un emblema con "Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, crea una ficha de criatura Soldado blanca 1/1, luego pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada criatura que controlas".\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Basri\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488950&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc7118ef-5d60-4578-9bcd-20f6f04ddbce\', \'multiverseId\': 488950}, \'multiverseid\': 488950}, {\'name\': \'Basri Ket\', \'text\': "+1 : Ciblez jusqu\'à une créature. Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle. Elle acquiert l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n-2: À chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature non-jeton attaque ce tour-ci, créez autant de jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Soldat, engagés et attaquants.\\n-6: Vous gagnez un emblème avec « Au début du combat pendant votre tour, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Soldat, puis mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature que vous contrôlez. »", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Basri\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488974&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b74cbdd-8267-4a6e-b18a-79e98c14a684\', \'multiverseId\': 488974}, \'multiverseid\': 488974}, {\'name\': \'Basri Ket\', \'text\': \'+1: Scegli fino a una creatura bersaglio. Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa. Ha indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno.\\n-2: Ogniqualvolta una o più creature non pedina attaccano in questo turno, crea altrettante pedine creatura Soldato 1/1 bianche TAPpate e attaccanti.\\n-6: Ottieni un emblema con "All\\\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, crea una pedina creatura Soldato 1/1 bianca, poi metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni creatura che controlli".\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Basri\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488998&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6599f310-b8bb-4113-9f67-a1377d46303f\', \'multiverseId\': 488998}, \'multiverseid\': 488998}, {\'name\': \'バスリ・ケト\', \'text\': \'+1：クリーチャー最大１体を対象とし、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。ターン終了時まで、それは破壊不能を得る。\\n-2：このターン、トークンでないクリーチャーが１体以上攻撃するたび、その数に等しい数の白の１/１の兵士・クリーチャー・トークンをタップ状態かつ攻撃している状態で生成する。\\n-6：あなたは「あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、白の１/１の兵士・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成し、その後あなたがコントロールしている各クリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをそれぞれ１個置く。」を持つ紋章を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — バスリ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489022&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af47eff7-aef1-40d2-a3c9-bd8a94e455bf\', \'multiverseId\': 489022}, \'multiverseid\': 489022}, {\'name\': \'바스리 케트\', \'text\': \'+1: 생물을 최대 한 개까지 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 무적을 얻는다.\\n−2: 이번 턴에 토큰이 아닌 생물 한 개 이상이 공격할 때마다, 탭되어 공격 중인 1/1 백색 병사 생물 토큰을 그 수만큼 만든다.\\n−6: 당신은 "당신의 턴 전투 시작에, 1/1 백색 병사 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든 후, 당신이 조종하는 각 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개씩을 올려놓는다."를 가진 휘장을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 플레인즈워커 — 바스리\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6015cd7-f826-4ee9-8437-41f6bbbc40ff\', \'multiverseId\': 489046}, \'multiverseid\': 489046}, {\'name\': \'Basri Ket\', \'text\': \'+1: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em até uma criatura alvo. Ela ganha indestrutível até o final do turno.\\n−2: Toda vez que uma ou mais criaturas que não sejam fichas atacarem neste turno, crie aquela quantidade de fichas de criatura branca 1/1 do tipo Soldado viradas e atacando.\\n−6: Você recebe um emblema com "No início do combate no seu turno, crie uma ficha de criatura branca 1/1 do tipo Soldado e, em seguida, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada criatura que você controla".\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Lendário — Basri\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'505bcd80-1647-43de-95a0-2f44f727b498\', \'multiverseId\': 489070}, \'multiverseid\': 489070}, {\'name\': \'Базри Кет\', \'text\': \'+1: положите один жетон +1/+1 на не более чем одно целевое существо. Оно получает Неразрушимость до конца хода.\\n−2: каждый раз, когда одно или несколько не являющихся фишками существ атакуют в этом ходу, создайте столько же фишек существа 1/1 белый Солдат повернутыми и атакующими.\\n−6: вы получаете эмблему со способностью «В начале боя во время вашего хода создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 белый Солдат, затем положите один жетон +1/+1 на каждое существо под вашим контролем».\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Planeswalker — Базри\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489094&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bf6bf42-0594-417f-a896-637a846abd4c\', \'multiverseId\': 489094}, \'multiverseid\': 489094}, {\'name\': \'巴席利柯特\', \'text\': \'+1：在至多一个目标生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。它获得不灭异能直到回合结束。\\n−2：本回合中，每当一个或数个非衍生物的生物攻击时，派出等量的1/1白色士兵衍生生物，其为横置且正进行攻击。\\n−6：你获得具有「在你回合的战斗开始时，派出一个1/1白色士兵衍生生物，然后在每个由你操控的生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物」的徽记。\', \'type\': \'传奇鹏洛客 ～巴席利\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489118&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5591290a-85b9-426a-829b-036c389338eb\', \'multiverseId\': 489118}, \'multiverseid\': 489118}, {\'name\': \'巴席利柯特\', \'text\': \'+1：在至多一個目標生物上放置一個-1/-1指示物。它獲得不滅異能直到回合結束。\\n−2：本回合中，每當一個或數個非衍生物的生物攻擊時，派出等量的1/1白色士兵衍生生物，其為橫置且正進行攻擊。\\n−6：你獲得具有「在你回合的戰鬥開始時，派出一個1/1白色士兵衍生生物，然後在每個由你操控的生物上各放置一個+1/+1指示物」的徽記。\', \'type\': \'傳奇鵬洛客 ～巴席利\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1eb99e6c-f587-4abc-896e-e639e0b952b3\', \'multiverseId\': 489142}, \'multiverseid\': 489142}]', '[{\'name\': \'Basri, treuer Paladin\', \'text\': \'+1: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Sie erhält Wachsamkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n−1: Immer wenn eine Kreatur in diesem Zug angreift, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie.\\n−6: Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +2/+2 und Flugfähigkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Basri\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488646&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d36f3994-3555-46bb-8aad-578d5a91a323\', \'multiverseId\': 488646}, \'multiverseid\': 488646}, {\'name\': \'Basri, paladín devoto\', \'text\': \'+1: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre hasta una criatura objetivo. Gana la habilidad de vigilancia hasta el final del turno.\\n−1: Siempre que una criatura ataque este turno, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre ella.\\n−6: Las criaturas que controlas obtienen +2/+2 y ganan la habilidad de volar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Basri\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488666&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f7ccc70-515f-4a81-8167-48890f5cf83c\', \'multiverseId\': 488666}, \'multiverseid\': 488666}, {\'name\': \'Basri, paladin dévoué\', \'text\': "+1: Ciblez jusqu\'à une créature. Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle. Elle acquiert la vigilance jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n-1: À chaque fois qu\'une créature attaque ce tour-ci, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.\\n-6: Les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+2 et acquièrent le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Basri\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488686&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfdbae8e-3110-4b3c-a8e2-2e672bf1de0c\', \'multiverseId\': 488686}, \'multiverseid\': 488686}, {\'name\': \'Basri, Paladino Devoto\', \'text\': \'+1: Scegli fino a una creatura bersaglio. Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa. Ha cautela fino alla fine del turno.\\n-1: Ogniqualvolta una creatura attacca in questo turno, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa.\\n-6: Le creature che controlli prendono +2/+2 e hanno volare fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Basri\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6dcff917-2a36-47e2-95d1-c354fb6b3bfb\', \'multiverseId\': 488706}, \'multiverseid\': 488706}, {\'name\': \'献身の聖騎士、バスリ\', \'text\': \'+1：クリーチャー最大１体を対象とし、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。ターン終了時まで、それは警戒を得る。\\n-1：このターン、クリーチャーが１体攻撃するたび、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\\n-6：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受け飛行を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — バスリ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488726&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73c30301-cb48-487f-95f6-c59233474602\', \'multiverseId\': 488726}, \'multiverseid\': 488726}, {\'name\': \'헌신적인 성기사, 바스리\', \'text\': \'+1: 생물을 최대 한 개까지 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 경계를 얻는다.\\n−1: 이번 턴에 생물이 공격할 때마다, 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\\n−6: 당신이 조종하는 생물들은 턴종료까지 +2/+2를 받고 비행을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 플레인즈워커 — 바스리\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488746&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b85977e-9234-4b6f-a9a5-05a1dd1301e9\', \'multiverseId\': 488746}, \'multiverseid\': 488746}, {\'name\': \'Basri, Paladino Devoto\', \'text\': \'+1: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em até uma criatura alvo. Ela ganha vigilância até o final do turno.\\n−1: Toda vez que uma criatura atacar neste turno, coloque um marcador +1/+1 nela.\\n−6: As criaturas que você controla recebem +2/+2 e ganham voar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Lendário — Basri\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488766&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aeea1f43-3025-464f-8a2f-c89cd23caff9\', \'multiverseId\': 488766}, \'multiverseid\': 488766}, {\'name\': \'Базри, Преданный Паладин\', \'text\': \'+1: положите один жетон +1/+1 на не более чем одно целевое существо. Оно получает Бдительность до конца хода.\\n−1: каждый раз, когда существо атакует в этом ходу, положите на него один жетон +1/+1.\\n−6: существа под вашим контролем получают +2/+2 и Полет до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Planeswalker — Базри\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488786&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f56dc8c-8db4-4d38-8f50-61157dd54eda\', \'multiverseId\': 488786}, \'multiverseid\': 488786}, {\'name\': \'虔圣武士巴席利\', \'text\': \'+1：在至多一个目标生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。它获得警戒异能直到回合结束。\\n−1：本回合中，每当一个生物攻击时，在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n−6：直到回合结束，由你操控的生物得+2/+2且获得飞行异能。\', \'type\': \'传奇鹏洛客 ～巴席利\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488806&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac5b2a4c-f8a7-4c62-a4a6-56b9089bcc07\', \'multiverseId\': 488806}, \'multiverseid\': 488806}, {\'name\': \'虔聖武士巴席利\', \'text\': \'+1：在至多一個目標生物上放置一個+1/+1指示物。它獲得警戒異能直到回合結束。\\n−1: 本回合中，每當一個生物攻擊時，在其上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\\n−6：直到回合結束，由你操控的生物得+2/+2且獲得飛行異能。\', \'type\': \'傳奇鵬洛客 ～巴席利\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488826&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e64e9c06-07a8-44c6-ae07-f2b66ba13eab\', \'multiverseId\': 488826}, \'multiverseid\': 488826}]', '[{\'name\': \'Basris Anhängerin\', \'text\': \'Lebensverknüpfung (Schaden, der von dieser Kreatur zugefügt wird, lässt dich entsprechend viele Lebenspunkte dazuerhalten.)\\nWenn Basris Anhängerin ins Spiel kommt, lege je eine +1/+1-Marke auf bis zu zwei andere Kreaturen deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'Basri führt das Vermächtnis seiner Göttin fort und verbreitet ihre Lehren im gesamten Multiversum.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485590&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95a8be41-8605-4dbb-817b-b445e4167b2d\', \'multiverseId\': 485590}, \'multiverseid\': 485590}, {\'name\': \'Acólita de Basri\', \'text\': \'Vínculo vital. (El daño hecho por esta criatura también hace que ganes esa misma cantidad de vidas.)\\nCuando la Acólita de Basri entre al campo de batalla, elige hasta otras dos criaturas objetivo que controlas y pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada una.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo felino\', \'flavor\': \'Basri prosigue el legado de su diosa y difunde sus enseñanzas por todo el Multiverso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485849&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24c69413-6402-49b1-ba8e-d22f7310aca7\', \'multiverseId\': 485849}, \'multiverseid\': 485849}, {\'name\': \'Acolyte de Basri\', \'text\': "Lien de vie (Les blessures infligées par cette créature vous font aussi gagner autant de points de vie.)\\nQuand l\'Acolyte de Basri arrive sur le champ de bataille, ciblez jusqu\'à deux autres créatures que vous contrôlez. Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chacune d\'elles.", \'type\': \'Créature : chat et clerc\', \'flavor\': "Basri poursuit l\'œuvre de sa déesse et transmet ses enseignements d\'un bout à l\'autre du Multivers.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486108&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'336b777f-5bfb-4caf-ab75-0e9a95331f4b\', \'multiverseId\': 486108}, \'multiverseid\': 486108}, {\'name\': \'Accolita di Basri\', \'text\': "Legame vitale (Il danno inflitto da questa creatura ti fa anche guadagnare altrettanti punti vita.)\\nQuando l\'Accolita di Basri entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli fino a due altre creature bersaglio che controlli e metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ciascuna.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Felino\', \'flavor\': \'Basri diffonde la parola della sua dea, tramandandone gli insegnamenti in ogni angolo del Multiverso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486367&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66fbcabc-2032-4480-a076-dc5fc34462bb\', \'multiverseId\': 486367}, \'multiverseid\': 486367}, {\'name\': \'バスリの侍祭\', \'text\': \'絆魂（このクリーチャーがダメージを与えると、さらにあなたはその点数分のライフを得る。）\\nバスリの侍祭が戦場に出たとき、他の、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー最大２体を対象とし、それらの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをそれぞれ１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'バスリは神の遺産を継承しており、多元宇宙に教えを広めている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486626&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2de6f8cc-61ab-4f0f-af82-0754096c6120\', \'multiverseId\': 486626}, \'multiverseid\': 486626}, {\'name\': \'바스리의 시종\', \'text\': \'생명연결 (이 생물이 피해를 입히면, 당신은 그 피해만큼의 생명점을 얻는다.)\\n바스리의 시종이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 조종하는 다른 생물을 최대 두 개까지 목표로 정한다. 그 생물들에 +1/+1 카운터를 한 개씩 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고양이 성직자\', \'flavor\': \'바스리는 자신이 섬기는 신의 족적을 따르며, 다우주 전체에 그녀의 가르침을 퍼뜨린다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486885&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5875bfc7-cb3f-41f4-8b99-b7b59265123f\', \'multiverseId\': 486885}, \'multiverseid\': 486885}, {\'name\': \'Acólita de Basri\', \'text\': \'Vínculo com a vida (O dano causado por esta criatura também faz com que você ganhe uma quantidade equivalente de pontos de vida.)\\nQuando Acólita de Basri entrar no campo de batalha, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada uma de até duas outras criaturas alvo que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'Basri perpetua o legado de sua deusa, divulgando os ensinamentos dela Multiverso afora.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487144&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'480d02d5-0de6-430f-ad82-dfa32a442328\', \'multiverseId\': 487144}, \'multiverseid\': 487144}, {\'name\': \'Послушница Базри\', \'text\': \'Цепь жизни (Повреждения, наносимые этим существом, также заставляют вас получить такое же количество жизней.)\\nКогда Послушница Базри выходит на поле битвы, положите один жетон +1/+1 на каждое из не более двух других целевых существ под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кошка Священник\', \'flavor\': \'Базри хранит наследие своей богини, распространяя ее учение по всей Мультивселенной.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487403&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63e73bf2-0a22-4161-9064-e3aab7a7bdc7\', \'multiverseId\': 487403}, \'multiverseid\': 487403}, {\'name\': \'巴席利的侍僧\', \'text\': \'系命（此生物所造成的伤害会让你获得等量的生命。）\\n当巴席利的侍僧进战场时，在至多两个其他目标由你操控的生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～猫／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'巴席利继承他的神明遗志，继续在多重宇宙中传扬其教诲。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f52bbba6-b8cb-4e4f-af28-58b920d035ad\', \'multiverseId\': 487662}, \'multiverseid\': 487662}, {\'name\': \'巴席利的侍僧\', \'text\': \'繫命（此生物所造成的傷害會讓你獲得等量的生命。）\\n當巴席利的侍僧進戰場時，在至多兩個其他目標由你操控的生物上各放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～貓／僧侶\', \'flavor\': \'巴席利繼承他的神明遺志，繼續在多重宇宙中傳揚其教誨。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487921&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46f2497e-b23a-45ae-980b-79a7f5160669\', \'multiverseId\': 487921}, \'multiverseid\': 487921}]', '[{\'name\': \'Basris Anhängerin\', \'text\': \'Lebensverknüpfung\\nWenn Basris Anhängerin ins Spiel kommt, lege je eine +1/+1-Marke auf bis zu zwei andere Kreaturen deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488927&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14510f29-4764-492e-a4d6-3eb50acdfffd\', \'multiverseId\': 488927}, \'multiverseid\': 488927}, {\'name\': \'Acólita de Basri\', \'text\': \'Vínculo vital.\\nCuando la Acólita de Basri entre al campo de batalla, elige hasta otras dos criaturas objetivo que controlas y pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada una.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo felino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488951&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51d16338-9b5f-4d0e-8b1c-12e0aa4b69ca\', \'multiverseId\': 488951}, \'multiverseid\': 488951}, {\'name\': \'Acolyte de Basri\', \'text\': "Lien de vie\\nQuand l\'Acolyte de Basri arrive sur le champ de bataille, ciblez jusqu\'à deux autres créatures que vous contrôlez. Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chacune d\'elles.", \'type\': \'Créature : chat et clerc\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488975&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0718bb5b-0093-4484-8b41-f39d3599a08d\', \'multiverseId\': 488975}, \'multiverseid\': 488975}, {\'name\': \'Accolita di Basri\', \'text\': "Legame vitale\\nQuando l\'Accolita di Basri entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli fino a due altre creature bersaglio che controlli e metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ciascuna.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Felino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488999&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48b287a1-ce3f-41ff-b52f-4fb002e37e13\', \'multiverseId\': 488999}, \'multiverseid\': 488999}, {\'name\': \'バスリの侍祭\', \'text\': \'絆魂\\nバスリの侍祭が戦場に出たとき、他の、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー最大２体を対象とし、それらの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをそれぞれ１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫クレリック\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489023&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8fa9984-87bd-404e-90c6-7cd416aafea5\', \'multiverseId\': 489023}, \'multiverseid\': 489023}, {\'name\': \'바스리의 시종\', \'text\': \'생명연결\\n바스리의 시종이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 조종하는 다른 생물을 최대 두 개까지 목표로 정한다. 그 생물들에 +1/+1 카운터를 한 개씩 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고양이 성직자\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489047&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffc47a95-28ce-4b8f-8b57-6aa5d52b381c\', \'multiverseId\': 489047}, \'multiverseid\': 489047}, {\'name\': \'Acólita de Basri\', \'text\': \'Vínculo com a vida\\nQuando Acólita de Basri entrar no campo de batalha, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada uma de até duas outras criaturas alvo que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino Clérigo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489071&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a800a80c-a2a2-421c-b121-71b5df9b60fe\', \'multiverseId\': 489071}, \'multiverseid\': 489071}, {\'name\': \'Послушница Базри\', \'text\': \'Цепь жизни\\nКогда Послушница Базри выходит на поле битвы, положите один жетон +1/+1 на каждое из не более двух других целевых существ под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кошка Священник\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489095&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dce02cb-e942-4e87-899e-a36de3b02686\', \'multiverseId\': 489095}, \'multiverseid\': 489095}, {\'name\': \'巴席利的侍僧\', \'text\': \'系命\\n当巴席利的侍僧进战场时，在至多两个其他目标由你操控的生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～猫／僧侣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'552f7d9d-ff3c-4b88-9a30-77d814d75b87\', \'multiverseId\': 489119}, \'multiverseid\': 489119}, {\'name\': \'巴席利的侍僧\', \'text\': \'繫命\\n當巴席利的侍僧進戰場時，在至多兩個其他目標由你操控的生物上各放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～貓／僧侶\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489143&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af068297-141f-41ab-8a88-14f36449877d\', \'multiverseId\': 489143}, \'multiverseid\': 489143}]', '[{\'name\': \'Basris Leutnant\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit, Schutz vor allem Mehrfarbigen\\nWenn Basris Leutnant ins Spiel kommt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst.\\nImmer wenn Basris Leutnant oder eine andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, stirbt und falls eine +1/+1 Marke auf ihm bzw. ihr lag, erzeuge einen 2/2 weißen Ritter-Kreaturenspielstein mit Wachsamkeit.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485591&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1c85ae8-3a31-4613-9cca-26eb0ae5f13f\', \'multiverseId\': 485591}, \'multiverseid\': 485591}, {\'name\': \'Teniente de Basri\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia, protección contra multicolor.\\nCuando el Teniente de Basri entre al campo de batalla, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo que controlas.\\nSiempre que el Teniente de Basri u otra criatura que controlas muera, si tenía un contador +1/+1 sobre ella, crea una ficha de criatura Caballero blanca 2/2 con la habilidad de vigilancia.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485850&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0eb76072-925c-40ad-bffa-48a588934fec\', \'multiverseId\': 485850}, \'multiverseid\': 485850}, {\'name\': \'Lieutenant de Basri\', \'text\': \'Vigilance, protection contre le multicolore\\nQuand le Lieutenant de Basri arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez.\\nÀ chaque fois que le Lieutenant de Basri ou une autre créature que vous contrôlez meurt, si elle avait un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 blanche Chevalier avec la vigilance.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486109&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66866617-dbe6-41d0-8dd2-c3385d716e7e\', \'multiverseId\': 486109}, \'multiverseid\': 486109}, {\'name\': \'Tenente di Basri\', \'text\': "Cautela, protezione dal multicolore\\nQuando il Tenente di Basri entra nel campo di battaglia, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio che controlli.\\nOgniqualvolta il Tenente di Basri o un\'altra creatura che controlli muoiono, se avevano un segnalino +1/+1, crea una pedina creatura Cavaliere 2/2 bianca con cautela.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486368&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60a13aaa-3f99-4368-b4cf-f15397016c88\', \'multiverseId\': 486368}, \'multiverseid\': 486368}, {\'name\': \'バスリの副官\', \'text\': \'警戒、プロテクション（多色）\\nバスリの副官が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\\nバスリの副官か、他の、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーが１体死亡するたび、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれていた場合、警戒を持つ白の２/２の騎士・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b938a0e-3232-4de0-a515-6aba2ee06f24\', \'multiverseId\': 486627}, \'multiverseid\': 486627}, {\'name\': \'바스리의 장교\', \'text\': \'경계, 다색으로부터 보호\\n바스리의 장교가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\\n바스리의 장교 또는 당신이 조종하는 다른 생물이 죽을 때마다, 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터가 놓여 있었다면, 경계를 가진 2/2 백색 기사 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 기사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486886&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86493621-d757-4ea2-8202-26bc05dffd15\', \'multiverseId\': 486886}, \'multiverseid\': 486886}, {\'name\': \'Tenente de Basri\', \'text\': \'Vigilância, proteção contra multicoloridos\\nQuando Tenente de Basri entrar no campo de batalha, coloque um marcador +1/+1 na criatura alvo que você controla.\\nToda vez que Tenente de Basri ou outra criatura que você controla morrer, se a criatura tinha um marcador +1/+1, crie uma ficha de criatura branca 2/2 do tipo Cavaleiro com vigilância.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487145&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e4438af-ad2b-4f49-8402-278ce99fcd32\', \'multiverseId\': 487145}, \'multiverseid\': 487145}, {\'name\': \'Лейтенант Базри\', \'text\': \'Бдительность, Защита от многоцветного\\nКогда Лейтенант Базри выходит на поле битвы, положите один жетон +1/+1 на целевое существо под вашим контролем.\\nКаждый раз, когда Лейтенант Базри или другое существо под вашим контролем умирает, если на нем был жетон +1/+1, создайте одну фишку существа 2/2 белый Рыцарь с Бдительностью.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Рыцарь\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487404&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c63600a0-e84b-49dc-b33c-ef5dace2722f\', \'multiverseId\': 487404}, \'multiverseid\': 487404}, {\'name\': \'巴席利的副官\', \'text\': \'警戒，反多色保护\\n当巴席利的副官进战场时，在目标由你操控的生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n每当巴席利的副官或另一个由你操控的生物死去时，若其上有+1/+1指示物，则派出一个2/2白色，具警戒异能的骑士衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／骑士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487663&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86204a7d-797f-4fda-9d3d-39f1c9834a04\', \'multiverseId\': 487663}, \'multiverseid\': 487663}, {\'name\': \'巴席利的副官\', \'text\': \'警戒，反多色保護\\n當巴席利的副官進戰場時，在目標由你操控的生物上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\\n每當巴席利的副官或另一個由你操控的生物死去時，若其上有+1/+1指示物，則派出一個2/2白色，具警戒異能的騎士衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487922&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e356e6f-45bf-47cc-ae3c-6a84d4d2c810\', \'multiverseId\': 487922}, \'multiverseid\': 487922}]', '[{\'name\': \'Basris Leutnant\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit, Schutz vor allem Mehrfarbigen\\nWenn Basris Leutnant ins Spiel kommt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst.\\nImmer wenn Basris Leutnant oder eine andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, stirbt und falls eine +1/+1 Marke auf ihm bzw. ihr lag, erzeuge einen 2/2 weißen Ritter-Kreaturenspielstein mit Wachsamkeit.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488928&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2dde5ed4-c739-47db-9bbb-9a1c58372609\', \'multiverseId\': 488928}, \'multiverseid\': 488928}, {\'name\': \'Teniente de Basri\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia, protección contra multicolor.\\nCuando el Teniente de Basri entre al campo de batalla, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo que controlas.\\nSiempre que el Teniente de Basri u otra criatura que controlas muera, si tenía un contador +1/+1 sobre ella, crea una ficha de criatura Caballero blanca 2/2 con la habilidad de vigilancia.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488952&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bf46858-85b4-4e34-aa9c-d09fe3867e7f\', \'multiverseId\': 488952}, \'multiverseid\': 488952}, {\'name\': \'Lieutenant de Basri\', \'text\': \'Vigilance, protection contre le multicolore\\nQuand le Lieutenant de Basri arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez.\\nÀ chaque fois que le Lieutenant de Basri ou une autre créature que vous contrôlez meurt, si elle avait un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 blanche Chevalier avec la vigilance.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488976&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce6e3e29-8cc3-47a0-94ff-c61ace9b7c4d\', \'multiverseId\': 488976}, \'multiverseid\': 488976}, {\'name\': \'Tenente di Basri\', \'text\': "Cautela, protezione dal multicolore\\nQuando il Tenente di Basri entra nel campo di battaglia, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio che controlli.\\nOgniqualvolta il Tenente di Basri o un\'altra creatura che controlli muoiono, se avevano un segnalino +1/+1, crea una pedina creatura Cavaliere 2/2 bianca con cautela.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489000&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c1f0458-6f79-4e3a-8f5e-1cce28ae568a\', \'multiverseId\': 489000}, \'multiverseid\': 489000}, {\'name\': \'バスリの副官\', \'text\': \'警戒、プロテクション（多色）\\nバスリの副官が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\\nバスリの副官か、他の、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーが１体死亡するたび、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれていた場合、警戒を持つ白の２/２の騎士・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489024&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8662b869-80a9-4dec-bbe2-2453b0b11a2b\', \'multiverseId\': 489024}, \'multiverseid\': 489024}, {\'name\': \'바스리의 장교\', \'text\': \'경계, 다색으로부터 보호\\n바스리의 장교가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\\n바스리의 장교 또는 당신이 조종하는 다른 생물이 죽을 때마다, 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터가 놓여 있었다면, 경계를 가진 2/2 백색 기사 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 기사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489048&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c300a917-dc80-47ab-afef-6f57cbebf972\', \'multiverseId\': 489048}, \'multiverseid\': 489048}, {\'name\': \'Tenente de Basri\', \'text\': \'Vigilância, proteção contra multicoloridos\\nQuando Tenente de Basri entrar no campo de batalha, coloque um marcador +1/+1 na criatura alvo que você controla.\\nToda vez que Tenente de Basri ou outra criatura que você controla morrer, se a criatura tinha um marcador +1/+1, crie uma ficha de criatura branca 2/2 do tipo Cavaleiro com vigilância.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489072&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f4d741f-a801-4b96-a9e1-aa1600943532\', \'multiverseId\': 489072}, \'multiverseid\': 489072}, {\'name\': \'Лейтенант Базри\', \'text\': \'Бдительность, Защита от многоцветного\\nКогда Лейтенант Базри выходит на поле битвы, положите один жетон +1/+1 на целевое существо под вашим контролем.\\nКаждый раз, когда Лейтенант Базри или другое существо под вашим контролем умирает, если на нем был жетон +1/+1, создайте одну фишку существа 2/2 белый Рыцарь с Бдительностью.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Рыцарь\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489096&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70f24b29-ed9a-4bcd-b109-57d49fed8268\', \'multiverseId\': 489096}, \'multiverseid\': 489096}, {\'name\': \'巴席利的副官\', \'text\': \'警戒，反多色保护\\n当巴席利的副官进战场时，在目标由你操控的生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n每当巴席利的副官或另一个由你操控的生物死去时，若其上有+1/+1指示物，则派出一个2/2白色，具警戒异能的骑士衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／骑士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a462924f-3d5f-45e1-853b-e021d48bcb8b\', \'multiverseId\': 489120}, \'multiverseid\': 489120}, {\'name\': \'巴席利的副官\', \'text\': \'警戒，反多色保護\\n當巴席利的副官進戰場時，在目標由你操控的生物上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\\n每當巴席利的副官或另一個由你操控的生物死去時，若其上有+1/+1指示物，則派出一個2/2白色，具警戒異能的騎士衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489144&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3de12ff4-feb3-4ca3-8791-29cbd8b1fdfc\', \'multiverseId\': 489144}, \'multiverseid\': 489144}]', '[{\'name\': \'Basris Schutzschild\', \'text\': \'Lege je eine +1/+1-Marke auf bis zu zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl. Du kannst deine Bibliothek und/oder deinen Friedhof nach einer Karte namens Basri, treuer Paladin, durchsuchen, sie offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen. Falls du auf diese Weise deine Bibliothek durchsuchst, mische sie danach.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Solange wir überleben, können wir wieder aufbauen."\\n—Basri Ket\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488648&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20043ada-48e2-45d9-992c-c372daeaea06\', \'multiverseId\': 488648}, \'multiverseid\': 488648}, {\'name\': \'Égida de Basri\', \'text\': \'Elige hasta dos criaturas objetivo y pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada una. Puedes buscar en tu biblioteca y/o cementerio una carta llamada Basri, paladín devoto, mostrarla y ponerla en tu mano. Si buscas en tu biblioteca de esta manera, barájala.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Solo si sobrevivimos podremos reconstruir".\\n—Basri Ket\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b380932-7b02-4a9e-9b6e-defe05ef318b\', \'multiverseId\': 488668}, \'multiverseid\': 488668}, {\'name\': \'Égide de Basri\', \'text\': "Ciblez jusqu\'à deux créatures. Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chacune d\'elles. Vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque et/ou votre cimetière une carte appelée Basri, paladin dévoué, la révéler et la mettre dans votre main. Si vous cherchez dans votre bibliothèque de cette manière, mélangez-la.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Tant que nous survivrons, nous pourrons reconstruire. »\\n—Basri Ket\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488688&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd19ee40-43f5-4110-9680-2226391b4bf9\', \'multiverseId\': 488688}, \'multiverseid\': 488688}, {\'name\': \'Egida di Basri\', \'text\': \'Scegli fino a due creature bersaglio. Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ciascuna di esse. Puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio e/o il tuo cimitero per una carta chiamata Basri, Paladino Devoto, rivelarla e aggiungerla alla tua mano. Se passi in rassegna il tuo grimorio in questo modo, rimescolalo.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Finché sopravviviamo, potremo ricostruire."\\n—Basri Ket\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488708&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'831bf1b3-6cc4-4154-accb-d57e4c258bd6\', \'multiverseId\': 488708}, \'multiverseid\': 488708}, {\'name\': \'バスリの神盾\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー最大２体を対象とし、それらの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをそれぞれ１個置く。あなたは、あなたのライブラリーやあなたの墓地から「献身の聖騎士、バスリ」という名前のカード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加えてもよい。これによりあなたがあなたのライブラリーからカードを探したなら、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「生きてさえいられれば建て直せる。」\\n――バスリ・ケト\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488728&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75f5b786-16dc-4cfc-9889-39e87a04d164\', \'multiverseId\': 488728}, \'multiverseid\': 488728}, {\'name\': \'바스리의 방패\', \'text\': \'생물을 최대 두 개까지 목표로 정한다. 그 생물들에 각각 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다. 당신은 당신의 서고 및/또는 무덤에서 이름이 헌신적인 성기사, 바스리인 카드 한 장을 찾아, 공개한 후, 당신의 손으로 가져갈 수 있다. 당신이 이런 식으로 당신의 서고를 찾아보았다면, 당신의 서고를 섞는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"우리가 살아남는 한, 재건할 수 있다."\\n—바스리 케트\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488748&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6487ec6-430a-4675-8508-deca39748bb0\', \'multiverseId\': 488748}, \'multiverseid\': 488748}, {\'name\': \'Égide de Basri\', \'text\': \'Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada uma de até duas criaturas alvo. Você pode procurar um card com o nome Basri, Paladino Devoto, em seu grimório e/ou cemitério, revelá-lo e colocá-lo em sua mão. Se procurar em seu grimório desta maneira, embaralhe-o.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Enquanto sobrevivermos, poderemos nos reerguer."\\n— Basri Ket\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488768&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c247b49-a8d1-435d-b2eb-8d02c1018c6d\', \'multiverseId\': 488768}, \'multiverseid\': 488768}, {\'name\': \'Эгида Базри\', \'text\': \'Положите один жетон +1/+1 на каждое из не более двух целевых существ. Вы можете найти в вашей библиотеке и/или на вашем кладбище карту с именем Базри, Преданный Паладин, показать ее и положить в вашу руку. Если вы ищете таким образом в вашей библиотеке, перетасуйте ее.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Пока мы живы, мы сможем отстроить все заново».\\n— Базри Кет\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488788&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1e81744-bf05-4ca0-b8a3-d6f8e60ca7da\', \'multiverseId\': 488788}, \'multiverseid\': 488788}, {\'name\': \'巴席利的庇佑\', \'text\': \'在至多两个目标生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。你可以从你的牌库和／或坟墓场中搜寻一张名称为虔圣武士巴席利的牌，展示该牌，并将它置于你手上。如果你以此法搜寻你的牌库，则将它洗牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「只要我们幸存下来，就可以重建一切。」\\n～巴席利柯特\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488808&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'982ea2b7-42da-423f-a816-d5887817a74b\', \'multiverseId\': 488808}, \'multiverseid\': 488808}, {\'name\': \'巴席利的庇佑\', \'text\': \'在至多兩個目標生物上各放置一個+1/+1指示物。你可以從你的牌庫和／或墳墓場中搜尋一張名稱為虔聖武士巴席利的牌，展示該牌，並將它置於你手上。如果你以此法搜尋你的牌庫，則將它洗牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「只要我們倖存下來，就可以重建一切。」\\n～巴席利柯特\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488828&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41b477e1-e5a7-4fce-af56-4cef05f7e9ea\', \'multiverseId\': 488828}, \'multiverseid\': 488828}]', '[{\'name\': \'Basris Solidarität\', \'text\': \'Lege auf jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, eine +1/+1-Marke.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Wille, zusammen zu kämpfen und zu agieren, beschränkt sich nicht nur auf eine Welt. Oketras Lehren sind universell."\\n—Basri Ket\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485592&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5128187-d8ed-4925-aaaf-56df77b30cee\', \'multiverseId\': 485592}, \'multiverseid\': 485592}, {\'name\': \'Solidaridad de Basri\', \'text\': \'Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada criatura que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"La voluntad de luchar y actuar como uno solo no se limita a un único mundo. Las enseñanzas de Oketra son universales".\\n—Basri Ket\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485851&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0875e0eb-f41d-41eb-84ce-eb305a66ec8e\', \'multiverseId\': 485851}, \'multiverseid\': 485851}, {\'name\': \'Solidarité de Basri\', \'text\': \'Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« La volonté de combattre et d\'agir à l\'unisson ne se limite pas à un seul monde. Les enseignements d\'Oketra sont universels. »\\n—Basri Ket", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486110&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6dab0c44-7464-4592-a336-7afe692031c9\', \'multiverseId\': 486110}, \'multiverseid\': 486110}, {\'name\': \'Solidarietà di Basri\', \'text\': \'Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni creatura che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"La volontà di combattere e agire all\\\'unisono non si limita a un unico mondo. Gli insegnamenti di Oketra sono universali."\\n—Basri Ket\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486369&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc2b23c7-a79a-4310-832b-ce02e3046c14\', \'multiverseId\': 486369}, \'multiverseid\': 486369}, {\'name\': \'バスリの結束\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしている各クリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをそれぞれ１個置く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「一体となって戦い行動するという意思は一つの世界に限ったものではない。オケチラ様の教えは普遍である。」\\n――バスリ・ケト\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'522fd516-cd0d-4211-a349-6b4099b8941d\', \'multiverseId\': 486628}, \'multiverseid\': 486628}, {\'name\': \'바스리의 결속\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 각 생물에 +1/+1 카운터를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"하나가 되어 싸우고 행동하고자 하는 의지는 한 세계에 국한되어 있지 않아. 오케트라님의 가르침은 만고불변하지."\\n—바스리 케트\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486887&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ad64788-0e21-433b-b15c-90ff65d67927\', \'multiverseId\': 486887}, \'multiverseid\': 486887}, {\'name\': \'Solidariedade de Basri\', \'text\': \'Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada criatura que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"A vontade de lutar e agir em união não está limitada a um único mundo. Os ensinamentos de Oketra são universais."\\n— Basri Ket\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487146&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b95feaea-eaa5-4b02-9573-6b56d31dca02\', \'multiverseId\': 487146}, \'multiverseid\': 487146}, {\'name\': \'Солидарность Базри\', \'text\': \'Положите один жетон +1/+1 на каждое существо под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Воля сражаться и действовать, как один, не ограничивается одним миром. Учение Окетры подходит любому».\\n— Базри Кет\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8d936fd-e9c0-4f46-8ec7-c6d26af5443b\', \'multiverseId\': 487405}, \'multiverseid\': 487405}, {\'name\': \'巴席利的团结\', \'text\': \'在每个由你操控的生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「『齐勇如一』之道并非只在一个世界中通用，欧柯塔的教诲放之四海而皆准。」\\n～巴席利柯特\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487664&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3babb525-05c6-43ec-adf7-e861056b0fd7\', \'multiverseId\': 487664}, \'multiverseid\': 487664}, {\'name\': \'巴席利的團結\', \'text\': \'在每個由你操控的生物上各放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「『齊勇如一』之道並非只在一個世界中通用，歐柯塔的教誨放之四海而皆準。」\\n～巴席利柯特\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487923&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f0c9e49-635f-4e78-861f-4e9bcee044ea\', \'multiverseId\': 487923}, \'multiverseid\': 487923}]', "[{'name': 'Basris Solidarität', 'text': 'Lege auf jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, eine +1/+1-Marke.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488929&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6bd047bb-af4c-4e08-81db-f784cf5cff4b', 'multiverseId': 488929}, 'multiverseid': 488929}, {'name': 'Solidaridad de Basri', 'text': 'Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada criatura que controlas.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488953&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bf90bfce-4d94-49f7-82f5-08518f5860f9', 'multiverseId': 488953}, 'multiverseid': 488953}, {'name': 'Solidarité de Basri', 'text': 'Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature que vous contrôlez.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488977&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd0b71e76-9875-42fa-8ed9-579b315007d4', 'multiverseId': 488977}, 'multiverseid': 488977}, {'name': 'Solidarietà di Basri', 'text': 'Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni creatura che controlli.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489001&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a297e3e7-8f64-4ec2-a8a5-1c28a36a40ba', 'multiverseId': 489001}, 'multiverseid': 489001}, {'name': 'バスリの結束', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールしている各クリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをそれぞれ１個置く。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489025&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '43516a48-c6a3-4c02-b3bf-223a97c91673', 'multiverseId': 489025}, 'multiverseid': 489025}, {'name': '바스리의 결속', 'text': '당신이 조종하는 각 생물에 +1/+1 카운터를 올려놓는다.', 'type': '집중마법', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489049&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd7976773-3456-4143-981c-18f452cbcb39', 'multiverseId': 489049}, 'multiverseid': 489049}, {'name': 'Solidariedade de Basri', 'text': 'Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada criatura que você controla.', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489073&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '53c0e5ef-36f3-44ae-91c5-b2ad896d5daf', 'multiverseId': 489073}, 'multiverseid': 489073}, {'name': 'Солидарность Базри', 'text': 'Положите один жетон +1/+1 на каждое существо под вашим контролем.', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489097&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '62f256e6-06ad-4c08-ab48-2240301e5144', 'multiverseId': 489097}, 'multiverseid': 489097}, {'name': '巴席利的团结', 'text': '在每个由你操控的生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489121&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8696262e-7f63-48d7-9aee-4dc38ffd8110', 'multiverseId': 489121}, 'multiverseid': 489121}, {'name': '巴席利的團結', 'text': '在每個由你操控的生物上各放置一個+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '巫術', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489145&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f360dbd7-9789-4ff5-a54b-1d3fc55c06ad', 'multiverseId': 489145}, 'multiverseid': 489145}]", '[{\'name\': \'Behüter der Sphären\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nKreaturenzauber mit Flugfähigkeit, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {1} weniger.\\nImmer wenn eine andere fliegende Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhält der Behüter der Sphären +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485809&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f90afa0b-f96a-43f7-bfcb-21cf6d664bb8\', \'multiverseId\': 485809}, \'multiverseid\': 485809}, {\'name\': \'Vigilante de las esferas\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nTe cuesta {1} menos lanzar los hechizos de criatura con la habilidad de volar.\\nSiempre que otra criatura con la habilidad de volar entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, el Vigilante de las esferas obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486068&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a14d54e4-3e75-4941-9e06-010635c93280\', \'multiverseId\': 486068}, \'multiverseid\': 486068}, {\'name\': \'Gardien des sphères\', \'text\': "Vol\\nLes sorts de créature avec le vol que vous lancez coûtent {1} de moins à lancer.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une autre créature avec le vol arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, le Gardien des sphères gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486327&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba19c751-a18a-4fd0-9c1a-ee635e27feca\', \'multiverseId\': 486327}, \'multiverseid\': 486327}, {\'name\': \'Scrutatore delle Sfere\', \'text\': "Volare\\nLe magie creatura con volare che lanci costano {1} in meno per essere lanciate.\\nOgniqualvolta un\'altra creatura con volare entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, lo Scrutatore delle Sfere prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Uccello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2caef91-20aa-4999-86a2-bdbbc957cef2\', \'multiverseId\': 486586}, \'multiverseid\': 486586}, {\'name\': \'天球の見張り\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたが飛行を持つクリーチャー・呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\\n他の飛行を持つクリーチャーが１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、天球の見張りは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486845&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d530940-55e8-43d8-8e28-01a62441355b\', \'multiverseId\': 486845}, \'multiverseid\': 486845}, {\'name\': \'구체 감시자\', \'text\': \'비행\\n당신이 발동하는 비행을 가진 생물 주문들은 발동하는 데 {1}이 덜 든다.\\n비행을 가진 다른 생물이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 구체 감시자는 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 조류 마법사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67ba7dd9-bee6-4bd1-ad0c-37cd6a91b215\', \'multiverseId\': 487104}, \'multiverseid\': 487104}, {\'name\': \'Observador das Esferas\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nAs mágicas de criatura com voar que você conjura custam {1} a menos para serem conjuradas.\\nToda vez que outra criatura com voar entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, Observador das Esferas recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487363&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fea934e1-5747-4c3d-9ffe-09ae2bc3d53e\', \'multiverseId\': 487363}, \'multiverseid\': 487363}, {\'name\': \'Наблюдатель за Сферами\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nРазыгрываемые вами заклинания существ с Полетом стоят на {1} меньше.\\nКаждый раз, когда другое существо с Полетом выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, Наблюдатель за Сферами получает +1/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Птица Чародей\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487622&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1158ecc7-3f4d-44a4-a082-306de739f54c\', \'multiverseId\': 487622}, \'multiverseid\': 487622}, {\'name\': \'护球守卫\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n你施放之具飞行异能的生物咒语减少{1}来施放。\\n每当另一个具飞行异能的生物在你的操控下进战场时，护球守卫得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鸟／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487881&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32a1e1c8-6df6-4fd1-8df6-90827b7e48d6\', \'multiverseId\': 487881}, \'multiverseid\': 487881}, {\'name\': \'護球守衛\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n你施放之具飛行異能的生物咒語減少{1}來施放。\\n每當另一個具飛行異能的生物在你的操控下進戰場時，護球守衛得+1/+1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鳥／魔法師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2dfbb3ed-3700-42af-a31f-f244f0cc37e8\', \'multiverseId\': 488140}, \'multiverseid\': 488140}]', '[{\'name\': \'Belagerungskämpfer\', \'text\': \'Doppelschlag (Diese Kreatur fügt sowohl Erstschlags- als auch normalen Kampfschaden zu.)\\nImmer wenn der Belagerungskämpfer angreift, kannst du eine beliebige Anzahl ungetappter Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, tappen. Der Belagerungskämpfer erhält für jede auf diese Weise getappte Kreatur +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485619&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f83f35cc-1527-42f6-9919-8780c6ce2150\', \'multiverseId\': 485619}, \'multiverseid\': 485619}, {\'name\': \'Luchador de asedio\', \'text\': \'Daña dos veces. (Esta criatura daña primero y también hace daño de combate normal.)\\nSiempre que el Luchador de asedio ataque, puedes girar cualquier cantidad de criaturas enderezadas que controlas. El Luchador de asedio obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno por cada criatura girada de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485878&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3e0e09e-5ed7-4537-b6f5-442fbdd20edd\', \'multiverseId\': 485878}, \'multiverseid\': 485878}, {\'name\': \'Frappeur de siège\', \'text\': "Double initiative (Cette créature inflige des blessures de combat d\'initiative et des blessures de combat normales.)\\nÀ chaque fois que le Frappeur de siège attaque, vous pouvez engager n\'importe quel nombre de créatures dégagées que vous contrôlez. Le Frappeur de siège gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour pour chaque créature engagée de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486137&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'500a799d-1294-4c46-aad5-ac26b94d7450\', \'multiverseId\': 486137}, \'multiverseid\': 486137}, {\'name\': \'Incursore da Assedio\', \'text\': "Doppio attacco (Questa creatura infligge sia danno da combattimento da attacco improvviso che danno da combattimento regolare.)\\nOgniqualvolta l\'Incursore da Assedio attacca, puoi TAPpare un qualsiasi numero di creature STAPpate che controlli. L\'Incursore da Assedio prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno per ogni creatura TAPpata in questo modo.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486396&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57bba61c-1065-4efa-9299-067f72d12384\', \'multiverseId\': 486396}, \'multiverseid\': 486396}, {\'name\': \'包囲戦の打撃者\', \'text\': \'二段攻撃（このクリーチャーは先制攻撃と通常の戦闘ダメージの両方を与える。）\\n包囲戦の打撃者が攻撃するたび、あなたはあなたがコントロールしているアンタップ状態の望む数のクリーチャーをタップしてもよい。ターン終了時まで、包囲戦の打撃者は、これによりタップしたクリーチャー１体につき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486655&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c7712d1-759d-467b-a1d6-03511cb1c501\', \'multiverseId\': 486655}, \'multiverseid\': 486655}, {\'name\': \'공성 타격수\', \'text\': \'이단공격 (이 생물은 선제공격 전투피해와 일반 전투피해를 둘 다 입힌다.)\\n공성 타격수가 공격할 때마다, 당신은 당신이 조종하는 언탭된 생물들을 원하는 수만큼 탭할 수 있다. 공성 타격수는 이런 식으로 탭한 생물 한 개당 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 병사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486914&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f82a3cb1-a2bf-41d1-b1aa-4f503943652f\', \'multiverseId\': 486914}, \'multiverseid\': 486914}, {\'name\': \'Golpeador de Cerco\', \'text\': \'Golpe duplo (Esta criatura causa tanto o dano de iniciativa quanto o de combate normal.)\\nToda vez que Golpeador de Cerco ataca, você pode virar qualquer número de criaturas desviradas que você controla. Golpeador de Cerco recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno para cada criatura virada dessa forma.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'963bc8bd-3c5d-4204-b2a2-406649cba2ae\', \'multiverseId\': 487173}, \'multiverseid\': 487173}, {\'name\': \'Осадный Штурмовик\', \'text\': \'Двойной удар (Это существо наносит боевые повреждения как на этапе Первого удара, так и на этапе обычных повреждений.)\\nКаждый раз, когда Осадный Штурмовик атакует, вы можете повернуть любое количество неповернутых существ под вашим контролем. Осадный Штурмовик получает +1/+1 до конца хода за каждое существо, повернутое таким образом.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487432&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d80cbe14-3c9a-4e92-886d-eb6a7def6ffa\', \'multiverseId\': 487432}, \'multiverseid\': 487432}, {\'name\': \'攻城进击兵\', \'text\': \'连击（此生物能造成先攻伤害以及普通战斗伤害。）\\n每当攻城进击兵攻击时，你可以横置任意数量由你操控且未横置的生物。每以此法横置一个生物，攻城进击兵便得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487691&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa8828cc-36c2-4734-948f-271fc44f2919\', \'multiverseId\': 487691}, \'multiverseid\': 487691}, {\'name\': \'攻城進擊兵\', \'text\': \'連擊（此生物能造成先攻傷害以及普通戰鬥傷害。）\\n每當攻城進擊兵攻擊時，你可以橫置任意數量由你操控且未橫置的生物。每以此法橫置一個生物，攻城進擊兵便得+1/+1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487950&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4a0971b-6c7f-48b4-9502-ea2a817d0214\', \'multiverseId\': 487950}, \'multiverseid\': 487950}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blick in den Abgrund\', \'text\': \'Ein Spieler deiner Wahl zieht die Hälfte der Karten in seiner Bibliothek und verliert die Hälfte seiner Lebenspunkte. Es wird jeweils aufgerundet.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Oh, mach nicht so ein Drama daraus. Wenn deine Augen bluten und dein Gehirn aus deinen Ohren quillt, dann reden wir über verlorenen Verstand."\\n—Braids, Wahnwitzbeschwörerin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485699&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c521bc81-ec05-48f6-80a6-ccdccec4f6d8\', \'multiverseId\': 485699}, \'multiverseid\': 485699}, {\'name\': \'Fisgar en el abismo\', \'text\': \'El jugador objetivo roba una cantidad de cartas igual a la mitad de la cantidad de cartas en su biblioteca y pierde la mitad de sus vidas, redondeando hacia arriba cada vez.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Oh, no hagas dramas. Cuando tus ojos sangren y se te salga el cerebro por las orejas hablaremos de lo que es perder la cordura".\\n—Trenzas, invocadora de demencia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485958&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82995e58-16fc-4abe-a384-d97f2883d223\', \'multiverseId\': 485958}, \'multiverseid\': 485958}, {\'name\': "Sonder l\'abysse", \'text\': "Le joueur ciblé pioche un nombre de cartes égal à la moitié du nombre de cartes de sa bibliothèque et perd la moitié de ses points de vie. Arrondissez à l\'unité supérieure à chaque fois.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Oh, inutile d\'en faire autant. Quand vous aurez les yeux en sang et que votre cervelle vous sortira par les oreilles, vous pourrez dire que vous avez perdu la tête. »\\n—Nattes, invocatrice de démences", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486217&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e553c3c6-629e-494e-9dd9-1793cff5f9b8\', \'multiverseId\': 486217}, \'multiverseid\': 486217}, {\'name\': "Scrutare nell\'Abisso", \'text\': \'Un giocatore bersaglio pesca carte pari a metà del numero di carte nel suo grimorio e perde metà dei suoi punti vita. Arrotonda per eccesso ogni volta.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Oh, non farne un dramma. Quando ti sanguineranno gli occhi e la materia cerebrale ti schizzerà fuori dalle orecchie, allora potremo dire che hai perduto il senno."\\n—Braids, evocatrice di demenza\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486476&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97ef69dc-5262-4521-ba51-950e59d10c17\', \'multiverseId\': 486476}, \'multiverseid\': 486476}, {\'name\': \'深淵への覗き込み\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは、自分のライブラリーにあるカードの枚数の半分に等しい枚数のカードを引き、自分のライフの半分を失う。それぞれの端数は切り上げる。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「そんなに大げさにしないでよ。目が血を吹いて、耳から脳が流れ出してからが、正気を失うというものよ。」\\n――狂気を招く者ブレイズ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486735&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'561211ee-c6aa-47f4-bb7a-113bf327c0b8\', \'multiverseId\': 486735}, \'multiverseid\': 486735}, {\'name\': \'심연 들여다보기\', \'text\': \'플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 자신의 서고에 있는 카드 수의 절반만큼 카드를 뽑고 자신의 생명점 절반을 잃는다. 매번 올림해서 계산한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"그렇게 호들갑 떨지 마. 눈에서 피가 나고, 귀로 뇌가 흘러나오면, 그때쯤 제정신이 아니게 되는 것에 대해 이야기를 해 보자고."\\n—광기 소환술사, 브레이즈\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486994&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ce2b067-1e5b-45a7-941d-acd63638981a\', \'multiverseId\': 486994}, \'multiverseid\': 486994}, {\'name\': \'Perscrutar o Abismo\', \'text\': \'O jogador alvo compra uma quantidade de cards igual à metade do número de cards no próprio grimório e perde metade dos pontos de vida. Arredonde para cima a cada vez.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Ah, não seja tão dramático. Quando seus olhos sangrarem e seu cérebro vazar pelas orelhas poderemos dizer que você perdeu a sanidade."\\n— Braids, invocadora da demência\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6af395d4-eb3c-4fe7-acfe-d52f463d214c\', \'multiverseId\': 487253}, \'multiverseid\': 487253}, {\'name\': \'Взгляд в Бездну\', \'text\': \'Целевой игрок берет карты в количестве, равном половине от числа карт в его библиотеке, и теряет половину своих жизней. Всегда округляйте в большую сторону.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Ох, только не надо преувеличивать. Вот когда у тебя потечет кровь из глаз, а мозг выдавит через уши, — вот тогда поговорим о потере рассудка».\\n— Брейдс, призывательница безумия\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487512&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbf0d381-49c7-4cd1-9d34-144f4b2b51e6\', \'multiverseId\': 487512}, \'multiverseid\': 487512}, {\'name\': \'窥探深渊\', \'text\': \'目标牌手抓等同于其牌库中牌数量一半的牌，且失去等同于其总生命数量一半的生命。各数量小数点后均进位。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「哦，别这么夸张。等到你鲜血涌出双眼，脑干流出双耳的时候，那才算是失去神智。」\\n～惧像召唤师布蕾德\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487771&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26717004-a37f-46c1-a540-8af19c965b86\', \'multiverseId\': 487771}, \'multiverseid\': 487771}, {\'name\': \'窺探深淵\', \'text\': \'目標玩家抽等同於其牌庫中牌數量一半的牌，且失去等同於其總生命數量一半的生命。各數量小數點後均進位。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「哦，別這麼誇張。等到你鮮血湧出雙眼，腦幹流出雙耳的時候，那才算是失去神智。」\\n～懼像召喚師布蕾德\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4707bef-51af-49e7-9fdd-09c83c8737aa\', \'multiverseId\': 488030}, \'multiverseid\': 488030}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blitzhund\', \'text\': \'Eile (Diese Kreatur kann angreifen und {T}, sobald sie unter deine Kontrolle kommt.)\\nImmer wenn der Blitzhund angreift, erhalten andere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen, Hund\', \'flavor\': \'Sein Funke ist schlimmer als sein Biss.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485713&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2ac836b-719c-4a6f-8121-eaa6e513a5fb\', \'multiverseId\': 485713}, \'multiverseid\': 485713}, {\'name\': \'Perro relámpago\', \'text\': \'Prisa. (Esta criatura puede atacar y {T} tan pronto como entra bajo tu control.)\\nSiempre que el Perro relámpago ataque, las otras criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Perro elemental\', \'flavor\': \'Su chispazo es peor que su mordisco.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485972&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a60bc8fc-97f4-4950-8b8e-22036bc025ed\', \'multiverseId\': 485972}, \'multiverseid\': 485972}, {\'name\': "Chien d\'éclair", \'text\': "Célérité (Cette créature peut attaquer et {T} dès le tour où elle arrive sous votre contrôle.)\\nÀ chaque fois que le Chien d\'éclair attaque, les autres créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental et chien\', \'flavor\': "Il crépite plus qu\'il ne mord.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486231&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85c5fff5-b018-4c51-9603-4c41a6c7b06f\', \'multiverseId\': 486231}, \'multiverseid\': 486231}, {\'name\': \'Segugio Saetta\', \'text\': \'Rapidità (Questa creatura può attaccare e {T} non appena entra sotto il tuo controllo.)\\nOgniqualvolta il Segugio Saetta attacca, le altre creature che controlli prendono +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Canide Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'La sua fiamma è ben peggiore del suo morso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486490&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bf07d9d-00c7-4189-805d-b57020c1bf5e\', \'multiverseId\': 486490}, \'multiverseid\': 486490}, {\'name\': \'雷光の猟犬\', \'text\': \'速攻（このクリーチャーは、あなたのコントロール下になってすぐに攻撃したり{T}したりできる。）\\n雷光の猟犬が攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、他の、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル・犬\', \'flavor\': \'咬まれるよりも火花がまずい。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486749&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e227865e-8aed-4e83-8be8-b03b55728dcb\', \'multiverseId\': 486749}, \'multiverseid\': 486749}, {\'name\': \'번개 사냥개\', \'text\': \'신속 (이 생물은 당신의 조종하에 들어오자마자 공격하거나 {T}할 수 있다.)\\n번개 사냥개가 공격할 때마다, 당신이 조종하는 다른 생물들은 턴종료까지 +1/+0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 정령 개\', \'flavor\': \'물어뜯는 것보다 불꽃이 더 심각하다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487008&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea51746a-58f2-4491-ae68-35c5ff28f520\', \'multiverseId\': 487008}, \'multiverseid\': 487008}, {\'name\': \'Sabujo dos Raios\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto (Esta criatura pode atacar e {T} assim que passa ao seu controle.)\\nToda vez que Sabujo dos Raios ataca, as outras criaturas que você controla recebem +1/+0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental Cão\', \'flavor\': \'A faísca é pior que a mordida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd39ad5d-9ad4-4ebf-91db-4e913e199bc2\', \'multiverseId\': 487267}, \'multiverseid\': 487267}, {\'name\': \'Гончая Разрядов\', \'text\': \'Ускорение (Это существо может атаковать и {T}, как только оно попадает под ваш контроль.)\\nКаждый раз, когда Гончая Разрядов атакует, другие существа под вашим контролем получают +1/+0 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль Собака\', \'flavor\': \'Она искрит больнее, чем кусается.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487526&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08aa9172-e848-40d6-a56c-c323a072a7a5\', \'multiverseId\': 487526}, \'multiverseid\': 487526}, {\'name\': \'电闪猎犬\', \'text\': \'敏捷（此生物受你操控时便能攻击与{T}。）\\n每当电闪猎犬攻击时，由你操控的其他生物得+1/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素／狗\', \'flavor\': \'电光比利齿更为凶狠。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487785&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffcf0271-74f7-4d1b-9d9a-d3f60155761f\', \'multiverseId\': 487785}, \'multiverseid\': 487785}, {\'name\': \'電閃獵犬\', \'text\': \'敏捷（此生物受你操控時便能攻擊與{T}。）\\n每當電閃獵犬攻擊時，由你操控的其他生物得+1/+0直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素／狗\', \'flavor\': \'電光比利齒更為凶狠。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488044&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fdd3825-9f60-4f5d-9add-5d133432a53b\', \'multiverseId\': 488044}, \'multiverseid\': 488044}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutgierschlund\', \'text\': \'Lebensverknüpfung (Schaden, der von dieser Kreatur zugefügt wird, lässt dich entsprechend viele Lebenspunkte dazuerhalten.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir\', \'flavor\': \'„Einige genießen die Jagd. Ich genieße das Töten."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485672&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6121931b-8e57-4ea6-bae2-4d6e3a86cb50\', \'multiverseId\': 485672}, \'multiverseid\': 485672}, {\'name\': \'Glotón de sangre\', \'text\': \'Vínculo vital. (El daño hecho por esta criatura también hace que ganes esa misma cantidad de vidas.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Hay quien disfruta cazando. Yo disfruto matando".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485931&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a89aa674-80ec-4c42-bcf2-58d1b8beb819\', \'multiverseId\': 485931}, \'multiverseid\': 485931}, {\'name\': \'Goinfre de sang\', \'text\': \'Lien de vie (Les blessures infligées par cette créature vous font aussi gagner autant de points de vie.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : vampire\', \'flavor\': "« Certains aiment chasser. Moi, j\'aime tuer. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486190&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85029545-d7e4-4f06-9deb-cccd7c332769\', \'multiverseId\': 486190}, \'multiverseid\': 486190}, {\'name\': \'Ingordo di Sangue\', \'text\': \'Legame vitale (Il danno inflitto da questa creatura ti fa anche guadagnare altrettanti punti vita.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Alcuni adorano il gusto della caccia. Io adoro il gusto di uccidere."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486449&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'038e4e33-ff5e-4bfb-bcc7-56c3ba8f8e56\', \'multiverseId\': 486449}, \'multiverseid\': 486449}, {\'name\': \'血の暴食\', \'text\': \'絆魂（このクリーチャーがダメージを与えると、さらにあなたはその点数分のライフを得る。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「狩るのが楽しいと言う者がいる。私は殺すのが楽しい。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486708&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96b555ba-133d-418d-ba6d-720e2b36c953\', \'multiverseId\': 486708}, \'multiverseid\': 486708}, {\'name\': \'피 폭식가\', \'text\': \'생명연결 (이 생물이 피해를 입히면, 당신은 그 피해만큼의 생명점을 얻는다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 흡혈귀\', \'flavor\': \'"사냥을 음미하는 놈들도 있지. 난 죽이는 걸 음미해."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486967&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f51de049-94e7-4fe8-8366-79abbce87a4c\', \'multiverseId\': 486967}, \'multiverseid\': 486967}, {\'name\': \'Glutão do Sangue\', \'text\': \'Vínculo com a vida (O dano causado por esta criatura também faz com que você ganhe uma quantidade equivalente de pontos de vida.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Alguns saboreiam a caça. Eu saboreio o abate."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487226&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4ef9147-c4cf-4f94-adb2-ce115432f9b7\', \'multiverseId\': 487226}, \'multiverseid\': 487226}, {\'name\': \'Кровавый Обжора\', \'text\': \'Цепь жизни (Повреждения, наносимые этим существом, также заставляют вас получить такое же количество жизней.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир\', \'flavor\': \'«Некоторые наслаждаются охотой. Я наслаждаюсь добычей».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487485&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd4d04b3-f3b9-4e77-8fd8-ece2bace0b77\', \'multiverseId\': 487485}, \'multiverseid\': 487485}, {\'name\': \'餮血食客\', \'text\': \'系命（此生物所造成的伤害会让你获得等量的生命。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「有人享受猎捕过程。而我享受夺命时刻。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487744&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'587ee90d-89ad-4648-9eef-49dc9974d8af\', \'multiverseId\': 487744}, \'multiverseid\': 487744}, {\'name\': \'餮血食客\', \'text\': \'繫命（此生物所造成的傷害會讓你獲得等量的生命。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「有人享受獵捕過程。而我享受奪命時刻。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c4b9ecb-176e-4d1c-a782-c11f5036d5fa\', \'multiverseId\': 488003}, \'multiverseid\': 488003}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutige Maßlosigkeit\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken {3} weniger, falls du in diesem Zug 3 oder mehr Lebenspunkte dazuerhalten hast.\\nBringe bis zu zwei Kreaturenkarten deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Aus der Ader trinken? Wie rückständig."\\n—Fürst Duchorvin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485703&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1710b613-ce45-4bb4-87b6-ca1bc9e029ef\', \'multiverseId\': 485703}, \'multiverseid\': 485703}, {\'name\': \'Lujo sanguíneo\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {3} menos lanzar este hechizo si ganaste 3 o más vidas este turno.\\nRegresa hasta dos cartas de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Beber de la vena? Qué ordinario".\\n—Señor Duchorvin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485962&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adb80bd3-c336-476b-9888-d85587d3e993\', \'multiverseId\': 485962}, \'multiverseid\': 485962}, {\'name\': \'Assouvissement sanguin\', \'text\': "Ce sort coûte {3} de moins à lancer si vous avez gagné au moins 3 points de vie ce tour-ci.\\nRenvoyez jusqu\'à deux cartes de créature ciblées depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Boire à même la veine ? C\'est très provincial. »\\n—Seigneur Duchorvin", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486221&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfb783a1-b407-42a5-a578-9a3cc6054716\', \'multiverseId\': 486221}, \'multiverseid\': 486221}, {\'name\': \'Soddisfazione Sanguinaria\', \'text\': \'Questa magia costa {3} in meno per essere lanciata se hai guadagnato 3 o più punti vita in questo turno.\\nRiprendi in mano fino a due carte creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Bere dalle vene? Che abitudine rozza."\\n—Lord Duchorvin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486480&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f06e21b-79e2-4bd9-9717-2a3e6626848b\', \'multiverseId\': 486480}, \'multiverseid\': 486480}, {\'name\': \'血なまぐさい耽溺\', \'text\': \'このターンにあなたがライフを３点以上得ていたなら、この呪文を唱えるためのコストは{3}少なくなる。\\nあなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード最大２枚を対象とし、それらをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「血管から飲むのか？なんと下品な。」\\n――デュチオルヴィン卿\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486739&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40c48e63-1267-453f-b04e-d9f8755bf47f\', \'multiverseId\': 486739}, \'multiverseid\': 486739}, {\'name\': \'유혈 탐닉\', \'text\': \'이 주문은 당신이 이번 턴에 생명점을 3점 이상 얻었다면 발동하는 데 {3}이 덜 든다.\\n당신의 무덤에 있는 생물 카드를 최대 두 장까지 목표로 정한다. 그 카드들을 당신의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"핏줄에서 바로 마신다고? 촌놈들이나 하는 짓이야."\\n—군주 두초르빈\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486998&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'366649e1-bfdb-452f-b9dd-0ebe8fff2587\', \'multiverseId\': 486998}, \'multiverseid\': 486998}, {\'name\': \'Satisfação Sanguínea\', \'text\': \'Esta mágica custa {3} a menos para ser conjurada se você tiver ganho 3 ou mais pontos de vida neste turno.\\nDevolva até dois cards de criatura alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Beber da veia? Que provinciano!"\\n— Senhor Duchorvin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487257&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cc6c0c9-3b21-4224-a47d-1ade6562fe2e\', \'multiverseId\': 487257}, \'multiverseid\': 487257}, {\'name\': \'Кровавое Потворство\', \'text\': \'Разыгрывание этого заклинания стоит на {3} меньше, если в этом ходу вы уже получили 3 или более жизней.\\nВерните не более двух целевых карт существ из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Пить прямо из вены? Как по-деревенски».\\n— лорд Дачорвин\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487516&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee6428e2-7eef-4eab-b0ba-d3d1263bdd06\', \'multiverseId\': 487516}, \'multiverseid\': 487516}, {\'name\': \'血色盛宴\', \'text\': \'如果你本回合中获得过3点或更多生命，则此咒语减少{3}来施放。\\n将至多两张目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「直接从血管喝？真粗野。」\\n～杜卓温领主\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7da00694-1e55-496d-8619-7a603691034b\', \'multiverseId\': 487775}, \'multiverseid\': 487775}, {\'name\': \'血色盛宴\', \'text\': \'如果你本回合中獲得過3點或更多生命，則此咒語減少{3}來施放。\\n將至多兩張目標生物牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「直接從血管喝？真粗野。」\\n～杜卓溫領主\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488034&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9747c01-d405-49a9-a178-107a6179cb07\', \'multiverseId\': 488034}, \'multiverseid\': 488034}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutschlemmer\', \'text\': \'Opfere eine Kreatur als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken.\\nFliegend\\nVerursacht Trampelschaden (Diese Kreatur kann überschüssigen Kampfschaden dem verteidigenden Spieler oder Planeswalker zufügen.)\\nWenn der Blutschlemmer ins Spiel kommt, opfert jeder Gegner eine Kreatur.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485683&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e57a643e-a42c-4781-8df2-68310fee1762\', \'multiverseId\': 485683}, \'multiverseid\': 485683}, {\'name\': \'Goremet\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, sacrifica una criatura.\\nVuela.\\nArrolla. (Esta criatura puede hacer el daño de combate sobrante al jugador o planeswalker al que ataca.)\\nCuando el Goremet entre al campo de batalla, cada oponente sacrifica una criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demonio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485942&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16b2b781-830e-494a-bbf1-e9a6d7c06cb4\', \'multiverseId\': 485942}, \'multiverseid\': 485942}, {\'name\': "Gourmet d\'entrailles", \'text\': "En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, sacrifiez une créature.\\nVol\\nPiétinement (Cette créature peut infliger son surplus de blessures de combat au joueur ou au planeswalker qu\'elle attaque.)\\nQuand le Gourmet d\'entrailles arrive sur le champ de bataille, chaque adversaire sacrifie une créature.", \'type\': \'Créature : démon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486201&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe53e36d-3db3-4991-8c8a-9a027f242a54\', \'multiverseId\': 486201}, \'multiverseid\': 486201}, {\'name\': \'Macabro Buongustaio\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, sacrifica una creatura.\\nVolare\\nTravolgere (Questa creatura può infliggere il danno da combattimento in eccesso al giocatore o al planeswalker che sta attaccando.)\\nQuando il Macabro Buongustaio entra nel campo di battaglia, ogni avversario sacrifica una creatura.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Demone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486460&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'966f0f52-a6be-44ec-88ce-f6bed74c2358\', \'multiverseId\': 486460}, \'multiverseid\': 486460}, {\'name\': \'大殺漢\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。\\n飛行\\nトランプル（このクリーチャーは余剰の戦闘ダメージを、これが攻撃しているプレイヤーかプレインズウォーカーに与えることができる。）\\n大殺漢が戦場に出たとき、各対戦相手はそれぞれクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486719&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4575cc69-512e-4d4b-b8d1-ea3a3e88caf3\', \'multiverseId\': 486719}, \'multiverseid\': 486719}, {\'name\': \'선혈 대식가\', \'text\': \'이 주문을 발동하기 위한 추가비용으로, 생물 한 개를 희생한다.\\n비행\\n돌진 (이 생물은 여분의 전투피해를 공격 중인 플레이어 또는 플레인즈워커에게 입힐 수 있다.)\\n선혈 대식가가 전장에 들어올 때, 각 상대는 생물 한 개를 희생한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 악마\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486978&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b64c437-12a1-44f0-b896-aed000bb9de7\', \'multiverseId\': 486978}, \'multiverseid\': 486978}, {\'name\': \'Gourmet de Vísceras\', \'text\': \'Como custo adicional para conjurar esta mágica, sacrifique uma criatura.\\nVoar\\nAtropelar (Esta criatura pode causar seu dano de combate excedente ao jogador ou planeswalker que ela estiver atacando.)\\nQuando Gourmet de Vísceras entra no campo de batalha, cada oponente sacrifica uma criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demônio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8cc714b-e784-4bb1-9c47-3fcfd13754b3\', \'multiverseId\': 487237}, \'multiverseid\': 487237}, {\'name\': \'Кровожадный Гурман\', \'text\': "В качестве дополнительной стоимости разыгрывания этого заклинания пожертвуйте существо.\\nПолет\\nПробивной удар (Это существо может нанести избыточные боевые повреждения игроку или planeswalker\'у, которого атакует.)\\nКогда Кровожадный Гурман выходит на поле битвы, каждый оппонент жертвует существо.", \'type\': \'Существо — Демон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487496&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0688a65-25b1-4fa5-b416-e127aac594bf\', \'multiverseId\': 487496}, \'multiverseid\': 487496}, {\'name\': \'嗜血餮魔\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个生物，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。\\n飞行\\n践踏（此生物造成之过量战斗伤害能对所攻击的牌手或鹏洛客造成之。）\\n当嗜血餮魔进战场时，每位对手各牺牲一个生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～恶魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487755&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad98b96b-5418-4dc6-b012-829a96c9b5d4\', \'multiverseId\': 487755}, \'multiverseid\': 487755}, {\'name\': \'嗜血餮魔\', \'text\': \'犧牲一個生物，以作為施放此咒語的額外費用。\\n飛行\\n踐踏（此生物造成之過量戰鬥傷害能對所攻擊的玩家或鵬洛客造成之。）\\n當嗜血餮魔進戰場時，每位對手各犧牲一個生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～惡魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488014&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da6615f5-5a30-4d8e-90ca-2282fd72ec24\', \'multiverseId\': 488014}, \'multiverseid\': 488014}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blätterdach-Schleicher\', \'text\': \'Der Blätterdach-Schleicher muss geblockt werden, falls möglich.\\nWenn der Blätterdach-Schleicher stirbt, erhältst du für jede Kreatur, die in diesem Zug gestorben ist, 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze\', \'flavor\': \'Das Blätterdach bietet Schatten, Schutz und ein erhöhtes Risiko für einen plötzlichen Tod.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485757&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52ccb8a0-628a-45e1-b097-4d36dd1c352c\', \'multiverseId\': 485757}, \'multiverseid\': 485757}, {\'name\': \'Acechador de la enramada\', \'text\': \'El Acechador de la enramada debe ser bloqueado si se puede.\\nCuando el Acechador de la enramada muera, ganas 1 vida por cada criatura que murió este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': \'El escondite del bosque da sombra, refugio y una gran probabilidad de tener una muerte súbita.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486016&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0e84b47-b590-4e27-a53c-d8077f68c903\', \'multiverseId\': 486016}, \'multiverseid\': 486016}, {\'name\': \'Pisteur de la canopée\', \'text\': \'Le Pisteur de la canopée doit être bloqué si possible.\\nQuand le Pisteur de la canopée meurt, vous gagnez 1 point de vie pour chaque créature qui est morte ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Créature : chat\', \'flavor\': "La surface boisée fournit de l\'ombre, de la protection, mais aussi un risque accru de mort soudaine.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486275&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78a170a0-cfe5-47bf-88c8-9a1bc04592e5\', \'multiverseId\': 486275}, \'multiverseid\': 486275}, {\'name\': \'Predatore delle Fronde\', \'text\': \'Il Predatore delle Fronde deve essere bloccato, se possibile.\\nQuando il Predatore delle Fronde muore, guadagni 1 punto vita per ogni creatura morta in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': \'La chioma della foresta offre ombra, rifugio e un elevato rischio di morte improvvisa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b54ef2c7-bc80-4179-8166-b7c50255d7d5\', \'multiverseId\': 486534}, \'multiverseid\': 486534}, {\'name\': \'梢の忍び寄り\', \'text\': \'梢の忍び寄りは、可能ならブロックされなければならない。\\n梢の忍び寄りが死亡したとき、あなたは、このターンに死亡したクリーチャー１体につき１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫\', \'flavor\': \'森の茂みは日を遮り、隠れ場となり、襲われる危険を増やす。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486793&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4910d090-627a-4720-9d56-9ec704ef6ad6\', \'multiverseId\': 486793}, \'multiverseid\': 486793}, {\'name\': \'숲그늘 추적자\', \'text\': \'숲그늘 추적자는 가능하면 방어되어야 한다.\\n숲그늘 추적자가 죽을 때, 당신은 이번 턴에 죽은 각 생물마다 생명 1점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고양이\', \'flavor\': \'숲의 지붕은 그늘과 은신처, 그리고 현격히 높아진 갑작스런 죽음의 위험성을 함께 제공한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487052&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79764907-589b-4841-b5fd-9c4e84702780\', \'multiverseId\': 487052}, \'multiverseid\': 487052}, {\'name\': \'Espreitador do Dossel\', \'text\': \'Espreitador do Dossel precisa ser bloqueado se estiver apto.\\nQuando Espreitador do Dossel morre, você ganha 1 ponto de vida para cada criatura que morreu neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': \'Graças ao dossel há sombra, abrigo e um risco maior de morte repentina.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69d6cf37-c554-4fae-845f-15357e6b2005\', \'multiverseId\': 487311}, \'multiverseid\': 487311}, {\'name\': \'Охотник Крон\', \'text\': \'Охотник Крон должен быть заблокирован, если это возможно.\\nКогда Охотник Крон умирает, вы получаете 1 жизнь за каждое существо, которое умерло в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кошка\', \'flavor\': \'Лесные кроны дарят тень, убежище и повышенный риск внезапной смерти.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487570&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5159ca2-b21c-4afb-b11c-3f21f9e44c25\', \'multiverseId\': 487570}, \'multiverseid\': 487570}, {\'name\': \'树冠伏猫\', \'text\': \'若能阻挡树冠伏猫，则必须阻挡之。\\n当树冠伏猫死去时，本回合中每有一个生物死去，你便获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～猫\', \'flavor\': \'茂密树林既提供了遮阳树荫、栖息处所，也让致命猎手有了可乘之机。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487829&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdcfbe2f-2dde-4446-9af7-ab3ffabc998b\', \'multiverseId\': 487829}, \'multiverseid\': 487829}, {\'name\': \'樹冠伏貓\', \'text\': \'若能阻擋樹冠伏貓，則必須阻擋之。\\n當樹冠伏貓死去時，本回合中每有一個生物死去，你便獲得1點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～貓\', \'flavor\': \'茂密樹林既提供了遮陽樹蔭、棲息處所，也讓致命也讓偷襲獵手有了可乘之機。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488088&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdc87a7b-fda3-4df6-92a8-ea39e64b4170\', \'multiverseId\': 488088}, \'multiverseid\': 488088}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brennendes Drachenfeuer\', \'text\': \'Das Brennende Drachenfeuer fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Planeswalker deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu. Falls die Kreatur bzw. der Planeswalker in diesem Zug sterben würde, schicke sie bzw. ihn stattdessen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Als die Feuersbrunst auf sie zuraste, schloss Syr Ameril die Augen und stellte sich Schloss Ardenthal vor, damit ihr letzter Gedanke ihrem Zuhause galt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485740&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3792b3d6-2a97-4a72-8ce5-bc605a5b7814\', \'multiverseId\': 485740}, \'multiverseid\': 485740}, {\'name\': \'Fuegodragón abrasador\', \'text\': \'El Fuegodragón abrasador hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura o planeswalker objetivo. Si esa criatura o planeswalker fuera a morir este turno, en vez de eso, exílialo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Mientras la llamarada se acercaba, Syr Ameril cerró los ojos e imaginó el castillo del Valle de Arden para que sus últimos pensamientos regresaran a casa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485999&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ad04e4c-cc2d-4035-a727-714804a3cc9a\', \'multiverseId\': 485999}, \'multiverseid\': 485999}, {\'name\': \'Feu du dragon dévastateur\', \'text\': \'Le Feu du dragon dévastateur inflige 3 blessures à la créature ciblée ou au planeswalker ciblé. Si cette créature ou ce planeswalker devait mourir ce tour-ci, exilez-le à la place.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "À l\'approche du brasier, Syr Ameril ferma les yeux et s\'imagina le château Ardenval afin que ses dernières pensées soient pour son foyer.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486258&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3532b64e-6d74-4dcf-9b00-3f5874641fe5\', \'multiverseId\': 486258}, \'multiverseid\': 486258}, {\'name\': \'Fuoco Draconico Ustionante\', \'text\': \'Il Fuoco Draconico Ustionante infligge 3 danni a una creatura o a un planeswalker bersaglio. Se quella creatura o quel planeswalker stanno per morire in questo turno, invece esiliali.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Mentre le fiamme correvano verso di lei, Syr Ameril chiuse gli occhi e immaginò il Castello di Ardenvalle, perché i suoi ultimi pensieri la riportassero a casa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486517&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d61e073-4d6b-48a0-82c4-e875b7549eb9\', \'multiverseId\': 486517}, \'multiverseid\': 486517}, {\'name\': \'焦熱の竜火\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。焦熱の竜火はそれに３点のダメージを与える。このターン、そのクリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーが死亡するなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'炎が押し寄せてくると、アメリル卿は目を閉じてアーデンベイル城を思い浮かべた。最後の記憶が故郷となるように。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6211df45-5165-46de-900b-69cb97a0dcc6\', \'multiverseId\': 486776}, \'multiverseid\': 486776}, {\'name\': \'잿더미로 만드는 용의 불\', \'text\': \'생물 또는 플레인즈워커를 목표로 정한다. 잿더미로 만드는 용의 불은 그 목표에게 피해 3점을 입힌다. 그 생물 또는 플레인즈워커가 이번 턴에 죽게 된다면, 대신 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'불길이 다가오기 시작하자, 아메릴 경은 그녀의 눈을 감고 자신의 마지막 생각이 고향에 대한 것이 되길 바라며 아르덴베일 성을 추억했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487035&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e7bcd22-fef5-4abe-bd2d-38901a9a70d6\', \'multiverseId\': 487035}, \'multiverseid\': 487035}, {\'name\': \'Fogo Dracônico Escaldante\', \'text\': \'Fogo Dracônico Escaldante causa 3 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao planeswalker alvo. Se aquela criatura ou aquele planeswalker morreria neste turno, em vez disso, exile-o.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Quando as chamas vieram na direção dela, Syr Ameril fechou os olhos e visualizou o castelo do Vale Arden para que seus últimos pensamentos se voltassem para o lar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f00b129e-f74d-4b57-b677-383110b10ecf\', \'multiverseId\': 487294}, \'multiverseid\': 487294}, {\'name\': \'Жгучее Драконье Пламя\', \'text\': "Жгучее Драконье Пламя наносит 3 повреждения целевому существу или planeswalker\'у. Если то существо или planeswalker должно умереть в этом ходу, изгоните его вместо этого.", \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Когда пламя устремилось к ней, сейра Америл закрыла глаза и представила замок Арденвейл, чтобы ее последние мысли были о доме.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487553&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea9930a7-c94d-41c5-b684-c1aaa626335b\', \'multiverseId\': 487553}, \'multiverseid\': 487553}, {\'name\': \'焦热龙炎\', \'text\': \'焦热龙炎对目标生物或鹏洛客造成3点伤害。如果本回合中该生物或鹏洛客将死去，则改为将它放逐。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'眼见来袭火焰即将吞没自己，艾默莉爵士索性闭上双眼，在脑海中回想起雅登瓦堡的点点滴滴，好让家乡成为自己最后的回忆。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487812&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48ce7244-c4cc-4c88-b3eb-ba14768571d4\', \'multiverseId\': 487812}, \'multiverseid\': 487812}, {\'name\': \'焦熱龍炎\', \'text\': \'焦熱龍炎對目標生物或鵬洛客造成3點傷害。如果本回合中該生物或鵬洛客將死去，則改為將它放逐。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'眼見來襲火焰即將吞沒自己，艾默莉爵士索性閉上雙眼，在腦海中回想起雅登瓦堡的點點滴滴，好讓家鄉成為自己最後的回憶。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488071&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5454a669-411f-4a59-b848-bd74ef9cd1fd\', \'multiverseId\': 488071}, \'multiverseid\': 488071}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bücherdiebin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die Bücherdiebin angreift, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Meervolk, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'„Meine Spezialität sind fehlende Manuskripte, gestohlene Poesie und verlorene Briefe."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485637&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2694ab0-e445-4ac5-8419-3f2b5dc660f8\', \'multiverseId\': 485637}, \'multiverseid\': 485637}, {\'name\': \'Birladora de bibliotecas\', \'text\': \'Siempre que la Birladora de bibliotecas ataque, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón tritón\', \'flavor\': \'"Mis especialidades son los libros llevados, la poesía perdida y los escritos extraídos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fac4c22-23cd-401d-9031-936f81cb981d\', \'multiverseId\': 485896}, \'multiverseid\': 485896}, {\'name\': \'Voleuse de bibliothèque\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que la Voleuse de bibliothèque attaque, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature : ondin et gredin\', \'flavor\': \'« Je suis spécialisée en manuscrits perdus, en poèmes dérobés, et en lettres volées. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486155&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4013fd57-00f2-46a3-98e1-72f06ae8b4b9\', \'multiverseId\': 486155}, \'multiverseid\': 486155}, {\'name\': \'Ladra delle Biblioteche\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta la Ladra delle Biblioteche attacca, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Tritone\', \'flavor\': \'"Sono specializzata in manoscritti mancanti, poesie perdute ed epistole estorte."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486414&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b01a852-9e65-4ec8-a4e1-b6f59e97ccdb\', \'multiverseId\': 486414}, \'multiverseid\': 486414}, {\'name\': \'書庫泥棒\', \'text\': \'書庫泥棒が攻撃するたび、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — マーフォーク・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'「失われた草稿、盗まれた詩文、届かなかった手紙。そういうもの専門です。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486673&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c414604-c790-4a86-8549-77242d3fcf84\', \'multiverseId\': 486673}, \'multiverseid\': 486673}, {\'name\': \'도서관 도둑\', \'text\': \'도서관 도둑이 공격할 때마다, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인어 도적\', \'flavor\': \'"내 전문 분야는 원고 분실, 시 도난, 편지 누락이라네."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486932&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a9fee58-dac0-468e-93b3-ead0a1d4d866\', \'multiverseId\': 486932}, \'multiverseid\': 486932}, {\'name\': \'Larápia de Biblioteca\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Larápia de Biblioteca atacar, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tritão Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'"Minhas especialidades são manuscritos desaparecidos, poesia gatunada e cartas surrupiadas."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487191&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff976d44-b0c9-4a4b-94f8-504ec7ee1d92\', \'multiverseId\': 487191}, \'multiverseid\': 487191}, {\'name\': \'Библиотечная Воровка\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Библиотечная Воровка атакует, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Мерфолк Бродяга\', \'flavor\': \'«Я специализируюсь на пропавших пергаментах, краденых книгах и похищенных письмах».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487450&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88707358-5a2e-4246-ba26-d819b3b864b1\', \'multiverseId\': 487450}, \'multiverseid\': 487450}, {\'name\': \'书库窃犯\', \'text\': \'每当书库窃犯攻击时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人鱼／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「我擅长弄丢手稿，偷取诗篇，截取信件。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487709&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'864626ac-51bd-4fdb-a610-1cc3c5454fb7\', \'multiverseId\': 487709}, \'multiverseid\': 487709}, {\'name\': \'書庫竊犯\', \'text\': \'每當書庫竊犯攻擊時，抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人魚／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「我擅長弄丟手稿，偷取詩篇，截取信件。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487968&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32cd9da3-b8e1-4a4b-a755-2155e2d13895\', \'multiverseId\': 487968}, \'multiverseid\': 487968}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chandra, Auslöserin der Flamme\', \'text\': \'+1: Chandra, Auslöserin der Flamme, fügt jedem Gegner 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n−2: Du kannst eine rote Spontanzauber- oder Hexerei-Karte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof wirken. Falls der Zauberspruch in diesem Zug auf deinen Friedhof gelegt würde, schicke ihn stattdessen ins Exil.\\n−8: Wirf alle Karten aus deiner Hand ab und ziehe dann sieben Karten. Bis zum Ende des Zuges kannst du Zaubersprüche aus deiner Hand wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488658&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70841f5e-7a3e-4918-8037-ddee90f77cfa\', \'multiverseId\': 488658}, \'multiverseid\': 488658}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, catalizadora de la llama\', \'text\': \'+1: Chandra, catalizadora de la llama hace 3 puntos de daño a cada oponente.\\n−2: Puedes lanzar una carta de instantáneo o de conjuro roja objetivo desde tu cementerio. Si ese hechizo fuera a ir a tu cementerio este turno, en vez de eso, exílialo.\\n−8: Descarta tu mano, luego roba siete cartas. Hasta el final del turno, puedes lanzar hechizos de tu mano sin pagar sus costes de maná.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488678&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ecb8a01-a712-4d28-8380-46c94f40eb78\', \'multiverseId\': 488678}, \'multiverseid\': 488678}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, catalyseuse de flammes\', \'text\': "+1: Chandra, catalyseuse de flammes inflige 3 blessures à chaque adversaire.\\n-2: Vous pouvez lancer une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel rouge ciblée de votre cimetière. Si ce sort devait être mis dans votre cimetière ce tour-ci, exilez-le à la place.\\n-8: Défaussez-vous de votre main, puis piochez sept cartes. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, vous pouvez lancez des sorts depuis votre main sans payer leur coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488698&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce393b45-a7b4-4e7e-96fa-9428d01aa377\', \'multiverseId\': 488698}, \'multiverseid\': 488698}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, Catalizzatrice di Fiamme\', \'text\': \'+1: Chandra, Catalizzatrice di Fiamme infligge 3 danni a ogni avversario.\\n-2: Puoi lanciare una carta istantaneo o stregoneria rossa bersaglio dal tuo cimitero. Se quella magia sta per essere messa nel tuo cimitero in questo turno, invece esiliala.\\n-8: Scarta la tua mano, poi pesca sette carte. Fino alla fine del turno, puoi lanciare magie dalla tua mano senza pagare il loro costo di mana.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488718&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4140873b-f349-4d80-8b3e-df709b0eec3c\', \'multiverseId\': 488718}, \'multiverseid\': 488718}, {\'name\': \'炎の触媒、チャンドラ\', \'text\': \'+1：炎の触媒、チャンドラは各対戦相手にそれぞれ３点のダメージを与える。\\n-2：あなたの墓地からインスタントかソーサリーである赤のカード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれを唱えてもよい。このターン、その呪文があなたの墓地に置かれるなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\\n-8：あなたの手札を捨て、その後カードを７枚引く。ターン終了時まで、あなたは、あなたの手札から呪文を、そのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — チャンドラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488738&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f763a61-d3dd-471c-af85-b44919aecda9\', \'multiverseId\': 488738}, \'multiverseid\': 488738}, {\'name\': \'불꽃의 촉매, 찬드라\', \'text\': \'+1: 불꽃의 촉매, 찬드라는 각 상대에게 피해 3점을 입힌다.\\n−2: 당신의 무덤에 있는 적색 순간마법 또는 집중마법 카드를 목표로 정한다. 당신은 그 카드를 발동할 수 있다. 그 주문이 이 턴에 당신의 무덤에 들어가려고 하면, 대신 그 카드를 추방한다.\\n−8: 당신의 손을 버린 후, 카드 일곱 장을 뽑는다. 턴종료까지, 당신은 당신의 손에 있는 주문을 마나비용을 지불하지 않고 발동할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 플레인즈워커 — 찬드라\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488758&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4a3519e-bf4d-4487-beb7-e39f68aa2c9d\', \'multiverseId\': 488758}, \'multiverseid\': 488758}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, Catalisadora da Chama\', \'text\': \'+1: Chandra, Catalisadora da Chama, causa 3 pontos de dano a cada oponente.\\n−2: Você pode conjurar o card de mágica instantânea ou feitiço vermelho alvo do seu cemitério. Se aquela mágica seria colocada no seu cemitério neste turno, em vez disso, exile-a.\\n−8: Descarte sua mão e depois compre sete cards. Até o final do turno, você pode conjurar mágicas de sua mão sem pagar seus custos de mana.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Lendário — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488778&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d81152f-52c3-41c5-826e-38c292c94718\', \'multiverseId\': 488778}, \'multiverseid\': 488778}, {\'name\': \'Чандра, Разжигающая Пламя\', \'text\': \'+1: Чандра, Разжигающая Пламя наносит 3 повреждения каждому оппоненту.\\n−2: вы можете разыграть целевую карту красного мгновенного заклинания или волшебства из вашего кладбища. Если то заклинание должно быть положено на ваше кладбище в этом ходу, изгоните его вместо этого.\\n−8: сбросьте вашу руку, затем возьмите семь карт. До конца хода вы можете разыгрывать заклинания из вашей руки без уплаты их мана-стоимости.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Planeswalker — Чандра\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488798&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c128a75-5eee-4847-af03-9fbcee3b4336\', \'multiverseId\': 488798}, \'multiverseid\': 488798}, {\'name\': \'兴焰热火茜卓\', \'text\': \'+1：兴焰热火茜卓向每位对手各造成3点伤害。\\n−2：你可以从你的坟墓场中施放目标红色瞬间或法术牌。如果该咒语本回合中将置入你的坟墓场，则改为将它放逐。\\n−8：弃掉你的手牌，然后抓七张牌。直到回合结束，你可以从你手上施放咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'传奇鹏洛客 ～茜卓\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488818&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dad18075-b296-4866-924d-18e2b3c08491\', \'multiverseId\': 488818}, \'multiverseid\': 488818}, {\'name\': \'興焰熱火茜卓\', \'text\': \'+1：興焰熱火茜卓向每位對手各造成3點傷害。\\n−2：你可以從你的墳墓場中施放目標紅色瞬間或巫術牌。如果該咒語本回合中將置入你的墳墓場，則改為將它放逐。\\n−8：棄掉你的手牌，然後抽七張牌。直到回合結束，你可以從你手上施放咒語，且不需支付其魔法力費用。\', \'type\': \'傳奇鵬洛客 ～茜卓\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488838&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c29351f0-18ef-4024-9b5b-385bd81e1474\', \'multiverseId\': 488838}, \'multiverseid\': 488838}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chandra, Herz aus Feuer\', \'text\': \'+1: Wirf alle Karten aus deiner Hand ab und schicke dann die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Bis zum Ende des Zuges kannst du Karten spielen, die auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickt wurden.\\n+1: Chandra, Herz aus Feuer, fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n−9: Durchsuche deinen Friedhof und deine Bibliothek nach einer beliebigen Anzahl an roten Spontanzauber- und/oder Hexereikarten, schicke sie ins Exil und mische dann deine Bibliothek. Du kannst sie in diesem Zug wirken. Erzeuge sechs {R}.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485717&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6510846b-0ec3-41ae-8eca-0a4a1f80bc31\', \'multiverseId\': 485717}, \'multiverseid\': 485717}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, Corazón de Fuego\', \'text\': \'+1: Descarta tu mano, luego exilia las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Hasta el final del turno, puedes jugar las cartas exiliadas de esta manera.\\n+1: Chandra, Corazón de Fuego hace 2 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo.\\n−9: Busca en tu cementerio y biblioteca cualquier cantidad de cartas de instantáneo y/o de conjuro rojas, exílialas y luego baraja tu biblioteca. Puedes lanzarlas este turno. Agrega seis {R}.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485976&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc787c39-7183-45b9-a50b-c2df9c1b5cab\', \'multiverseId\': 485976}, \'multiverseid\': 485976}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, cœur de feu\', \'text\': "+1: Défaussez-vous de votre main, puis exilez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, vous pouvez jouer les cartes exilées de cette manière.\\n+1: Chandra, cœur de feu inflige 2 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.\\n-9: Cherchez dans votre cimetière et dans votre bibliothèque n\'importe quel nombre de cartes d\'éphémère et/ou de rituel rouges, exilez-les, et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez les lancer ce tour-ci. Ajoutez six {R}.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486235&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd850d18-7ab1-4d77-8443-b1f77ec9e9fa\', \'multiverseId\': 486235}, \'multiverseid\': 486235}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, Cuore di Fuoco\', \'text\': \'+1: Scarta la tua mano, poi esilia le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio. Fino alla fine del turno, puoi giocare le carte esiliate in questo modo.\\n+1: Chandra, Cuore di Fuoco infligge 2 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\\n-9: Passa in rassegna il tuo cimitero e il tuo grimorio per un qualsiasi numero di carte istantaneo e/o stregoneria rosse, esiliale, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio. Puoi lanciarle in questo turno. Aggiungi sei {R}.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486494&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e6c8e9d-e9e6-4347-9528-76141dc39808\', \'multiverseId\': 486494}, \'multiverseid\': 486494}, {\'name\': \'炎の心、チャンドラ\', \'text\': \'+1：あなたの手札を捨て、その後あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを３枚追放する。ターン終了時まで、あなたはこれにより追放されたカードをプレイしてもよい。\\n+1：クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。炎の心、チャンドラはそれに２点のダメージを与える。\\n-9：あなたの墓地とあなたのライブラリーから赤でありインスタントやソーサリーである望む枚数のカードを探し、追放し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。このターン、あなたはそれらを唱えてもよい。{R}を６点加える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — チャンドラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486753&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cf3736b-23ee-42a6-aa8a-1fe1aac26d80\', \'multiverseId\': 486753}, \'multiverseid\': 486753}, {\'name\': \'불길의 심장, 찬드라\', \'text\': \'+1: 당신의 손을 버린 후, 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 세 장을 추방한다. 턴종료까지, 당신은 이렇게 추방된 카드들을 플레이할 수 있다.\\n+1: 원하는 목표를 정한다. 불길의 심장, 찬드라는 그 목표에게 피해 2점을 입힌다.\\n−9: 당신의 무덤 및 서고에서 적색 순간마법 및/또는 집중마법 카드를 원하는 수만큼 찾아, 그 카드들을 추방한 후, 당신의 서고를 섞는다. 당신은 이번 턴에 그 카드들을 발동할 수 있다. {R} 여섯 개를 추가한다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 플레인즈워커 — 찬드라\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487012&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e702971d-6214-4139-90e8-5859e5c3d11a\', \'multiverseId\': 487012}, \'multiverseid\': 487012}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, Coração de Fogo\', \'text\': \'+1: Descarte sua mão e depois exile os três cards do topo de seu grimório. Até o final do turno, você pode jogar os cards exilados desta maneira.\\n+1: Chandra, Coração de Fogo, causa 2 pontos de dano a qualquer alvo.\\n−9: Procure em seu grimório e cemitério qualquer número de mágicas instantâneas e/ou feitiços vermelhos, exile-os e depois embaralhe seu grimório. Você pode conjurá-los neste turno. Adicione seis {R}.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Lendário — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487271&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da7ae946-c2ff-4277-b9e3-4abe131e7299\', \'multiverseId\': 487271}, \'multiverseid\': 487271}, {\'name\': \'Чандра, Сердце Огня\', \'text\': \'+1: сбросьте вашу руку, затем изгоните три верхние карты вашей библиотеки. До конца хода вы можете разыграть изгнанные таким образом карты.\\n+1: Чандра, Сердце Огня наносит 2 повреждения любой цели.\\n—9: найдите на вашем кладбище и в вашей библиотеке любое количество красных карт мгновенных заклинаний и/или волшебства, изгоните их, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку. Вы можете разыграть их в этом ходу. Добавьте шесть {R}.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Planeswalker — Чандра\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487530&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c295cce-4514-4f8f-b23c-303bc71ed014\', \'multiverseId\': 487530}, \'multiverseid\': 487530}, {\'name\': \'烈焰之心茜卓\', \'text\': \'+1：弃掉你的手牌，然后放逐你牌库顶的三张牌。直到回合结束，你可以使用以此法放逐的牌。\\n+1：烈焰之心茜卓对任意一个目标造成2点伤害。\\n-9：从你的坟墓场和牌库中搜寻任意数量的红色瞬间和／或法术牌，将它们放逐，然后将你的牌库洗牌。本回合中，你可以施放这些牌。加六点{R}。\', \'type\': \'传奇鹏洛客 ～茜卓\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487789&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30a2045d-212f-4ff0-9f7e-8a9b3d731aec\', \'multiverseId\': 487789}, \'multiverseid\': 487789}, {\'name\': \'烈焰之心茜卓\', \'text\': \'+1：棄掉你的手牌，然後放逐你牌庫頂的三張牌。直到回合結束，你可以使用以此法放逐的牌。\\n+1：烈焰之心茜卓對任意一個目標造成2點傷害。\\n−9：從你的墳墓場和牌庫中搜尋任意數量的紅色瞬間和／或巫術牌，將它們放逐，然後將你的牌庫洗牌。本回合中，你可以施放這些牌。加六點{R}。\', \'type\': \'傳奇鵬洛客 ～茜卓\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488048&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'206a217d-cd88-40e9-9197-d4cbc676b467\', \'multiverseId\': 488048}, \'multiverseid\': 488048}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chandra, Herz aus Feuer\', \'text\': \'+1: Wirf alle Karten aus deiner Hand ab und schicke dann die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Bis zum Ende des Zuges kannst du Karten spielen, die auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickt wurden.\\n+1: Chandra, Herz aus Feuer, fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n−9: Durchsuche deinen Friedhof und deine Bibliothek nach einer beliebigen Anzahl an roten Spontanzauber- und/oder Hexereikarten, schicke sie ins Exil und mische dann deine Bibliothek. Du kannst sie in diesem Zug wirken. Erzeuge sechs {R}.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488183&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70339519-f8f1-4657-80db-51a87a9f0ce2\', \'multiverseId\': 488183}, \'multiverseid\': 488183}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, Corazón de Fuego\', \'text\': \'+1: Descarta tu mano, luego exilia las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Hasta el final del turno, puedes jugar las cartas exiliadas de esta manera.\\n+1: Chandra, Corazón de Fuego hace 2 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo.\\n−9: Busca en tu cementerio y biblioteca cualquier cantidad de cartas de instantáneo y/o de conjuro rojas, exílialas y luego baraja tu biblioteca. Puedes lanzarlas este turno. Agrega seis {R}.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488189&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'222316e1-e2a5-4fa7-8e5c-8b8a6e892e2f\', \'multiverseId\': 488189}, \'multiverseid\': 488189}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, cœur de feu\', \'text\': "+1: Défaussez-vous de votre main, puis exilez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, vous pouvez jouer les cartes exilées de cette manière.\\n+1: Chandra, cœur de feu inflige 2 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.\\n-9: Cherchez dans votre cimetière et dans votre bibliothèque n\'importe quel nombre de cartes d\'éphémère et/ou de rituel rouges, exilez-les, et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez les lancer ce tour-ci. Ajoutez six {R}.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488195&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97f12184-c75f-4b69-9c88-dd03db78aed2\', \'multiverseId\': 488195}, \'multiverseid\': 488195}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, Cuore di Fuoco\', \'text\': \'+1: Scarta la tua mano, poi esilia le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio. Fino alla fine del turno, puoi giocare le carte esiliate in questo modo.\\n+1: Chandra, Cuore di Fuoco infligge 2 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\\n-9: Passa in rassegna il tuo cimitero e il tuo grimorio per un qualsiasi numero di carte istantaneo e/o stregoneria rosse, esiliale, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio. Puoi lanciarle in questo turno. Aggiungi sei {R}.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488201&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4824d747-825d-42a6-bb40-a206aa3132d4\', \'multiverseId\': 488201}, \'multiverseid\': 488201}, {\'name\': \'炎の心、チャンドラ\', \'text\': \'+1：あなたの手札を捨て、その後あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを３枚追放する。ターン終了時まで、あなたはこれにより追放されたカードをプレイしてもよい。\\n+1：クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。炎の心、チャンドラはそれに２点のダメージを与える。\\n-9：あなたの墓地とあなたのライブラリーから赤でありインスタントやソーサリーである望む枚数のカードを探し、追放し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。このターン、あなたはそれらを唱えてもよい。{R}を６点加える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — チャンドラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488207&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e53c2900-421d-490e-9bbe-22270db5d5d2\', \'multiverseId\': 488207}, \'multiverseid\': 488207}, {\'name\': \'불길의 심장, 찬드라\', \'text\': \'+1: 당신의 손을 버린 후, 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 세 장을 추방한다. 턴종료까지, 당신은 이렇게 추방된 카드들을 플레이할 수 있다.\\n+1: 원하는 목표를 정한다. 불길의 심장, 찬드라는 그 목표에게 피해 2점을 입힌다.\\n−9: 당신의 무덤 및 서고에서 적색 순간마법 및/또는 집중마법 카드를 원하는 수만큼 찾아, 그 카드들을 추방한 후, 당신의 서고를 섞는다. 당신은 이번 턴에 그 카드들을 발동할 수 있다. {R} 여섯 개를 추가한다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 플레인즈워커 — 찬드라\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488213&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'961c732e-a850-4bb1-95a9-d750fb5d307a\', \'multiverseId\': 488213}, \'multiverseid\': 488213}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, Coração de Fogo\', \'text\': \'+1: Descarte sua mão e depois exile os três cards do topo de seu grimório. Até o final do turno, você pode jogar os cards exilados desta maneira.\\n+1: Chandra, Coração de Fogo, causa 2 pontos de dano a qualquer alvo.\\n−9: Procure em seu grimório e cemitério qualquer número de mágicas instantâneas e/ou feitiços vermelhos, exile-os e depois embaralhe seu grimório. Você pode conjurá-los neste turno. Adicione seis {R}.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Lendário — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488219&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5866b696-f4a4-4723-997a-2a0c40b7a932\', \'multiverseId\': 488219}, \'multiverseid\': 488219}, {\'name\': \'Чандра, Сердце Огня\', \'text\': \'+1: сбросьте вашу руку, затем изгоните три верхние карты вашей библиотеки. До конца хода вы можете разыграть изгнанные таким образом карты.\\n+1: Чандра, Сердце Огня наносит 2 повреждения любой цели.\\n—9: найдите на вашем кладбище и в вашей библиотеке любое количество красных карт мгновенных заклинаний и/или волшебства, изгоните их, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку. Вы можете разыграть их в этом ходу. Добавьте шесть {R}.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Planeswalker — Чандра\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488225&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bddebfbc-6ec9-4a83-b130-8e9abd5ca2db\', \'multiverseId\': 488225}, \'multiverseid\': 488225}, {\'name\': \'烈焰之心茜卓\', \'text\': \'+1：弃掉你的手牌，然后放逐你牌库顶的三张牌。直到回合结束，你可以使用以此法放逐的牌。\\n+1：烈焰之心茜卓对任意一个目标造成2点伤害。\\n-9：从你的坟墓场和牌库中搜寻任意数量的红色瞬间和／或法术牌，将它们放逐，然后将你的牌库洗牌。本回合中，你可以施放这些牌。加六点{R}。\', \'type\': \'传奇鹏洛客 ～茜卓\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd16de77-dbb1-48d4-bd67-f3ae1729fe0b\', \'multiverseId\': 488231}, \'multiverseid\': 488231}, {\'name\': \'烈焰之心茜卓\', \'text\': \'+1：棄掉你的手牌，然後放逐你牌庫頂的三張牌。直到回合結束，你可以使用以此法放逐的牌。\\n+1：烈焰之心茜卓對任意一個目標造成2點傷害。\\n−9：從你的墳墓場和牌庫中搜尋任意數量的紅色瞬間和／或巫術牌，將它們放逐，然後將你的牌庫洗牌。本回合中，你可以施放這些牌。加六點{R}。\', \'type\': \'傳奇鵬洛客 ～茜卓\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ca813c6-86dc-499d-a4b0-0741da745164\', \'multiverseId\': 488237}, \'multiverseid\': 488237}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chandra, Herz aus Feuer\', \'text\': \'+1: Wirf alle Karten aus deiner Hand ab und schicke dann die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Bis zum Ende des Zuges kannst du Karten spielen, die auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickt wurden.\\n+1: Chandra, Herz aus Feuer, fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n−9: Durchsuche deinen Friedhof und deine Bibliothek nach einer beliebigen Anzahl an roten Spontanzauber- und/oder Hexereikarten, schicke sie ins Exil und mische dann deine Bibliothek. Du kannst sie in diesem Zug wirken. Erzeuge sechs {R}.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488941&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed3b8a8a-314e-4743-86c8-87e5b1b63d6d\', \'multiverseId\': 488941}, \'multiverseid\': 488941}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, Corazón de Fuego\', \'text\': \'+1: Descarta tu mano, luego exilia las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Hasta el final del turno, puedes jugar las cartas exiliadas de esta manera.\\n+1: Chandra, Corazón de Fuego hace 2 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo.\\n−9: Busca en tu cementerio y biblioteca cualquier cantidad de cartas de instantáneo y/o de conjuro rojas, exílialas y luego baraja tu biblioteca. Puedes lanzarlas este turno. Agrega seis {R}.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488965&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aca04721-757c-43ee-a298-1c0e5d2d9c42\', \'multiverseId\': 488965}, \'multiverseid\': 488965}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, cœur de feu\', \'text\': "+1: Défaussez-vous de votre main, puis exilez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, vous pouvez jouer les cartes exilées de cette manière.\\n+1: Chandra, cœur de feu inflige 2 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.\\n-9: Cherchez dans votre cimetière et dans votre bibliothèque n\'importe quel nombre de cartes d\'éphémère et/ou de rituel rouges, exilez-les, et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez les lancer ce tour-ci. Ajoutez six {R}.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488989&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e3e1b7a-5305-4c11-80c9-9100131e09e2\', \'multiverseId\': 488989}, \'multiverseid\': 488989}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, Cuore di Fuoco\', \'text\': \'+1: Scarta la tua mano, poi esilia le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio. Fino alla fine del turno, puoi giocare le carte esiliate in questo modo.\\n+1: Chandra, Cuore di Fuoco infligge 2 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\\n-9: Passa in rassegna il tuo cimitero e il tuo grimorio per un qualsiasi numero di carte istantaneo e/o stregoneria rosse, esiliale, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio. Puoi lanciarle in questo turno. Aggiungi sei {R}.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd657f82-d5b6-4624-91aa-a747af26d349\', \'multiverseId\': 489013}, \'multiverseid\': 489013}, {\'name\': \'炎の心、チャンドラ\', \'text\': \'+1：あなたの手札を捨て、その後あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを３枚追放する。ターン終了時まで、あなたはこれにより追放されたカードをプレイしてもよい。\\n+1：クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。炎の心、チャンドラはそれに２点のダメージを与える。\\n-9：あなたの墓地とあなたのライブラリーから赤でありインスタントやソーサリーである望む枚数のカードを探し、追放し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。このターン、あなたはそれらを唱えてもよい。{R}を６点加える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — チャンドラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489037&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0098990-7a44-484c-9f67-f5ea55b0c9ff\', \'multiverseId\': 489037}, \'multiverseid\': 489037}, {\'name\': \'불길의 심장, 찬드라\', \'text\': \'+1: 당신의 손을 버린 후, 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 세 장을 추방한다. 턴종료까지, 당신은 이렇게 추방된 카드들을 플레이할 수 있다.\\n+1: 원하는 목표를 정한다. 불길의 심장, 찬드라는 그 목표에게 피해 2점을 입힌다.\\n−9: 당신의 무덤 및 서고에서 적색 순간마법 및/또는 집중마법 카드를 원하는 수만큼 찾아, 그 카드들을 추방한 후, 당신의 서고를 섞는다. 당신은 이번 턴에 그 카드들을 발동할 수 있다. {R} 여섯 개를 추가한다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 플레인즈워커 — 찬드라\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489061&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2aeb21f7-a049-420f-98d1-f21dae566d44\', \'multiverseId\': 489061}, \'multiverseid\': 489061}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, Coração de Fogo\', \'text\': \'+1: Descarte sua mão e depois exile os três cards do topo de seu grimório. Até o final do turno, você pode jogar os cards exilados desta maneira.\\n+1: Chandra, Coração de Fogo, causa 2 pontos de dano a qualquer alvo.\\n−9: Procure em seu grimório e cemitério qualquer número de mágicas instantâneas e/ou feitiços vermelhos, exile-os e depois embaralhe seu grimório. Você pode conjurá-los neste turno. Adicione seis {R}.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Lendário — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489085&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'040b5430-8abe-4c24-9bde-38face511c43\', \'multiverseId\': 489085}, \'multiverseid\': 489085}, {\'name\': \'Чандра, Сердце Огня\', \'text\': \'+1: сбросьте вашу руку, затем изгоните три верхние карты вашей библиотеки. До конца хода вы можете разыграть изгнанные таким образом карты.\\n+1: Чандра, Сердце Огня наносит 2 повреждения любой цели.\\n—9: найдите на вашем кладбище и в вашей библиотеке любое количество красных карт мгновенных заклинаний и/или волшебства, изгоните их, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку. Вы можете разыграть их в этом ходу. Добавьте шесть {R}.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Planeswalker — Чандра\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f9090bc-615b-4f94-b543-d9e4ef0fbc81\', \'multiverseId\': 489109}, \'multiverseid\': 489109}, {\'name\': \'烈焰之心茜卓\', \'text\': \'+1：弃掉你的手牌，然后放逐你牌库顶的三张牌。直到回合结束，你可以使用以此法放逐的牌。\\n+1：烈焰之心茜卓对任意一个目标造成2点伤害。\\n-9：从你的坟墓场和牌库中搜寻任意数量的红色瞬间和／或法术牌，将它们放逐，然后将你的牌库洗牌。本回合中，你可以施放这些牌。加六点{R}。\', \'type\': \'传奇鹏洛客 ～茜卓\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489133&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c51f4553-77f8-4d77-a210-9536bece8ba7\', \'multiverseId\': 489133}, \'multiverseid\': 489133}, {\'name\': \'烈火之心茜卓\', \'text\': \'+1：棄掉你的手牌，然後放逐你牌庫頂的三張牌。直到回合結束，你可以使用以此法放逐的牌。\\n+1：烈焰之心茜卓對任意一個目標造成2點傷害。\\n−9：從你的墳墓場和牌庫中搜尋任意數量的紅色瞬間和／或巫術牌，將它們放逐，然後將你的牌庫洗牌。本回合中，你可以施放這些牌。加六點{R}。\', \'type\': \'傳奇鵬洛客 ～茜卓\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489157&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'149a3e3f-d0f8-4087-869d-19586794aaac\', \'multiverseId\': 489157}, \'multiverseid\': 489157}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chandras Einäscherer\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken {X} weniger, wobei X gleich der Gesamtsumme an Nicht-Kampfschaden ist, der deinen Gegnern in diesem Zug zugefügt wurde.\\nVerursacht Trampelschaden\\nImmer wenn eine Quelle, die du kontrollierst, einem Gegner Nicht-Kampfschaden zufügt, fügt Chandras Einäscherer einer Kreatur oder einem Planeswalker deiner Wahl, die bzw. den jener Spieler kontrolliert, entsprechend viele Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485718&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce33e3d3-a913-4807-bb1d-45850416e46d\', \'multiverseId\': 485718}, \'multiverseid\': 485718}, {\'name\': \'Incinerador de Chandra\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {X} menos lanzar este hechizo, donde X es la cantidad total de daño que no sea de combate hecho a tus oponentes este turno.\\nArrolla.\\nSiempre que una fuente que controlas haga daño que no sea de combate a un oponente, el Incinerador de Chandra hace esa misma cantidad de daño a la criatura o planeswalker objetivo que controla ese jugador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485977&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74e8d354-a251-4c0d-8f64-65d87748ecb5\', \'multiverseId\': 485977}, \'multiverseid\': 485977}, {\'name\': \'Incinérateur de Chandra\', \'text\': "Ce sort coûte {X} de moins à lancer, X étant le nombre total de blessures non-combat infligées à vos adversaires ce tour-ci.\\nPiétinement\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une source que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures non-combat à un adversaire, l\'Incinérateur de Chandra inflige autant de blessures à une cible, créature ou planeswalker, que ce joueur contrôle.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486236&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55149033-3f0d-4470-9eb8-67af3b344e63\', \'multiverseId\': 486236}, \'multiverseid\': 486236}, {\'name\': \'Inceneritore di Chandra\', \'text\': "Questa magia costa {X} in meno per essere lanciata, dove X è l\'ammontare totale di danno non da combattimento inflitto ai tuoi avversari in questo turno.\\nTravolgere\\nOgniqualvolta una fonte che controlli infligge danno non da combattimento a un avversario, l\'Inceneritore di Chandra infligge altrettanti danni a una creatura o a un planeswalker bersaglio controllati da quel giocatore.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7806e8d-e4d9-4799-baaf-3a434c9827f0\', \'multiverseId\': 486495}, \'multiverseid\': 486495}, {\'name\': \'チャンドラの焼却者\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるためのコストは{X}少なくなる。Ｘはこのターンに対戦相手が受けた戦闘ダメージでないダメージの点数の合計に等しい。\\nトランプル\\nあなたがコントロールしている発生源が対戦相手１人に戦闘ダメージでないダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。チャンドラの焼却者はそれに、その点数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486754&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'548c3bdc-f203-4b7f-8e10-71de7c2df7ef\', \'multiverseId\': 486754}, \'multiverseid\': 486754}, {\'name\': \'찬드라의 소각자\', \'text\': \'이 주문은 발동하는 데 {X}가 덜 든다. X는 이번 턴에 당신의 상대들에게 입혀진 비전투피해의 총합이다.\\n돌진\\n당신이 조종하는 원천이 상대에게 비전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 그 플레이어가 조종하는 생물 또는 플레인즈워커를 목표로 정한다. 찬드라의 소각자는 그 목표에게 그만큼의 피해를 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 정령\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d1fb279-49f1-4d37-849f-36745205267a\', \'multiverseId\': 487013}, \'multiverseid\': 487013}, {\'name\': \'Incinerador de Chandra\', \'text\': \'Esta mágica custa {X} a menos para ser conjurada, sendo X a quantidade total de dano que não seja de combate causada a seus oponentes neste turno.\\nAtropelar\\nToda vez que uma fonte que você controla causa dano que não seja de combate a um oponente, Incinerador de Chandra causa aquela quantidade de dano à criatura ou ao planeswalker alvo que aquele jogador controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487272&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f17ed95-d88d-4d6f-a6c8-a96ea97e54b5\', \'multiverseId\': 487272}, \'multiverseid\': 487272}, {\'name\': \'Испепелитель Чандры\', \'text\': "Стоимость разыгрывания этого заклинания уменьшается на {X}, где Х — общее количество небоевых повреждений, нанесенных вашим оппонентам в этом ходу.\\nПробивной удар\\nКаждый раз, когда источник под вашим контролем наносит небоевые повреждения оппоненту, Испепелитель Чандры наносит столько же повреждений целевому существу или planeswalker\'у под контролем того игрока.", \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487531&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c7b9782-b415-4212-a8f8-807d980c8c93\', \'multiverseId\': 487531}, \'multiverseid\': 487531}, {\'name\': \'茜卓的焚焰灵\', \'text\': \'此咒语减少{X}来施放，X为所有对手本回合中受过的非战斗伤害总数量。\\n践踏\\n每当一个由你操控的来源向任一对手造成非战斗伤害时，茜卓的焚焰灵对目标由该牌手操控的生物或鹏洛客造成等量的伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487790&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92062e66-8feb-436e-a6a5-0f2981e81954\', \'multiverseId\': 487790}, \'multiverseid\': 487790}, {\'name\': \'茜卓的焚焰靈\', \'text\': \'此咒語減少{X}來施放，X為所有對手本回合中受過的非戰鬥傷害總數量。\\n踐踏\\n每當一個由你操控的來源向任一對手造成非戰鬥傷害時，茜卓的焚焰靈對目標由該玩家操控的生物或鵬洛客造成等量的傷害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488049&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0438b22e-34b5-4361-a80b-e6de706bdeb2\', \'multiverseId\': 488049}, \'multiverseid\': 488049}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chandras Einäscherer\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken {X} weniger, wobei X gleich der Gesamtsumme an Nicht-Kampfschaden ist, der deinen Gegnern in diesem Zug zugefügt wurde.\\nVerursacht Trampelschaden\\nImmer wenn eine Quelle, die du kontrollierst, einem Gegner Nicht-Kampfschaden zufügt, fügt Chandras Einäscherer einer Kreatur oder einem Planeswalker deiner Wahl, die bzw. den jener Spieler kontrolliert, entsprechend viele Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488942&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'593608f1-5765-4e85-aad2-30333d61484f\', \'multiverseId\': 488942}, \'multiverseid\': 488942}, {\'name\': \'Incinerador de Chandra\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {X} menos lanzar este hechizo, donde X es la cantidad total de daño que no sea de combate hecho a tus oponentes este turno.\\nArrolla.\\nSiempre que una fuente que controlas haga daño que no sea de combate a un oponente, el Incinerador de Chandra hace esa misma cantidad de daño a la criatura o planeswalker objetivo que controla ese jugador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488966&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b986e7bf-f1d5-4457-823e-c5ab30a4f3c6\', \'multiverseId\': 488966}, \'multiverseid\': 488966}, {\'name\': \'Incinérateur de Chandra\', \'text\': "Ce sort coûte {X} de moins à lancer, X étant le nombre total de blessures non-combat infligées à vos adversaires ce tour-ci.\\nPiétinement\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une source que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures non-combat à un adversaire, l\'Incinérateur de Chandra inflige autant de blessures à une cible, créature ou planeswalker, que ce joueur contrôle.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488990&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c932dcd9-5b14-48d6-ba96-0504fd6bdac5\', \'multiverseId\': 488990}, \'multiverseid\': 488990}, {\'name\': \'Inceneritore di Chandra\', \'text\': "Questa magia costa {X} in meno per essere lanciata, dove X è l\'ammontare totale di danno non da combattimento inflitto ai tuoi avversari in questo turno.\\nTravolgere\\nOgniqualvolta una fonte che controlli infligge danno non da combattimento a un avversario, l\'Inceneritore di Chandra infligge altrettanti danni a una creatura o a un planeswalker bersaglio controllati da quel giocatore.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489014&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bf9506d-4d00-4082-9e09-d80c1cd47ee7\', \'multiverseId\': 489014}, \'multiverseid\': 489014}, {\'name\': \'チャンドラの焼却者\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるためのコストは{X}少なくなる。Ｘはこのターンに対戦相手が受けた戦闘ダメージでないダメージの点数の合計に等しい。\\nトランプル\\nあなたがコントロールしている発生源が対戦相手１人に戦闘ダメージでないダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。チャンドラの焼却者はそれに、その点数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489038&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'485b11e4-bb98-42d9-9ee5-736e4175e361\', \'multiverseId\': 489038}, \'multiverseid\': 489038}, {\'name\': \'찬드라의 소각자\', \'text\': \'이 주문은 발동하는 데 {X}가 덜 든다. X는 이번 턴에 당신의 상대들에게 입혀진 비전투피해의 총합이다.\\n돌진\\n당신이 조종하는 원천이 상대에게 비전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 그 플레이어가 조종하는 생물 또는 플레인즈워커를 목표로 정한다. 찬드라의 소각자는 그 목표에게 그만큼의 피해를 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 정령\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489062&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b3474ae-9524-45fc-8f72-2bb095ba31c1\', \'multiverseId\': 489062}, \'multiverseid\': 489062}, {\'name\': \'Incinerador de Chandra\', \'text\': \'Esta mágica custa {X} a menos para ser conjurada, sendo X a quantidade total de dano que não seja de combate causada a seus oponentes neste turno.\\nAtropelar\\nToda vez que uma fonte que você controla causa dano que não seja de combate a um oponente, Incinerador de Chandra causa aquela quantidade de dano à criatura ou ao planeswalker alvo que aquele jogador controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a7476c1-4653-41a9-a9ad-868e68a4731d\', \'multiverseId\': 489086}, \'multiverseid\': 489086}, {\'name\': \'Испепелитель Чандры\', \'text\': "Стоимость разыгрывания этого заклинания уменьшается на {X}, где Х — общее количество небоевых повреждений, нанесенных вашим оппонентам в этом ходу.\\nПробивной удар\\nКаждый раз, когда источник под вашим контролем наносит небоевые повреждения оппоненту, Испепелитель Чандры наносит столько же повреждений целевому существу или planeswalker\'у под контролем того игрока.", \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fd88ea1-574c-422a-a0ea-4433fd1fcfe1\', \'multiverseId\': 489110}, \'multiverseid\': 489110}, {\'name\': \'茜卓的焚焰灵\', \'text\': \'此咒语减少{X}来施放，X为所有对手本回合中受过的非战斗伤害总数量。\\n践踏\\n每当一个由你操控的来源向任一对手造成非战斗伤害时，茜卓的焚焰灵对目标由该牌手操控的生物或鹏洛客造成等量的伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489134&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec6ad207-42ab-4a7b-a9ca-bde205c18ab5\', \'multiverseId\': 489134}, \'multiverseid\': 489134}, {\'name\': \'茜卓的焚焰靈\', \'text\': \'此咒語減少{X}來施放，X為所有對手本回合中受過的非戰鬥傷害總數量。\\n踐踏\\n每當一個由你操控的來源向任一對手造成非戰鬥傷害時，茜卓的焚焰靈對目標由該玩家操控的生物或鵬洛客造成等量的傷害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489158&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e786bb10-d972-4fb6-8b4f-c4167a99d0ad\', \'multiverseId\': 489158}, \'multiverseid\': 489158}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chandras Feuerbrandling\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Quelle, die du kontrollierst, einem Gegner Nicht-Kampfschaden zufügt, erhält Chandras Feuerbrandling +1/+0 und Doppelschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges. (Er fügt sowohl Erstschlags- als auch normalen Kampfschaden zu.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen, Eidechse\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich denke, Chandra wollte einfach nur etwas, das sie für all die Brandflecken verantwortlich machen konnte."\\n—Jace Beleren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485720&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c795a6f-250b-4ed3-b062-30114a1c99dc\', \'multiverseId\': 485720}, \'multiverseid\': 485720}, {\'name\': \'Piroideo de Chandra\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una fuente que controlas haga daño que no sea de combate a un oponente, el Piroideo de Chandra obtiene +1/+0 y gana la habilidad de dañar dos veces hasta el final del turno. (Daña primero y también hace daño de combate normal.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lagarto elemental\', \'flavor\': \'"Creo que Chandra solo quería algo a lo que echarle la culpa por las marcas de algunas quemaduras".\\n—Jace Beleren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485979&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c1065f0-127b-4f62-bd88-2adc64092347\', \'multiverseId\': 485979}, \'multiverseid\': 485979}, {\'name\': \'Pyrolin de Chandra\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une source que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures non-combat à un adversaire, le Pyrolin de Chandra gagne +1/+0 et acquiert la double initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (Elle inflige des blessures de combat d\'initiative et des blessures de combat normales.)", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental et lézard\', \'flavor\': \'« Je crois que Chandra cherchait juste un bouc-émissaire pour justifier les traces de brûlure. »\\n—Jace Beleren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486238&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51c12ce1-82f7-4be5-9c94-6c040f240ed7\', \'multiverseId\': 486238}, \'multiverseid\': 486238}, {\'name\': \'Igniforme di Chandra\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta una fonte che controlli infligge danno non da combattimento a un avversario, l\'Igniforme di Chandra prende +1/+0 e ha doppio attacco fino alla fine del turno. (Infligge sia danno da combattimento da attacco improvviso che danno da combattimento regolare.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Lucertola Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'"Ho l\\\'impressione che Chandra volesse soltanto qualcosa su cui scaricare la colpa per le bruciature occasionali."\\n—Jace Beleren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486497&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56d00475-9815-4414-8007-66b0bdd2c6c8\', \'multiverseId\': 486497}, \'multiverseid\': 486497}, {\'name\': \'チャンドラの紅蓮獣\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしている発生源が対戦相手１人に戦闘ダメージでないダメージを与えるたび、ターン終了時まで、チャンドラの紅蓮獣は＋１/＋０の修整を受け二段攻撃を得る。（それは先制攻撃と通常の戦闘ダメージの両方を与える。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル・トカゲ\', \'flavor\': \'「チャンドラは、難癖をつけて焦がし回れる何かを求めていただけじゃないかと思う。」\\n――ジェイス・ベレレン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486756&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10b60573-e00c-46e9-abe7-c699adc7797a\', \'multiverseId\': 486756}, \'multiverseid\': 486756}, {\'name\': \'찬드라의 불똥정령\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 원천이 상대에게 비전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 찬드라의 불똥정령은 턴종료까지 +1/+0을 받고 이단공격을 얻는다. (이 생물은 선제공격 전투피해와 일반 전투피해를 둘 다 입힌다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 정령 도마뱀\', \'flavor\': \'"내 생각엔 찬드라가 그저 뜬금없는 그을린 자국들을 탓할 무언가를 원했던 것 같아."\\n—제이스 벨레렌\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487015&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce04e22a-dc36-4de8-a445-a520987fc1ed\', \'multiverseId\': 487015}, \'multiverseid\': 487015}, {\'name\': \'Flamídeo de Chandra\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma fonte que você controla causa dano que não seja de combate a um oponente, Flamídeo de Chandra recebe +1/+0 e ganha golpe duplo até o final do turno. (Ela causa tanto o dano de iniciativa quanto o dano de combate normal.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental Lagarto\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu acho que Chandra só queria alguma coisa em que jogar a culpa pelas queimaduras aleatórias."\\n— Jace Beleren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487274&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09583607-1c59-41ec-b1bc-0cd6bce1e6a1\', \'multiverseId\': 487274}, \'multiverseid\': 487274}, {\'name\': \'Пламевик Чандры\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда источник под вашим контролем наносит небоевые повреждения оппоненту, Пламевик Чандры получает +1/+0 и Двойной удар до конца хода. (Он наносит боевые повреждения как на этапе Первого удара, так и на этапе обычных повреждений.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль Ящер\', \'flavor\': \'«Я думаю, Чандре просто нужен был кто-то, на кого можно свалить вину за постоянные ожоги».\\n— Джейс Белерен\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f2d5e18-aacf-4b01-8a42-57faa524bc8c\', \'multiverseId\': 487533}, \'multiverseid\': 487533}, {\'name\': \'茜卓的幼火灵\', \'text\': \'每当一个由你操控的来源向任一对手造成非战斗伤害时，直到回合结束，茜卓的幼火灵得+1/+0且获得连击异能。（它能造成先攻与普通战斗伤害。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素／蜥蜴\', \'flavor\': \'「我觉得茜卓只是要找个东西来把胡乱烧痕怪罪上去。」\\n～杰斯贝连\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487792&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75cdb06c-69e2-49db-bd35-aa6fab546557\', \'multiverseId\': 487792}, \'multiverseid\': 487792}, {\'name\': \'茜卓的幼火靈\', \'text\': \'每當一個由你操控的來源向任一對手造成非戰鬥傷害時，直到回合結束，茜卓的幼火靈得+1/+0且獲得連擊異能。（它能造成先攻與普通戰鬥傷害。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素／蜥蜴\', \'flavor\': \'「我覺得茜卓只是要找個東西來把胡亂燒痕怪罪上去。」\\n～傑斯貝連\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488051&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d239823a-b14c-496b-8712-06c0472f8095\', \'multiverseId\': 488051}, \'multiverseid\': 488051}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chandras Feuerbrandling\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Quelle, die du kontrollierst, einem Gegner Nicht-Kampfschaden zufügt, erhält Chandras Feuerbrandling +1/+0 und Doppelschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen Eidechse\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488944&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6aed13ac-ff3e-4c8f-98ed-866a43ee9e29\', \'multiverseId\': 488944}, \'multiverseid\': 488944}, {\'name\': \'Piroideo de Chandra\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una fuente que controlas haga daño que no sea de combate a un oponente, el Piroideo de Chandra obtiene +1/+0 y gana la habilidad de dañar dos veces hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental Lagarto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488968&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da255e4e-b87e-4a9c-82d0-da9a55d7535b\', \'multiverseId\': 488968}, \'multiverseid\': 488968}, {\'name\': \'Pyrolin de Chandra\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une source que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures non-combat à un adversaire, le Pyrolin de Chandra gagne +1/+0 et acquiert la double initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental et lézard\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488992&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99756ac0-4234-4598-b370-014afc3421ea\', \'multiverseId\': 488992}, \'multiverseid\': 488992}, {\'name\': \'Igniforme di Chandra\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta una fonte che controlli infligge danno non da combattimento a un avversario, l\'Igniforme di Chandra prende +1/+0 e ha doppio attacco fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale Lucertola\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489016&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db1059e5-bebc-468e-9a2d-8b1d740b3a3f\', \'multiverseId\': 489016}, \'multiverseid\': 489016}, {\'name\': \'チャンドラの紅蓮獣\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしている発生源が対戦相手１人に戦闘ダメージでないダメージを与えるたび、ターン終了時まで、チャンドラの紅蓮獣は＋１/＋０の修整を受け二段攻撃を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタルトカゲ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489040&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c052e952-73fa-4bcf-b109-c4ded987dac9\', \'multiverseId\': 489040}, \'multiverseid\': 489040}, {\'name\': \'찬드라의 불똥정령\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 원천이 상대에게 비전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 찬드라의 불똥정령은 턴종료까지 +1/+0을 받고 이단공격을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 정령 도마뱀\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489064&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3bbe3021-1032-4608-b482-21c26712472c\', \'multiverseId\': 489064}, \'multiverseid\': 489064}, {\'name\': \'Flamídeo de Chandra\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma fonte que você controla causa dano que não seja de combate a um oponente, Flamídeo de Chandra recebe +1/+0 e ganha golpe duplo até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental Lagarto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489088&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4d271fa-b4f3-44d0-8499-1362ff1a5c8c\', \'multiverseId\': 489088}, \'multiverseid\': 489088}, {\'name\': \'Пламевик Чандры\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда источник под вашим контролем наносит небоевые повреждения оппоненту, Пламевик Чандры получает +1/+0 и Двойной удар до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль Ящер\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489112&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff6b40d0-1e0f-4a2d-81eb-3b548d2fbd1e\', \'multiverseId\': 489112}, \'multiverseid\': 489112}, {\'name\': \'茜卓的幼火灵\', \'text\': \'每当一个由你操控的来源向任一对手造成非战斗伤害时，直到回合结束，茜卓的幼火灵得+1/+0 且获得连击异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素／蜥蜴\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e84c568-1c36-4ec1-918b-d6ebe712a9f5\', \'multiverseId\': 489136}, \'multiverseid\': 489136}, {\'name\': \'茜卓的幼火靈\', \'text\': \'每當一個由你操控的來源向任一對手造成非戰鬥傷害時，直到回合結束，茜卓的幼火靈得+1/+0 且獲得連擊異能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素蜥蜴\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489160&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffbe9d54-dab8-4630-9f12-09cac7a7d21a\', \'multiverseId\': 489160}, \'multiverseid\': 489160}]', "[{'name': 'Chandras Feuerschlund', 'text': 'Eile\\nWenn Chandras Feuerschlund ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek und/oder deinen Friedhof nach einer Karte namens Chandra, Auslöserin der Flamme, durchsuchen, sie offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen. Falls du auf diese Weise deine Bibliothek durchsuchst, mische sie danach.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Teufelsbraten', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488659&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7c634a8c-8167-47c3-ad62-4833717f99e3', 'multiverseId': 488659}, 'multiverseid': 488659}, {'name': 'Bocafuego de Chandra', 'text': 'Prisa.\\nCuando el Bocafuego de Chandra entre al campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca y/o cementerio una carta llamada Chandra, catalizadora de la llama, mostrarla y ponerla en tu mano. Si buscas en tu biblioteca de esta manera, barájala.', 'type': 'Criatura — Infernal', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488679&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e8e9b138-bb74-4a01-b3de-51dfe4f87b2d', 'multiverseId': 488679}, 'multiverseid': 488679}, {'name': 'Gueuldefeu de Chandra', 'text': 'Célérité\\nQuand le Gueuldefeu de Chandra arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque et/ou votre cimetière une carte appelée Chandra, catalyseuse de flammes, la révéler et la mettre dans votre main. Si vous cherchez dans votre bibliothèque de cette manière, mélangez-la.', 'type': 'Créature : monstruosité', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488699&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c1e2a937-df8b-4b62-a5c7-0c3272cf8b0e', 'multiverseId': 488699}, 'multiverseid': 488699}, {'name': 'Fauce Infuocata di Chandra', 'text': 'Rapidità\\nQuando la Fauce Infuocata di Chandra entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio e/o il tuo cimitero per una carta chiamata Chandra, Catalizzatrice di Fiamme, rivelarla e aggiungerla alla tua mano. Se passi in rassegna il tuo grimorio in questo modo, rimescolalo.', 'type': 'Creatura — Infernale', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488719&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '83f591e2-c0fc-48cc-ab85-7847b89ee2b0', 'multiverseId': 488719}, 'multiverseid': 488719}, {'name': 'チャンドラの火大口', 'text': '速攻\\nチャンドラの火大口が戦場に出たとき、あなたは、あなたのライブラリーやあなたの墓地から「炎の触媒、チャンドラ」という名前のカード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加えてもよい。これによりあなたがあなたのライブラリーからカードを探したなら、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ヘリオン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488739&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9fec3ea3-3bdf-4171-bc72-134b5dcac927', 'multiverseId': 488739}, 'multiverseid': 488739}, {'name': '찬드라의 불꽃아가리', 'text': '신속\\n찬드라의 불꽃아가리가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 당신의 서고 및/또는 무덤에서 불꽃의 촉매, 찬드라인 카드 한 장을 찾아, 공개한 후, 당신의 손으로 가져갈 수 있다. 당신이 이런 식으로 당신의 서고를 찾아보았다면, 당신의 서고를 섞는다.', 'type': '생물 — 헬리온', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488759&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e07d3a91-c02e-4b9a-b168-caabdcd80d9a', 'multiverseId': 488759}, 'multiverseid': 488759}, {'name': 'Ignívomo de Chandra', 'text': 'Ímpeto\\nQuando Ignívomo de Chandra entra no campo de batalha, você pode procurar em seu grimório e/ou cemitério um card com o nome Chandra, Catalisadora da Chama, revelá-lo e colocá-lo em sua mão. Se procurar em seu grimório desta maneira, embaralhe-o.', 'type': 'Criatura — Avernal', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488779&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '352b11a1-1ffb-4573-82c5-35d088ebf98a', 'multiverseId': 488779}, 'multiverseid': 488779}, {'name': 'Огнезевая Тварь Чандры', 'text': 'Ускорение\\nКогда Огнезевая Тварь Чандры выходит на поле битвы, вы можете найти в вашей библиотеке и/или на вашем кладбище карту с именем Чандра, Разжигающая Пламя, показать ее и положить в вашу руку. Если вы ищете таким образом в вашей библиотеке, перетасуйте ее.', 'type': 'Существо — Геллион', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488799&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5ee9e3d3-e48c-4519-b7c0-9a9de350648d', 'multiverseId': 488799}, 'multiverseid': 488799}, {'name': '茜卓的炎喉兽', 'text': '敏捷\\n当茜卓的炎喉兽进战场时，你可以从你的牌库和／或坟墓场中搜寻一张名称为兴焰热火茜卓的牌，展示该牌，并将它置于你手上。如果你以此法搜寻你的牌库，则将它洗牌。', 'type': '生物 ～地狱兽', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488819&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '62ba5d59-be48-4137-9503-2fee5de126b2', 'multiverseId': 488819}, 'multiverseid': 488819}, {'name': '茜卓的炎喉獸', 'text': '敏捷\\n當茜卓的炎喉獸進戰場時，你可以從你的牌庫和／或墳墓場中搜尋一張名稱為興焰熱火茜卓的牌，展示該牌，並將它置於你手上。如果你以此法搜尋你的牌庫，則將它洗牌。', 'type': '生物 ～地獄獸', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488839&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7a0ee841-004c-4875-8b3a-dd6b92bd3d5a', 'multiverseId': 488839}, 'multiverseid': 488839}]", '[{\'name\': \'Chandras Magmaköter\', \'text\': \'{T}: Chandras Magmaköter fügt einem Spieler oder Planeswalker deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen Hund\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488943&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f09ba902-2716-4164-90e0-6fd77412e3b1\', \'multiverseId\': 488943}, \'multiverseid\': 488943}, {\'name\': \'Mestizo de magma de Chandra\', \'text\': \'{T}: El Mestizo de magma de Chandra hace 1 punto de daño al jugador o planeswalker objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental Perro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488967&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b278280-7968-4733-9036-56396c84cd6f\', \'multiverseId\': 488967}, \'multiverseid\': 488967}, {\'name\': \'Molosse de magma de Chandra\', \'text\': \'{T} : Le Molosse de magma de Chandra inflige 1 blessure à une cible, joueur ou planeswalker.\', \'type\': \'Créature : élémental et chien\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488991&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2214c57e-4cb9-4246-85ae-031e3b4a9469\', \'multiverseId\': 488991}, \'multiverseid\': 488991}, {\'name\': \'Magmastino di Chandra\', \'text\': \'{T}: Il Magmastino di Chandra infligge 1 danno a un giocatore o a un planeswalker bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale Canide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489015&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac209423-e32c-47de-937b-3c1f11b4a100\', \'multiverseId\': 489015}, \'multiverseid\': 489015}, {\'name\': \'チャンドラのマグムット\', \'text\': \'{T}：プレイヤー１人かプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。チャンドラのマグムットはそれに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル犬\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489039&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23b43390-f460-43cf-984b-7023f28885af\', \'multiverseId\': 489039}, \'multiverseid\': 489039}, {\'name\': \'찬드라의 마그마개\', \'text\': \'{T}: 플레이어 또는 플레인즈워커를 목표로 정한다. 찬드라의 마그마개는 그 목표에게 피해 1점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 정령 개\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489063&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11ad1275-6c88-4018-a0e9-481ce48798c6\', \'multiverseId\': 489063}, \'multiverseid\': 489063}, {\'name\': \'Cão de Magma de Chandra\', \'text\': \'{T}: Cão de Magma de Chandra causa 1 ponto de dano ao jogador ou planeswalker alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental Cão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489087&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d57077cc-4cdc-49ff-af83-69aab935112d\', \'multiverseId\': 489087}, \'multiverseid\': 489087}, {\'name\': \'Магмовый Пес Чандры\', \'text\': "{T}: Магмовый Пес Чандры наносит 1 повреждение целевому игроку или planeswalker\'у.", \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль Собака\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489111&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b16825d-019e-451e-b09e-d002ea8f48b3\', \'multiverseId\': 489111}, \'multiverseid\': 489111}, {\'name\': \'茜卓的熔岩犬\', \'text\': \'{T}：茜卓的熔岩犬对目标牌手或鹏洛客造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素／狗\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489135&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e37964ff-1437-4aaa-97e3-0e6ab8293394\', \'multiverseId\': 489135}, \'multiverseid\': 489135}, {\'name\': \'茜卓的熔岩犬\', \'text\': \'{T}：茜卓的熔岩犬對目標玩家或鵬洛客造成1點傷害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素／狗\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=489159&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d08e1ef-af37-4a2e-ae3f-e95a65ecdfe3\', \'multiverseId\': 489159}, \'multiverseid\': 489159}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chandras Magmaköter\', \'text\': \'{T}: Chandras Magmaköter fügt einem Spieler oder Planeswalker deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen, Hund\', \'flavor\': \'„Ist er reinrassig? Nein, aber reines Feuer."\\n—Chandra Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485719&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5f89352-c276-485c-8ed9-274a7dd29ef6\', \'multiverseId\': 485719}, \'multiverseid\': 485719}, {\'name\': \'Mestizo de magma de Chandra\', \'text\': \'{T}: El Mestizo de magma de Chandra hace 1 punto de daño al jugador o planeswalker objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Perro elemental\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Que si es de raza pura? No, pero es de puro fuego".\\n—Chandra Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485978&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5eae3b57-b197-40f0-8de9-fdbd460d0ba1\', \'multiverseId\': 485978}, \'multiverseid\': 485978}, {\'name\': \'Molosse de magma de Chandra\', \'text\': \'{T} : Le Molosse de magma de Chandra inflige 1 blessure à une cible, joueur ou planeswalker.\', \'type\': \'Créature : élémental et chien\', \'flavor\': "« Si c\'est un pur-sang ? Non, mais c\'est un pur-feu. »\\n—Chandra Nalaàr", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486237&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f53e00d4-a145-4e70-86c7-3e15611e73d2\', \'multiverseId\': 486237}, \'multiverseid\': 486237}, {\'name\': \'Magmastino di Chandra\', \'text\': \'{T}: Il Magmastino di Chandra infligge 1 danno a un giocatore o a un planeswalker bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Canide Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'"È di razza pura? No, ma è di puro fuoco."\\n—Chandra Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486496&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b9053d3-a8d0-4a82-8eae-c76621bcaed9\', \'multiverseId\': 486496}, \'multiverseid\': 486496}, {\'name\': \'チャンドラのマグムット\', \'text\': \'{T}：プレイヤー１人かプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。チャンドラのマグムットはそれに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル・犬\', \'flavor\': \'「純血かって？違うわ。だけど純粋な火ではあるわね。」\\n――チャンドラ・ナラー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486755&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edbf58ef-fc36-4051-a1da-2c64f229801c\', \'multiverseId\': 486755}, \'multiverseid\': 486755}, {\'name\': \'찬드라의 마그마개\', \'text\': \'{T}: 플레이어 또는 플레인즈워커를 목표로 정한다. 찬드라의 마그마개는 그 목표에게 피해 1점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 정령 개\', \'flavor\': \'"순종이냐고? 아니, 하지만 순수한 불꽃이지."\\n—찬드라 날라르\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487014&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c18908ed-8762-4e68-885e-14ac0968ea5e\', \'multiverseId\': 487014}, \'multiverseid\': 487014}, {\'name\': \'Cão de Magma de Chandra\', \'text\': \'{T}: Cão de Magma de Chandra causa 1 ponto de dano ao jogador ou planeswalker alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental Cão\', \'flavor\': \'"Ele é de raça? Não, é de fogo mesmo."\\n— Chandra Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487273&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd3e77e4-2674-40f3-9ba5-e1d09fe3cf93\', \'multiverseId\': 487273}, \'multiverseid\': 487273}, {\'name\': \'Магмовый Пес Чандры\', \'text\': "{T}: Магмовый Пес Чандры наносит 1 повреждение целевому игроку или planeswalker\'у.", \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль Собака\', \'flavor\': \'«Чистопородный ли он? Нет, но он из чистого огня».\\n— Чандра Налаар\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487532&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11a10c85-1e6a-4f94-b6e4-83b5c7c71645\', \'multiverseId\': 487532}, \'multiverseid\': 487532}, {\'name\': \'茜卓的熔岩犬\', \'text\': \'{T}：茜卓的熔岩犬对目标牌手或鹏洛客造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素／狗\', \'flavor\': \'「你问它是不是纯种？不是，但它是纯火。」\\n～茜卓纳拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487791&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86e54305-689f-4712-8c7c-f03f1cff72f5\', \'multiverseId\': 487791}, \'multiverseid\': 487791}, {\'name\': \'茜卓的熔岩犬\', \'text\': \'{T}：茜卓的熔岩犬對目標玩家或鵬洛客造成1點傷害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素／狗\', \'flavor\': \'「你問牠是不是純種？不是，但牠是純火。」\\n～茜卓納拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488050&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97e31dcb-f8a7-41f6-8dae-d592fb792ab9\', \'multiverseId\': 488050}, \'multiverseid\': 488050}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chaos-Narr\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du eine bleibende Karte opferst, fügt der Chaos-Narr einem Ziel deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Teufel\', \'flavor\': \'Für die Rakdos sind Freudengeschrei und Angstgeschrei ein und dasselbe.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485731&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58a6e2c3-4be6-46a2-8c14-b9531197a4d1\', \'multiverseId\': 485731}, \'multiverseid\': 485731}, {\'name\': \'Bufón agitador\', \'text\': \'Siempre que sacrifiques un permanente, el Bufón agitador hace 1 punto de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Diablo\', \'flavor\': \'Para los rakdos, los gritos de alegría y los de miedo son iguales.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485990&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7c2f08b-69eb-440b-b49b-b510bb66857e\', \'multiverseId\': 485990}, \'multiverseid\': 485990}, {\'name\': \'Bouffon ravageur\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous sacrifiez un permanent, le Bouffon ravageur inflige 1 blessure à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Créature : diable\', \'flavor\': \'Chez les Rakdos, les cris de plaisir et de terreur sont identiques.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486249&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf1fb9b1-0632-4fd4-8bad-67c594709278\', \'multiverseId\': 486249}, \'multiverseid\': 486249}, {\'name\': \'Giullare del Caos\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta sacrifichi un permanente, il Giullare del Caos infligge 1 danno a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Diavolo\', \'flavor\': \'Per i Rakdos, urla di gioia e urla di terrore sono la stessa cosa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486508&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95569f6f-51b0-4830-a347-af51817af08e\', \'multiverseId\': 486508}, \'multiverseid\': 486508}, {\'name\': \'騒乱の道化\', \'text\': \'あなたがパーマネントを１つ生け贄に捧げるたび、クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。騒乱の道化はそれに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デビル\', \'flavor\': \'ラクドスにとって、嬉しい悲鳴と恐怖の悲鳴はまったく同じものだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73810d21-5592-4170-9d81-dbb2b1d6b227\', \'multiverseId\': 486767}, \'multiverseid\': 486767}, {\'name\': \'대혼란의 어릿광대\', \'text\': \'당신이 지속물을 희생할 때마다, 원하는 목표를 정한다. 대혼란의 어릿광대는 그 목표에게 피해 1점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 악령\', \'flavor\': \'락도스에게, 기쁨의 비명과 공포의 비명은 서로 그렇게 다르지 않다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487026&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47db316a-870c-4e6a-ba13-f34d6977d954\', \'multiverseId\': 487026}, \'multiverseid\': 487026}, {\'name\': \'Bufão da Destruição\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você sacrifica uma permanente, Bufão da Destruição causa 1 ponto de dano a qualquer alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Diabo\', \'flavor\': \'Para os Rakdos, gritos de deleite e terror são a mesma coisa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aaed6c68-be60-41db-9471-52044233c0cd\', \'multiverseId\': 487285}, \'multiverseid\': 487285}, {\'name\': \'Шут Хаоса\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы жертвуете перманент, Шут Хаоса наносит 1 повреждение любой цели.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дьявол\', \'flavor\': \'Для Ракдосов крики радости и крики ужаса — это одно и то же.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9efed0dd-b4b8-4bd5-ac03-dfb64cf64d0a\', \'multiverseId\': 487544}, \'multiverseid\': 487544}, {\'name\': \'浩劫小丑\', \'text\': \'每当你牺牲一个永久物时，浩劫小丑对任意一个目标造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～魔鬼\', \'flavor\': \'对拉铎司人而言，兴奋呼喊与恐惧尖叫是一回事。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487803&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'203268cb-544f-4346-87d8-213650b99b8b\', \'multiverseId\': 487803}, \'multiverseid\': 487803}, {\'name\': \'浩劫小丑\', \'text\': \'每當你犧牲一個永久物時，浩劫小丑對任意一個目標造成1點傷害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～魔鬼\', \'flavor\': \'對拉鐸司人而言，興奮呼喊與恐懼尖叫是一回事。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488062&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92ba152b-0bc5-49bc-8d4f-593d14070262\', \'multiverseId\': 488062}, \'multiverseid\': 488062}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chapardeur fantomal\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que le Chapardeur fantomal devient dégagé, vous pouvez payer {2}. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez une carte.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un adversaire lance un sort depuis autre part que sa main, piochez une carte.\\nDéfaussez-vous d\'une carte : Le Chapardeur fantomal ne peut pas être bloqué ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature : esprit et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488301&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b10ed99c-3ffc-4081-babe-1b309f31b6fe\', \'multiverseId\': 488301}, \'multiverseid\': 488301}, {\'name\': \'幽体のこそ泥\', \'text\': \'幽体のこそ泥がアンタップ状態になるたび、あなたは{2}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、カードを１枚引く。\\n対戦相手が自分の手札以外の領域から呪文を唱えるたび、あなたはカードを１枚引く。\\nカード１枚を捨てる：このターン、幽体のこそ泥はブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488353&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7ce844e-d4ba-4199-b04f-382c669cbb6f\', \'multiverseId\': 488353}, \'multiverseid\': 488353}]', "[{'name': 'Chef de la meute', 'text': 'Les autres chiens que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\\nÀ chaque fois que le Chef de la meute attaque, prévenez toutes les blessures de combat qui devraient être infligées ce tour-ci aux chiens que vous contrôlez.', 'type': 'Créature : chien', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488296&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7e713fe6-2e79-4756-813d-f162dc71c94a', 'multiverseId': 488296}, 'multiverseid': 488296}, {'name': '群れを導くもの', 'text': '他の、あなたがコントロールしている犬は＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n群れを導くものが攻撃するたび、このターン、あなたがコントロールしている犬が受ける戦闘ダメージをすべて軽減する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 犬', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488348&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '25078e93-2cea-4013-9ffd-6df45da19c78', 'multiverseId': 488348}, 'multiverseid': 488348}]", '[{\'name\': \'Chromatisches Orrery\', \'text\': \'Du kannst Mana ausgeben, als wäre es Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}{C}{C}{C}{C}.\\n{5}, {T}: Ziehe für jede Farbe unter den bleibenden Karten, die du kontrollierst, eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Besucher staunen über sein Design, ohne etwas zu ahnen von der anderen Welt, die es inspiriert hat.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485810&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba73af21-658b-4a85-9602-d51677549f91\', \'multiverseId\': 485810}, \'multiverseid\': 485810}, {\'name\': \'Planetario cromático\', \'text\': \'Puedes usar maná como si fuera maná de cualquier color.\\n{T}: Agrega {C}{C}{C}{C}{C}.\\n{5}, {T}: Roba una carta por cada color entre los permanentes que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': \'Los visitantes se maravillan por su diseño, ajenos al otro mundo que lo inspiró.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486069&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f96481e6-fdbf-4dd4-aa7b-b3d19cdbb7cd\', \'multiverseId\': 486069}, \'multiverseid\': 486069}, {\'name\': \'Planétaire mécanique chromatique\', \'text\': "Vous pouvez dépenser du mana comme si c\'était du mana de n\'importe quelle couleur.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}{C}{C}{C}{C}.\\n{5}, {T} : Piochez une carte pour chaque couleur parmi les permanents que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': "Les visiteurs admirent sa conception, sans connaître l\'autre monde qui a inspiré sa construction.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486328&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d700643e-32fc-4e13-ae05-ce8704edcb1d\', \'multiverseId\': 486328}, \'multiverseid\': 486328}, {\'name\': \'Planetario Cromatico\', \'text\': \'Puoi spendere il mana come se fosse mana di qualsiasi colore.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C}{C}{C}{C}{C}.\\n{5}, {T}: Pesca una carta per ogni colore tra i permanenti che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': "I visitatori restano a bocca aperta dinanzi alla sua struttura, ignari dell\'altro mondo che l\'ha ispirato.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c49b1d8e-0a70-4da4-b4d1-b8f17a81382a\', \'multiverseId\': 486587}, \'multiverseid\': 486587}, {\'name\': \'彩色の宇宙儀\', \'text\': \'あなたはマナを望む色のマナであるかのように支払ってもよい。\\n{T}：{C}{C}{C}{C}{C}を加える。\\n{5}, {T}：あなたがコントロールしているパーマネントの中の色１色につきカードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'訪問者はそのデザインに驚くが、その着想を与えた異世界には気づかない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486846&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e6dbd59-8ca6-4ed4-8d35-69500b4c70bc\', \'multiverseId\': 486846}, \'multiverseid\': 486846}, {\'name\': \'다색 천문관\', \'text\': \'당신은 마나를 원하는 색의 마나인 것처럼 사용할 수 있다.\\n{T}: {C}{C}{C}{C}{C}를 추가한다.\\n{5}, {T}: 당신이 조종하는 지속물들의 색 하나당 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'방문객들은 그 디자인에 경탄하면서도, 그것을 만드는 데 영감을 준 다른 세계는 전혀 알아차리지 못한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487105&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'401999e5-6d38-45d6-bb26-1587ca4a815e\', \'multiverseId\': 487105}, \'multiverseid\': 487105}, {\'name\': \'Planetário Cromático\', \'text\': \'Você pode gastar mana como se fosse de qualquer cor.\\n{T}: Adicione {C}{C}{C}{C}{C}.\\n{5}, {T}: Compre um card para cada cor entre as das permanentes que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário\', \'flavor\': \'Os visitantes ficam maravilhados com o projeto, sem saber do outro mundo que o inspirou.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88c49c2a-5f4e-4b8a-b34e-6bdc3128b2d4\', \'multiverseId\': 487364}, \'multiverseid\': 487364}, {\'name\': \'Хроматический Планетарий\', \'text\': \'Вы можете тратить ману, как будто это мана любого цвета.\\n{T}: добавьте {C}{C}{C}{C}{C}.\\n{5}, {T}: возьмите одну карту за каждый цвет среди перманентов под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Посетители дивятся хитроумному устройству, не зная об ином мире, послужившем вдохновением для создателя.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68489669-3250-45f1-ab74-6ec36978a5cc\', \'multiverseId\': 487623}, \'multiverseid\': 487623}, {\'name\': \'五彩星象仪\', \'text\': \'你可以将法术力视同任意颜色的法术力来支付费用。\\n{T}：加{C}{C}{C}{C}{C}。\\n{5}，{T}：由你操控的永久物中每包括一种颜色，便抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': \'访客惊异于其精妙设计，浑然不知其创作灵感乃是源自另一世界。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487882&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e86836a1-e3f6-4198-ab66-54c869235a16\', \'multiverseId\': 487882}, \'multiverseid\': 487882}, {\'name\': \'五彩星象儀\', \'text\': \'你可以將魔法力視同任意顏色的魔法力來支付費用。\\n{T}：加{C}{C}{C}{C}{C}。\\n{5}，{T}：由你操控的永久物中每包括一種顏色，便抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'傳奇神器\', \'flavor\': \'訪客驚異於其精妙設計，渾然不知其創作靈感乃是源自另一世界。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488141&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23b7b7c3-1de3-454b-a52f-c65df699c113\', \'multiverseId\': 488141}, \'multiverseid\': 488141}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chromreplikator\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Chromreplikator ins Spiel kommt und falls du zwei oder mehr bleibende Karten kontrollierst, die weder Länder noch Spielsteine sind und die denselben Namen haben, erzeuge einen 4/4 farblosen Konstrukt-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': \'Wem würdest du mehr vertrauen, dir den Rücken freizuhalten, als dir selbst?\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485811&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77bfdedb-1aa1-4775-9c9c-7e6a90759f81\', \'multiverseId\': 485811}, \'multiverseid\': 485811}, {\'name\': \'Duplicador de cromo\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Duplicador de cromo entre al campo de batalla, si controlas dos o más permanentes que no sean tierra ni ficha con el mismo nombre, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Constructo incolora 4/4.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'¿En quién confiarías más que en ti mismo para cubrirte las espaldas?\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04c4fb7d-9ca7-4f92-b8a9-ccb18002212f\', \'multiverseId\': 486070}, \'multiverseid\': 486070}, {\'name\': \'Réplicateur de chrome\', \'text\': \'Quand le Réplicateur de chrome arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous contrôlez au moins deux permanents non-jeton non-terrain ayant le même nom, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 4/4 incolore Construction.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': "À qui d\'autre que vous-même feriez-vous confiance pour vous protéger ?", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486329&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0174b18-e89b-4201-b34e-af73eab50eeb\', \'multiverseId\': 486329}, \'multiverseid\': 486329}, {\'name\': \'Replicante di Cromo\', \'text\': \'Quando il Replicante di Cromo entra nel campo di battaglia, se controlli due o più permanenti non terra, non pedina con lo stesso nome, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Costrutto 4/4 incolore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': \'A chi affideresti il compito di guardarti le spalle più che a te stesso?\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28eeacb1-d890-43e6-98b0-a41876b0e540\', \'multiverseId\': 486588}, \'multiverseid\': 486588}, {\'name\': \'金属複製機\', \'text\': \'金属複製機が戦場に出たとき、あなたが、互いに同じ名前を持ち土地でもトークンでもないパーマネントを２つ以上コントロールしている合、無色の４/４の構築物・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': \'自分の背中を預けるのに、自分以上に信頼できる者がいるだろうか？\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486847&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'932a7ebd-d739-4c69-beb1-6e961e61d5b7\', \'multiverseId\': 486847}, \'multiverseid\': 486847}, {\'name\': \'크롬 복제기\', \'text\': \'크롬 복제기가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 서로 이름이 같고 대지가 아니며 토큰이 아닌 지속물을 두 개 이상 조종한다면, 4/4 무색 자동기계 마법물체 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 자동기계\', \'flavor\': \'등 뒤를 맡기는 데에 자신보다 더 믿음직스러운 존재가 어디에 있겠는가?\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12f86498-d2a7-4914-8528-586ccf7ab509\', \'multiverseId\': 487106}, \'multiverseid\': 487106}, {\'name\': \'Replicador de Cromo\', \'text\': \'Quando Replicador de Cromo entrar no campo de batalha, se você controlar duas ou mais permanentes de nome idêntico que não sejam terrenos nem fichas, crie uma ficha de criatura artefato incolor 4/4 do tipo Constructo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'Em quem você confiaria mais para lhe dar cobertura do que em si mesmo?\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487365&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'428f0d46-465b-4230-a0e0-538f0bc3eb70\', \'multiverseId\': 487365}, \'multiverseid\': 487365}, {\'name\': \'Хромовый Репликатор\', \'text\': \'Когда Хромовый Репликатор выходит на поле битвы, если под вашим контролем есть два или больше не являющихся землями или фишками перманента с одинаковым именем, создайте одну фишку артефакта существа 4/4 бесцветная Конструкция.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Конструкция\', \'flavor\': \'Кому ты доверишь прикрывать спину с большей готовностью, чем самому себе?\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9341c8b7-20b6-4673-a887-51f95f79677e\', \'multiverseId\': 487624}, \'multiverseid\': 487624}, {\'name\': \'铬亮摹形械\', \'text\': \'当铬亮摹形械进战场时，若在所有由你操控且既非地也非衍生物的永久物中，具相同名称者有两个或更多，则派出一个4/4无色组构体衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～组构体\', \'flavor\': \'还有什么比让自己来警戒身后更让人放心的？\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487883&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f074b01f-2f9a-4e89-aeb7-7c388e171e1f\', \'multiverseId\': 487883}, \'multiverseid\': 487883}, {\'name\': \'鉻亮摹形械\', \'text\': \'當鉻亮摹形械進戰場時，若在所有由你操控且既非地也非衍生物的永久物中，具相同名稱者有兩個或更多，則派出一個4/4無色組構體衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～組構體\', \'flavor\': \'還有什麼比讓自己來警戒身後更讓人放心的？\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92dc7eb7-27b1-4246-a33b-3aa6e73bc4d4\', \'multiverseId\': 488142}, \'multiverseid\': 488142}]', '[{\'name\': \'Concordia-Pegasus\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Pegasus\', \'flavor\': \'Das Aufblitzen der weißen Schwingen im wolkenverhangenen Herbsthimmel erinnert daran, dass bessere Zeiten bevorstehen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485594&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'951dfbcc-ebf9-4ce8-9063-345207d9e312\', \'multiverseId\': 485594}, \'multiverseid\': 485594}, {\'name\': \'Pegaso de Concordia\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pegaso\', \'flavor\': \'Entre las nubes del cielo y la tenue luz de otoño, un destello de alas blancas recuerda que aguardan mejores tiempos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a84c1db9-6c30-4cc4-8103-0a8ea69167a7\', \'multiverseId\': 485853}, \'multiverseid\': 485853}, {\'name\': \'Pégase de Concordia\', \'text\': \'Vol\', \'type\': \'Créature : pégase\', \'flavor\': "Dans les cieux nuageux et la faible lueur automnale, un éclair d\'ailes blanches vous rappelle que les beaux jours reviendront.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486112&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03f96d6a-4d96-426e-899c-6d6ff24bd816\', \'multiverseId\': 486112}, \'multiverseid\': 486112}, {\'name\': \'Pegaso di Concordia\', \'text\': \'Volare\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Pegaso\', \'flavor\': "Nei cieli foschi e nella pallida luce dell\'autunno, un lampo di candide ali preannuncia l\'arrivo di tempi migliori.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0fc00d9-6a59-4f84-bbf5-75b530265351\', \'multiverseId\': 486371}, \'multiverseid\': 486371}, {\'name\': \'協約のペガサス\', \'text\': \'飛行\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ペガサス\', \'flavor\': \'薄暗い秋の曇り空に垣間見える白い翼は、良い時期の訪れを思い起こさせてくれる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6be97ea4-af2f-49bf-b730-17c29d5b59a8\', \'multiverseId\': 486630}, \'multiverseid\': 486630}, {\'name\': \'콘코르디아 페가수스\', \'text\': \'비행\', \'type\': \'생물 — 페가수스\', \'flavor\': \'흐린 하늘과 어두운 가을빛 속에서, 번뜩이는 밝은 날개는 밝은 앞날을 기대하게 하는 상징이 된다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486889&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'056043a8-e253-44bc-ab91-ca911fc58686\', \'multiverseId\': 486889}, \'multiverseid\': 486889}, {\'name\': \'Pégaso de Concórdia\', \'text\': \'Voar\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pégaso\', \'flavor\': \'Nos céus nublados, na pálida luz do outono, um lampejo de asas brancas é um lembrete de que dias melhores virão.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487148&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd994a47-7791-45a2-923f-f09e492ec10e\', \'multiverseId\': 487148}, \'multiverseid\': 487148}, {\'name\': \'Пегас из Конкордии\', \'text\': \'Полет\', \'type\': \'Существо — Пегас\', \'flavor\': \'В затянутых облаками небесах и тусклом свете осени промелькнувшие белые крылья напоминают о том, что впереди лучшие времена.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487407&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22b66b85-a0ea-46df-b915-d77081d4d338\', \'multiverseId\': 487407}, \'multiverseid\': 487407}, {\'name\': \'齐心飞马\', \'text\': \'飞行\', \'type\': \'生物 ～飞马\', \'flavor\': \'秋暮时分的压顶乌云让人透不过气，然长空尽头划过的白色羽翼，提醒众人仍有美好未来可期。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487666&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6595d47-0274-4d0f-915f-e093da4f4abd\', \'multiverseId\': 487666}, \'multiverseid\': 487666}, {\'name\': \'齊心飛馬\', \'text\': \'飛行\', \'type\': \'生物 ～飛馬\', \'flavor\': \'秋暮時分的壓頂烏雲讓人透不過氣，然長空盡頭劃過的白色羽翼，提醒眾人仍有美好未來可期。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487925&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98538627-0a0e-4eea-9482-a2f081246dad\', \'multiverseId\': 487925}, \'multiverseid\': 487925}]', '[{\'name\': \'Den Tatort absichern\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist, ins Exil. Ihr Beherrscher erzeugt einen 1/1 weißen Soldat-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Es ist immer ein großes Spektakel, wenn die Azorius sogar die Requisiten konfiszieren!"\\n—Judith, geißelnde Diva\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485617&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2c1a0a4-3400-4333-8feb-81c8e53c10e2\', \'multiverseId\': 485617}, \'multiverseid\': 485617}, {\'name\': \'Salvaguardar el lugar\', \'text\': \'Exilia el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra. Su controlador crea una ficha de criatura Soldado blanca 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Qué gran función! ¡Los azorios hasta arrestan el decorado!".\\n—Judith, diva de la flagelación\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485876&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39d12d67-80aa-47f7-8dd4-df002a1330a1\', \'multiverseId\': 485876}, \'multiverseid\': 485876}, {\'name\': \'Sécuriser les lieux\', \'text\': \'Exilez le permanent non-terrain ciblé. Son contrôleur crée un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Soldat.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Tu sais que le spectacle est réussi quand les Azorius se mettent à arrêter aussi les accessoires ! »\\n—Judith, diva du fléau\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486135&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20205b90-9842-44a4-8109-d71c44f004f0\', \'multiverseId\': 486135}, \'multiverseid\': 486135}, {\'name\': \'Proteggere la Zona\', \'text\': \'Esilia un permanente non terra bersaglio. Il suo controllore crea una pedina creatura Soldato 1/1 bianca.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Sai che è un grande spettacolo quando gli Azorius arrestano perfino gli oggetti di scena!"\\n—Judith, la Diva del Flagello\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486394&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d3b438e-7095-4086-b4ea-fe46e9e705ff\', \'multiverseId\': 486394}, \'multiverseid\': 486394}, {\'name\': \'現場保存\', \'text\': \'土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とし、それを追放する。それのコントローラーは、白の１/１の兵士・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「アゾリウスが小道具を差し押さえに来たときだって、いつも楽しいショーになるでしょ！」\\n――災いの歌姫、ジュディス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486653&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ed5f898-b9c9-4de7-bed6-a8d1344a0f98\', \'multiverseId\': 486653}, \'multiverseid\': 486653}, {\'name\': \'현장 확보\', \'text\': \'대지가 아닌 지속물을 목표로 정한다. 그 지속물을 추방한다. 그 지속물의 조종자는 1/1 백색 병사 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"아조리우스가 소품들도 체포한다는 것은 그게 바로 멋진 공연이란 뜻이지!"\\n—재앙의 여주인공, 주디스\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486912&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68724e3e-7d3f-44cf-b6ef-234da5192b6b\', \'multiverseId\': 486912}, \'multiverseid\': 486912}, {\'name\': \'Proteger a Cena\', \'text\': \'Exile a permanente alvo que não seja um terreno. Seu controlador cria uma ficha de criatura branca 1/1 do tipo Soldado.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Você sabe que o show foi bom quando os Azorius chegam apreendendo até os objetos de cena!"\\n— Judith, Diva do Flagelo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487171&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c51c11c1-9c62-49b6-9dde-ac93bcea2f1c\', \'multiverseId\': 487171}, \'multiverseid\': 487171}, {\'name\': \'Выставить Охрану\', \'text\': \'Изгоните целевой не являющийся землей перманент. Контролирующий его игрок создает одну фишку существа 1/1 белый Солдат.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Если Азориусы и реквизит арестовывают, то представление точно удалось на славу!»\\n— Джудит, Бичующая Дива\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487430&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99b383d8-e0f7-4dde-a06e-f902d36f84c3\', \'multiverseId\': 487430}, \'multiverseid\': 487430}, {\'name\': \'保护现场\', \'text\': \'放逐目标非地永久物。其操控者派出一个1/1白色士兵衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「当俄佐立人连道具都一起逮捕的时候，你就知道这一定是场好戏！」\\n～灾祸歌伶裘蒂丝\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487689&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'537f9aae-e0b5-4271-894b-b3dc63d0855d\', \'multiverseId\': 487689}, \'multiverseid\': 487689}, {\'name\': \'保護現場\', \'text\': \'放逐目標非地永久物。其操控者派出一個1/1白色士兵衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「當俄佐立人連道具都一起逮捕的時候，你就知道這一定是場好戲！」\\n～災禍歌伶裘蒂絲\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487948&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26b5509e-118a-4775-964e-de4f0f875a04\', \'multiverseId\': 487948}, \'multiverseid\': 487948}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Gezeiten lesen\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Ziehe drei Karten.\\n• Bringe bis zu zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl auf die Hand ihrer Besitzer zurück.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Karten und Instrumente funktionieren gut, doch selbst die besten Navigatoren sind sich nicht zu fein für ein, zwei Zaubersprüche, die die Gezeiten in eine günstigere Richtung lenken.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485644&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ac150c4-2a4c-4162-8264-159292acabf3\', \'multiverseId\': 485644}, \'multiverseid\': 485644}, {\'name\': \'Conocer las mareas\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Roba tres cartas.\\n• Regresa hasta dos criaturas objetivo a las manos de sus propietarios.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los mapas y los instrumentos funcionan bien, pero los mejores navegantes solo necesitan uno o dos hechizos para impulsar las mareas en una dirección más favorable.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485903&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43a9fcca-1a64-43d6-a9d7-92747b1a453a\', \'multiverseId\': 485903}, \'multiverseid\': 485903}, {\'name\': \'Déchiffrage des marées\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Piochez trois cartes.\\n• Renvoyez jusqu\'à deux créatures ciblées dans les mains de leurs propriétaires.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Les plans et les instruments sont pratiques, mais les meilleurs navigateurs ne sont jamais contre un sort ou deux qui pourraient leur donner des marées plus favorables.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486162&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35501c7c-aa8b-4b13-afbd-452005d60388\', \'multiverseId\': 486162}, \'multiverseid\': 486162}, {\'name\': \'Leggere le Maree\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Pesca tre carte.\\n• Fai tornare fino a due creature bersaglio in mano ai rispettivi proprietari.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Mappe e strumenti sono utili, ma i migliori navigatori non disdegnano di lanciare una magia o due per spingere le maree in una direzione più favorevole.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486421&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5036b46-a5bd-477b-8496-d27fa445ba75\', \'multiverseId\': 486421}, \'multiverseid\': 486421}, {\'name\': \'潮読み\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• カードを３枚引く。\\n• クリーチャー最大２体を対象とし、それらをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'海図や計器も役には立つが、最高の航海士ですらも、潮の流れを変えてしまう呪文には敵わない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486680&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35858cdc-ca2d-4864-8c88-6a6f5e065aaf\', \'multiverseId\': 486680}, \'multiverseid\': 486680}, {\'name\': \'파도 읽기\', \'text\': \'하나를 선택한다 —\\n• 카드 세 장을 뽑는다.\\n• 생물을 최대 두 개까지 목표로 정한다. 그 생물들을 소유자의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'도표와 계측기들도 좋긴 하지만, 최고의 항해사라고 해도 파도를 좀 더 좋은 방향으로 밀어주는 주문 한두 번과 그다지 차이가 나지 않는다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486939&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'607c5da0-bc4d-4720-b688-114fa6a44887\', \'multiverseId\': 486939}, \'multiverseid\': 486939}, {\'name\': \'Ler as Marés\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Compre três cards.\\n• Devolva até duas criaturas alvo para as mãos de seus donos.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'As cartas náuticas e os instrumentos funcionam bem, mas os melhores navegadores não abrem mão de um pouco de magia para dar um empurrãozinho favorável nas marés.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487198&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00f5e211-44d2-470e-b0dc-2d9d4f16ab4f\', \'multiverseId\': 487198}, \'multiverseid\': 487198}, {\'name\': \'Гадание по Приливам\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно —\\n• Возьмите три карты.\\n• Верните не более двух целевых существ в руки их владельцев.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Карты и инструменты — это хорошо, но лучшие навигаторы не гнушаются и заклинанием-другим, чтобы подправить направление течений.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487457&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4138269-8293-4d46-8f6e-5bb5b8f0a841\', \'multiverseId\': 487457}, \'multiverseid\': 487457}, {\'name\': \'研判浪潮\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•抓三张牌。\\n•将至多两个目标生物移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'海图和器具固然有用，但最好的领航员只消一两个咒语就能让浪潮朝着自己想要的方向流动。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487716&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bcc5992-812f-4bd0-b6c7-4448d5ef0d02\', \'multiverseId\': 487716}, \'multiverseid\': 487716}, {\'name\': \'研判浪潮\', \'text\': \'選擇一項～\\n•抽三張牌。\\n•將至多兩個目標生物移回其擁有者手上。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'海圖和器具固然有用，但最好的領航員只消一兩個咒語就能讓浪潮朝著自己想要的方向流動。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487975&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94201509-fb21-4e84-b18d-c9e8be7b3ef8\', \'multiverseId\': 487975}, \'multiverseid\': 487975}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Wahrheit erkennen\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Nimm eine der Karten auf deine Hand und lege den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek. Falls dieser Zauberspruch von irgendwoher außer von deiner Hand gewirkt wurde, nimm stattdessen alle jener Karten auf deine Hand.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Was ist das, das weder Zukunft noch Vergangenheit ist?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485651&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49b30e70-3fab-4da0-a1c2-7f5a97219440\', \'multiverseId\': 485651}, \'multiverseid\': 485651}, {\'name\': \'Ver la verdad\', \'text\': \'Mira las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Pon una de esas cartas en tu mano y el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden. Si este hechizo se lanzó desde cualquier parte excepto desde tu mano, en vez de eso, pon cada una de esas cartas en tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Qué es esto que no es ni futuro ni pasado?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485910&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e562317-9e4d-4bba-9388-08ec0b136d50\', \'multiverseId\': 485910}, \'multiverseid\': 485910}, {\'name\': \'Voir la Vérité\', \'text\': "Regardez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez l\'une de ces cartes dans votre main et le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, dans l\'ordre de votre choix. Si ce sort a été lancé depuis autre part que votre main, mettez chacune de ces cartes dans votre main à la place.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Qu\'est-ce qui n\'est ni passé ni futur ? »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486169&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d1ee71c-657b-41d1-9a4a-befeb4b70b34\', \'multiverseId\': 486169}, \'multiverseid\': 486169}, {\'name\': \'Vedere la Verità\', \'text\': \'Guarda le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio. Aggiungi alla tua mano una di quelle carte e metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine. Se questa magia è stata lanciata da una zona diversa dalla tua mano, aggiungi invece ognuna di quelle carte alla tua mano.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Come? Uno stato che non è futuro né passato?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486428&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'408b1075-00ab-4ed4-b898-8e89a914e1b0\', \'multiverseId\': 486428}, \'multiverseid\': 486428}, {\'name\': \'真実の視認\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを３枚見る。そのうち１枚をあなたの手札に、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。この呪文があなたの手札以外の領域から唱えられていたなら、代わりに、それらのカードをすべてあなたの手札に加える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「過去にあらず、未来にあらず。これは何ぞ？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0b12f5d-fa24-43f5-9df4-93eb16950529\', \'multiverseId\': 486687}, \'multiverseid\': 486687}, {\'name\': \'진실을 보다\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 세 장을 본다. 그중 한 장을 당신의 손으로 가져가고 나머지 카드들은 당신이 원하는 순서로 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓는다. 이 주문이 당신의 손이 아닌 다른 곳에서 발동되었다면, 대신 그 카드들 모두를 당신의 손에 넣는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"미래도 아니고 과거도 아닌 이것은 과연 무엇인가?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486946&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'457ce578-7552-4fe2-ad86-e2460b6b710b\', \'multiverseId\': 486946}, \'multiverseid\': 486946}, {\'name\': \'Ver a Verdade\', \'text\': \'Olhe os três cards do topo de seu grimório. Coloque um daqueles cards na sua mão e os restantes no fundo do seu grimório em qualquer ordem. Se esta mágica foi conjurada de qualquer zona diferente da sua mão, em vez disso, coloque cada um daqueles cards em sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"O que é isso, que não é futuro nem passado?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73b24dfc-7f26-495f-834c-d2132ec032e0\', \'multiverseId\': 487205}, \'multiverseid\': 487205}, {\'name\': \'Узреть Истину\', \'text\': \'Посмотрите три верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Положите одну из тех карт в вашу руку, а остальные — в низ вашей библиотеки в любом порядке. Если это заклинание было разыграно откуда угодно, кроме вашей руки, то вместо этого положите каждую из тех карт в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Что это такое — не прошлое и не будущее?»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487464&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f885e1ad-e46e-44ef-b4ee-c804a734f2fd\', \'multiverseId\': 487464}, \'multiverseid\': 487464}, {\'name\': \'看清真相\', \'text\': \'检视你牌库顶的三张牌。将其中一张置于你手上，其余的牌则以任意顺序置于你的牌库底。如果你是从你手牌以外的任何区域施放此咒语，则改为将这些牌都置于你手上。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「有个东西，既不是未来，也不是过去，那是什么？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487723&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5109e1fa-af58-4985-92b6-25cfaca7c2d7\', \'multiverseId\': 487723}, \'multiverseid\': 487723}, {\'name\': \'看清真相\', \'text\': \'檢視你牌庫頂的三張牌。將其中一張置於你手上，其餘的牌則以任意順序置於你的牌庫底。如果你是從你手牌以外的任何區域施放此咒語，則改為將這些牌都置於你手上。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「有個東西，既不是未來，也不是過去，那是什麼？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487982&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a363d2e-839c-4938-be14-4264959aebd9\', \'multiverseId\': 487982}, \'multiverseid\': 487982}]', '[{\'name\': \'Discontinuité\', \'text\': "Tant que c\'est votre tour, ce sort coûte {2}{U}{U} de moins à lancer.\\nTerminez le tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488300&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02be62e3-b8c0-403e-a1f1-0152935ab04c\', \'multiverseId\': 488300}, \'multiverseid\': 488300}, {\'name\': \'不連続性\', \'text\': \'あなたのターンであるかぎり、この呪文を唱えるためのコストは{2}{U}{U}少なくなる。\\nターンを終了する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488352&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d117d33f-b6ff-4faf-8ad4-bea5b48a35a4\', \'multiverseId\': 488352}, \'multiverseid\': 488352}]', '[{\'name\': \'Diskontinuität\', \'text\': \'Solange es dein Zug ist, kostet dieser Zauberspruch beim Wirken {2}{U}{U} weniger.\\nBeende den Zug. (Schicke alle Zaubersprüche und Fähigkeiten vom Stapel ins Exil, einschließlich dieser Karte. Der Spieler, dessen Zug es ist, wirft so viele Karten ab, bis er seine maximale Handkartenzahl erreicht hat. Schaden heilt und „In-diesem-Zug"- und „Bis-zum-Ende-des-Zuges"-Effekte enden.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485630&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a67a811d-f22c-46b9-bee3-0059e44c78cb\', \'multiverseId\': 485630}, \'multiverseid\': 485630}, {\'name\': \'Discontinuidad\', \'text\': \'Mientras sea tu turno, te cuesta {2}{U}{U} menos lanzar este hechizo.\\nFinaliza el turno. (Exilia todos los hechizos y habilidades de la pila, incluida esta carta. El jugador al que corresponde el turno descarta hasta su tamaño máximo de mano. El daño desaparece y terminan los efectos "hasta el final del turno" y "este turno".)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485889&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ecb023f-bcbb-4f98-8de1-844cd9473635\', \'multiverseId\': 485889}, \'multiverseid\': 485889}, {\'name\': \'Discontinuité\', \'text\': "Tant que c\'est votre tour, ce sort coûte {2}{U}{U} de moins à lancer.\\nTerminez le tour. (Exilez tous les sorts et toutes les capacités de la pile, y compris cette carte. Le joueur dont c\'est le tour se défausse de ses cartes jusqu\'à sa taille de main maximum. Les blessures disparaissent et les effets « ce tour-ci » et « jusqu\'à la fin du tour » se terminent.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486148&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'582f6c66-a693-43ab-8736-b013ed1d69fa\', \'multiverseId\': 486148}, \'multiverseid\': 486148}, {\'name\': \'Discontinuità\', \'text\': \'Fintanto che è il tuo turno, questa magia costa {2}{U}{U} in meno per essere lanciata.\\nFine del turno. (Esilia tutte le magie e le abilità dalla pila, compresa questa carta. Il giocatore di turno scarta carte fino ad avere in mano il suo limite massimo di carte. Il danno viene rimosso e terminano gli effetti "in questo turno" e "fino alla fine del turno".)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486407&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d38ad57c-a230-48c4-ae97-ced3a1cd6b7a\', \'multiverseId\': 486407}, \'multiverseid\': 486407}, {\'name\': \'不連続性\', \'text\': \'あなたのターンであるかぎり、この呪文を唱えるためのコストは{2}{U}{U}少なくなる。\\nターンを終了する。（このカードを含め、スタックから呪文や能力をすべて追放する。現在のターンを進行しているプレイヤーは、自分の手札の上限までカードを捨てる。ダメージは消え、「このターン」と「ターン終了時まで」の効果は終わる。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486666&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3f1a644-8fe2-480c-ada9-ac65660dec5f\', \'multiverseId\': 486666}, \'multiverseid\': 486666}, {\'name\': \'중단\', \'text\': \'당신의 턴인 한, 이 주문은 발동하는 데 {2}{U}{U}가 덜 든다.\\n턴을 종료한다. (이 카드를 포함하여, 스택에서 모든 주문과 능력을 추방한다. 턴을 진행하는 플레이어는 자신의 손 크기 제한을 넘는 카드를 버린다. 피해는 사라지고, "이번 턴에" 및 "턴종료까지" 효과가 종료된다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486925&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1104653a-638b-4d98-84cb-2f9af22fd38a\', \'multiverseId\': 486925}, \'multiverseid\': 486925}, {\'name\': \'Descontinuidade\', \'text\': \'Enquanto for o seu turno, esta mágica custa {2}{U}{U} a menos para ser conjurada.\\nTermine o turno. (Exile todas as mágicas e habilidades da pilha, inclusive este card. O jogador controlador do turno descarta até chegar ao número máximo de cards na mão. O dano termina e efeitos que ocorrem "neste turno" e "até o final do turno" cessam.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487184&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4529f24f-8005-4519-934c-2e8f8c9e3e70\', \'multiverseId\': 487184}, \'multiverseid\': 487184}, {\'name\': \'Прерывность\', \'text\': \'Пока длится ваш ход, разыгрывание этого заклинания стоит на {2}{U}{U} меньше.\\nЗавершите ход. (Изгоните все заклинания и способности из стека, в том числе и эту карту. Игрок, чей ход идет в данный момент, сбрасывает карты до максимального размера своей руки. Повреждения обнуляются, а действие всех эффектов, существующих «в этом ходу» и «до конца хода», прекращается.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487443&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9443d239-4a4c-4db5-8d4e-3e8e32907dc9\', \'multiverseId\': 487443}, \'multiverseid\': 487443}, {\'name\': \'突然中断\', \'text\': \'只要是在你的回合中，此咒语便减少{2}{U}{U}来施放。\\n结束本回合。（放逐堆叠上的所有咒语和异能，包括此牌。轮到此回合的牌手将手牌弃至其手牌上限。生物上的伤害消失，并且注记着「本回合」与「直到回合结束」的效应均结束。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487702&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f50c6b2-d4d4-49a7-a63b-26ae06752754\', \'multiverseId\': 487702}, \'multiverseid\': 487702}, {\'name\': \'突然中斷\', \'text\': \'只要是在你的回合中，此咒語便減少{2}{U}{U}來施放。\\n結束本回合。（放逐堆疊上的所有咒語和異能，包括此牌。輪到此回合的玩家將手牌棄至其手牌上限。生物上的傷害消失，並且註記著「本回合」與「直到回合結束」的效應均結束。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487961&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f80bc9e-ea36-4e7a-8b56-9282481385e2\', \'multiverseId\': 487961}, \'multiverseid\': 487961}]', '[{\'name\': \'Doppelklingenmeuchler\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Endsegments und falls in diesem Zug eine Kreatur gestorben ist, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Assassine\', \'flavor\': \'Es kursieren Gerüchte über zwei tödliche Golgari-Attentäter, die nur als die linke und rechte Hand des Ochran bekannt sind.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485808&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41d2f74f-cd2c-492a-9aa1-0ac1b819da95\', \'multiverseId\': 485808}, \'multiverseid\': 485808}, {\'name\': \'Asesinos hojas gemelas\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu paso final, si una criatura murió este turno, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Asesino elfo\', \'flavor\': \'Giran rumores en torno a una pareja de asesinos golgari conocidos como las Manos Izquierda y Derecha de los Ochran.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486067&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a0535cf-d691-4b5b-8e3e-58e6f0a6cdd1\', \'multiverseId\': 486067}, \'multiverseid\': 486067}, {\'name\': \'Assassins jumelames\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre étape de fin, si une créature est morte ce tour-ci, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et assassin\', \'flavor\': "Les rumeurs parlent de deux assassins golgari sanguinaires connus comme étant la main gauche et la main droite de l\'Ochran.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486326&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9edfbbee-a9a6-4a8f-af14-cef5cbf00385\', \'multiverseId\': 486326}, \'multiverseid\': 486326}, {\'name\': \'Assassini delle Lame Gemelle\', \'text\': "All\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, se è morta una creatura in questo turno, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Assassino Elfo\', \'flavor\': "Girano voci di una coppia di letali assassini Golgari noti solo come la Mano Destra e la Mano Sinistra dell\'Ochran.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486585&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c529587-7a3f-41a7-80f9-12b994dcae03\', \'multiverseId\': 486585}, \'multiverseid\': 486585}, {\'name\': \'双刃の暗殺者\', \'text\': \'あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、このターンにクリーチャーが死亡していた場合、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・暗殺者\', \'flavor\': \'ゴルガリの危険な二人組暗殺者の噂が錯綜している。知られているのは、オクランの右手と左手という名前だけだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486844&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40d500a4-82ef-4910-8cc9-59fe0446fe63\', \'multiverseId\': 486844}, \'multiverseid\': 486844}, {\'name\': \'쌍날의 암살자\', \'text\': \'당신의 종료단 시작에, 이번 턴에 생물이 죽었다면, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘프 암살자\', \'flavor\': \'오크란의 왼손과 오른손으로만 알려진 한 쌍의 치명적인 골가리 암살자들에 대한 소문이 돌고 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487103&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de7a929e-b9af-4b2e-a0b1-6e9d0225e4f4\', \'multiverseId\': 487103}, \'multiverseid\': 487103}, {\'name\': \'Assassinos das Lâminas Gêmeas\', \'text\': \'No início de sua etapa final, se uma criatura morreu neste turno, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Assassino\', \'flavor\': \'Correm rumores sobre uma dupla de assassinos Golgari conhecidos como As Mãos Esquerda e Direita do Ochran.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487362&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d40da9c8-a5da-4683-8687-2002012a93bb\', \'multiverseId\': 487362}, \'multiverseid\': 487362}, {\'name\': \'Убийцы Клинков-Близнецов\', \'text\': \'В начале вашего заключительного шага, если в этом ходу умерло существо, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Убийца\', \'flavor\': \'Ходили слухи о паре смертоносных убийц Голгари, известных лишь как Левая и Правая Рука окранов.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487621&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c0e97ba-5f2e-4816-ad37-f2037d373e74\', \'multiverseId\': 487621}, \'multiverseid\': 487621}, {\'name\': \'合剑杀手\', \'text\': \'在你的结束步骤开始时，若本回合中有生物死去，则抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／杀手\', \'flavor\': \'坊间流言谣传，葛加理新出现一对技艺高超的神秘刺客，人称「瓯坎的左臂右膀」。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487880&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cb1dc13-c2f3-4724-8588-95d2bc57c389\', \'multiverseId\': 487880}, \'multiverseid\': 487880}, {\'name\': \'合劍殺手\', \'text\': \'在你的結束步驟開始時，若本回合中有生物死去，則抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／殺手\', \'flavor\': \'坊間流言謠傳，葛加理新出現一對技藝高超的神秘刺客，人稱「甌坎的左臂右膀」。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488139&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'458075c4-1307-442b-800c-386eb3a33df9\', \'multiverseId\': 488139}, \'multiverseid\': 488139}]', '[{\'name\': \'Doppelte Vision\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du zum ersten Mal in einem Zug einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst, kopiere jenen Zauberspruch. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Deine Augen spielen dir keine Streiche. Ich schon."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485724&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67c8fed5-1c64-4e53-80fe-96605455fc4e\', \'multiverseId\': 485724}, \'multiverseid\': 485724}, {\'name\': \'Visión doble\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances tu primer hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro cada turno, copia ese hechizo. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para la copia.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Tus ojos no te engañan. Yo sí".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485983&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78e4eb7b-d842-4406-a03f-952ea8e941d6\', \'multiverseId\': 485983}, \'multiverseid\': 485983}, {\'name\': \'Double vision\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez votre premier sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel à chaque tour, copiez ce sort. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour cette copie.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Vos yeux ne vous jouent pas des tours. Mais moi, oui. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486242&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4b7ca0f-f98c-457d-802d-64081e4e2690\', \'multiverseId\': 486242}, \'multiverseid\': 486242}, {\'name\': \'Doppia Visione\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci la tua prima magia istantaneo o stregoneria in ogni turno, copia quella magia. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per la copia.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"I tuoi occhi non ti stanno ingannando. Io sì."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486501&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c057c514-2b75-4d8d-b6c8-aa876f9e50ca\', \'multiverseId\': 486501}, \'multiverseid\': 486501}, {\'name\': \'複視\', \'text\': \'あなたが各ターン内で初めて、インスタントかソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、その呪文をコピーする。あなたはそのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「お前の目がおかしくなったわけじゃない。俺がやっているのさ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486760&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78a715de-af9d-4b4c-8fb5-f936b7d366c7\', \'multiverseId\': 486760}, \'multiverseid\': 486760}, {\'name\': \'이중 예지\', \'text\': \'당신이 매 턴 당신의 첫 순간마법 또는 집중마법 주문을 발동할 때마다, 그 주문을 복사한다. 당신은 그 복사본의 목표를 새로 정할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'"네게 장난을 치고 있는 건 네 두 눈이 아니야. 바로 나지."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487019&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ac7d1e3-aee3-46d4-9b54-18e5b00f3d77\', \'multiverseId\': 487019}, \'multiverseid\': 487019}, {\'name\': \'Visão Dupla\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjurar sua primeira mágica instantânea ou feitiço a cada turno, copie aquela mágica. Você pode escolher novos alvos para a cópia.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Não são os seus olhos pregando peças. Sou eu."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487278&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24a8d280-cb64-452d-afa3-4a9df206064a\', \'multiverseId\': 487278}, \'multiverseid\': 487278}, {\'name\': \'Двойное Видение\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете ваше первое мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства в каждом ходу, скопируйте то заклинание. Вы можете выбрать новые цели для той копии.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Нет, твои глаза тебя не обманывают. Это делаю я».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'716d2d23-12e3-4396-8ad4-6163ea220637\', \'multiverseId\': 487537}, \'multiverseid\': 487537}, {\'name\': \'双重视像\', \'text\': \'每当你施放每回合中你的第一个瞬间或法术咒语时，复制该咒语。你可以为该复制品选择新的目标。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「欺骗你的不是你的双眼。是我。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487796&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f3a19d0-7f13-4745-8910-32fe1fcc68c5\', \'multiverseId\': 487796}, \'multiverseid\': 487796}, {\'name\': \'雙重視像\', \'text\': \'每當你施放每回合中你的第一個瞬間或巫術咒語時，複製該咒語。你可以為該複製品選擇新的目標。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'「欺騙你的不是你的雙眼。是我。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488055&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53e56eb2-1603-42ba-b6ff-ab3ff3cc2a45\', \'multiverseId\': 488055}, \'multiverseid\': 488055}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dorfrituale\', \'text\': \'Opfere eine Kreatur als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken.\\nZiehe zwei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Du hast so eifrig genommen und verzehrt. Und wenn du selbst etwas geben sollst, weigerst du dich?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485708&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6f0b9af-8b7f-4359-8a68-01c517e6b2f7\', \'multiverseId\': 485708}, \'multiverseid\': 485708}, {\'name\': \'Ritos de pueblo\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, sacrifica una criatura.\\nRoba dos cartas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Estabas impaciente por tomar y consumir. Y, sin embargo, cuando se te pide que des, ¿te niegas?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485967&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52c45535-838f-4d9e-8980-bb9c884301ef\', \'multiverseId\': 485967}, \'multiverseid\': 485967}, {\'name\': \'Rites du village\', \'text\': \'En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, sacrifiez une créature.\\nPiochez deux cartes.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Vous aviez tellement hâte de vous servir et de vous nourrir. Mais quand il s\'agit de donner, vous refusez ? »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486226&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b231be6a-8489-4fc9-9282-5e09f62fdec1\', \'multiverseId\': 486226}, \'multiverseid\': 486226}, {\'name\': \'Riti del Villaggio\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, sacrifica una creatura.\\nPesca due carte.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Sembravi così impaziente di prendere e consumare. Eppure, quando ti viene chiesto di dare, rifiuti?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486485&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'039fefb0-8607-4c1f-b785-74eecd0daa98\', \'multiverseId\': 486485}, \'multiverseid\': 486485}, {\'name\': \'村の儀式\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。\\nカードを２枚引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「汝らは喜んで受け取り消費するではないか。それが、与える段になると拒むのかね？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486744&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a93f168-a5e1-44e6-a85b-a07db2ffd32a\', \'multiverseId\': 486744}, \'multiverseid\': 486744}, {\'name\': \'마을의 의식\', \'text\': \'이 주문을 발동하기 위한 추가비용으로, 생물 한 개를 희생한다.\\n카드 두 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"자네는 취하고 소비하는 데에는 아주 적극적이었지. 그러고서는 이제 달라고 하니, 거절하는 겐가?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a2f49f2-e115-4eb7-9271-de820964d92a\', \'multiverseId\': 487003}, \'multiverseid\': 487003}, {\'name\': \'Ritos da Vila\', \'text\': \'Como custo adicional para conjurar esta mágica, sacrifique uma criatura.\\nCompre dois cards.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Você estava tão disposto a tomar e consumir. Mas quando pedimos que você dê algo, você recusa?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'810c376d-07f0-438b-ac06-9ee0f95c9856\', \'multiverseId\': 487262}, \'multiverseid\': 487262}, {\'name\': \'Деревенские Обряды\', \'text\': \'В качестве дополнительной стоимости разыгрывания этого заклинания пожертвуйте существо.\\nВозьмите две карты.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Ты всегда был готов взять что-то, сожрать. Но когда тебя просят поделиться, ты отказываешься?»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487521&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'009a5c97-e850-40d0-95d0-1fc7698fe8e7\', \'multiverseId\': 487521}, \'multiverseid\': 487521}, {\'name\': \'村民仪式\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个生物，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。\\n抓两张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「要吃要喝的时候如此积极。要你奉献的时候却摆手拒绝？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f28371a-0d61-4370-9aeb-5c97bf0b638c\', \'multiverseId\': 487780}, \'multiverseid\': 487780}, {\'name\': \'村民儀式\', \'text\': \'犧牲一個生物，以作為施放此咒語的額外費用。\\n抽兩張牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「要吃要喝的時候如此積極。要你奉獻的時候卻擺手拒絕？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488039&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d955be87-ca64-4eb5-8973-22a61c6b3eae\', \'multiverseId\': 488039}, \'multiverseid\': 488039}]', "[{'name': 'Dornwaldfälle', 'text': 'Die Dornwaldfälle kommen getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Dornwaldfälle ins Spiel kommen, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {U}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485839&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd932900e-504d-400c-9332-2cffee87f60c', 'multiverseId': 485839}, 'multiverseid': 485839}, {'name': 'Cascadas bosquespinoso', 'text': 'Las Cascadas bosquespinoso entran al campo de batalla giradas.\\nCuando las Cascadas bosquespinoso entren al campo de batalla, ganas 1 vida.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} o {U}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486098&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8036d32f-b13b-4083-a545-6318265055b5', 'multiverseId': 486098}, 'multiverseid': 486098}, {'name': 'Chutes de Boisépine', 'text': 'Les Chutes de Boisépine arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagées.\\nQuand les Chutes de Boisépine arrivent sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {U}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486357&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '752ace1d-3e7e-4f40-ab15-5e96f5f7cd19', 'multiverseId': 486357}, 'multiverseid': 486357}, {'name': 'Cascate di Boscorovo', 'text': 'Le Cascate di Boscorovo entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpate.\\nQuando le Cascate di Boscorovo entrano nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 1 punto vita.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} o {U}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486616&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eb950348-6160-4487-a94c-a446bdb4d82d', 'multiverseId': 486616}, 'multiverseid': 486616}, {'name': '茨森の滝', 'text': '茨森の滝はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n茨森の滝が戦場に出たとき、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n{T}：{G}か{U}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486875&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '688e5e45-cd36-4996-aa0c-c0f0607c1778', 'multiverseId': 486875}, 'multiverseid': 486875}, {'name': '가시숲 폭포', 'text': '가시숲 폭포는 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n가시숲 폭포가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다.\\n{T}: {G} 또는 {U}를 추가한다.', 'type': '대지', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487134&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '95c16181-2e36-4e09-be56-dee00ff4bfd3', 'multiverseId': 487134}, 'multiverseid': 487134}, {'name': 'Cachoeira dos Espinhos', 'text': 'Cachoeira dos Espinhos entra no campo de batalha virada.\\nQuando Cachoeira dos Espinhos entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\\n{T}: Adicione {G} ou {U}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487393&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd92ac09-0119-41d6-96c2-8b4413bbd0d4', 'multiverseId': 487393}, 'multiverseid': 487393}, {'name': 'Водопад Шиполесья', 'text': 'Водопад Шиполесья выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\nКогда Водопад Шиполесья выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете 1 жизнь.\\n{T}: добавьте {G} или {U}.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487652&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd9eb320-5760-4d3d-adf0-38bc0579f92c', 'multiverseId': 487652}, 'multiverseid': 487652}, {'name': '棘林瀑布', 'text': '棘林瀑布须横置进战场。\\n当棘林瀑布进战场时，你获得1点生命。\\n{T}：加{G}或{U}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487911&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '301a5a7c-5ddd-41d4-b6c6-37aaf6e1502a', 'multiverseId': 487911}, 'multiverseid': 487911}, {'name': '棘林瀑布', 'text': '棘林瀑布須橫置進戰場。\\n當棘林瀑布進戰場時，你獲得1點生命。\\n{T}：加{G}或{U}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488170&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e21b0917-8fe8-4375-902c-b09031840ea4', 'multiverseId': 488170}, 'multiverseid': 488170}]", '[{\'name\': \'Double vision\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez votre premier sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel à chaque tour, copiez ce sort. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour cette copie.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488316&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91291be2-2efe-4512-87f9-21296443050e\', \'multiverseId\': 488316}, \'multiverseid\': 488316}, {\'name\': \'複視\', \'text\': \'あなたが各ターン内で初めて、インスタントかソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、その呪文をコピーする。あなたはそのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488368&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2058a34-f0ec-4a98-a0fe-1ef431eff1ad\', \'multiverseId\': 488368}, \'multiverseid\': 488368}]', "[{'name': 'Dschungellichtung', 'text': 'Die Dschungellichtung kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Dschungellichtung ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B} oder {G}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485829&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '06e599d6-bea2-4a0c-93cd-72160925c389', 'multiverseId': 485829}, 'multiverseid': 485829}, {'name': 'Hondonada selvática', 'text': 'La Hondonada selvática entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCuando la Hondonada selvática entre al campo de batalla, ganas 1 vida.\\n{T}: Agrega {B} o {G}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486088&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cb63e56c-fbc7-44e9-a9c9-9584f00f70ea', 'multiverseId': 486088}, 'multiverseid': 486088}, {'name': 'Dépression de jungle', 'text': 'La Dépression de jungle arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Dépression de jungle arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {G}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486347&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a2bc5b07-1a22-4ab6-a792-aee998940484', 'multiverseId': 486347}, 'multiverseid': 486347}, {'name': 'Conca nella Giungla', 'text': 'La Conca nella Giungla entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nQuando la Conca nella Giungla entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 1 punto vita.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B} o {G}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486606&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f7d785b1-a240-4fa7-bf40-42f72f995ae0', 'multiverseId': 486606}, 'multiverseid': 486606}, {'name': 'ジャングルのうろ穴', 'text': 'ジャングルのうろ穴はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nジャングルのうろ穴が戦場に出たとき、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n{T}：{B}か{G}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486865&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '150f6cbf-b997-4790-b37d-6598688b0549', 'multiverseId': 486865}, 'multiverseid': 486865}, {'name': '정글 골짜기', 'text': '정글 골짜기는 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n정글 골짜기가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다.\\n{T}: {B} 또는 {G}를 추가한다.', 'type': '대지', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487124&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3bfcd082-c070-4323-800f-b06751325092', 'multiverseId': 487124}, 'multiverseid': 487124}, {'name': 'Clareira na Selva', 'text': 'Clareira na Selva entra no campo de batalha virada.\\nQuando Clareira na Selva entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\\n{T}: Adicione {B} ou {G}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487383&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dfef039f-a33b-4c2e-a87c-ec74119821d5', 'multiverseId': 487383}, 'multiverseid': 487383}, {'name': 'Лощина в Джунглях', 'text': 'Лощина в Джунглях выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\nКогда Лощина в Джунглях выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете 1 жизнь.\\n{T}: добавьте {B} или {G}.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487642&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9e71317e-e7da-472f-8cfd-12f3d11af4b1', 'multiverseId': 487642}, 'multiverseid': 487642}, {'name': '丛林幽谷', 'text': '丛林幽谷须横置进战场。\\n当丛林幽谷进战场时，你获得1点生命。\\n{T}：加{B}或{G}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487901&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e39833cf-54e1-4419-8807-50290a471703', 'multiverseId': 487901}, 'multiverseid': 487901}, {'name': '叢林幽谷', 'text': '叢林幽谷須橫置進戰場。\\n當叢林幽谷進戰場時，你獲得1點生命。\\n{T}：加{B}或{G}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488160&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0d0715fd-c73e-4522-8880-130d938dca46', 'multiverseId': 488160}, 'multiverseid': 488160}]", '[{\'name\': \'Durchbrechen\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, verursachen Trampelschaden bis zum Ende des Zuges. (Sie kann überschüssigen Kampfschaden dem verteidigenden Spieler oder Planeswalker zufügen.)\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485722&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92f2dc17-c355-4c98-81be-c3a03e95ead7\', \'multiverseId\': 485722}, \'multiverseid\': 485722}, {\'name\': \'Salir por la fuerza\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno. (Una criatura con la habilidad de arrollar puede hacer el daño de combate sobrante al jugador o planeswalker al que ataca.)\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485981&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22896a96-1f7f-4b2c-b4c3-f2ae09f6946d\', \'multiverseId\': 485981}, \'multiverseid\': 485981}, {\'name\': \'Passer à travers\', \'text\': "Les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (Une créature avec le piétinement peut infliger son surplus de blessures de combat au joueur ou au planeswalker qu\'elle attaque.)\\nPiochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486240&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a5dfe77-c4b4-4853-b9b1-51a6b5001d0a\', \'multiverseId\': 486240}, \'multiverseid\': 486240}, {\'name\': \'Sfondare\', \'text\': \'Le creature che controlli hanno travolgere fino alla fine del turno. (Una creatura con travolgere può infliggere il danno da combattimento in eccesso al giocatore o al planeswalker che sta attaccando.)\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486499&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'631baa7c-77e0-4cf8-9c76-a45a0341e11c\', \'multiverseId\': 486499}, \'multiverseid\': 486499}, {\'name\': \'突破\', \'text\': \'ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーはトランプルを得る。（トランプルを持つクリーチャーは余剰の戦闘ダメージを、それが攻撃しているプレイヤーかプレインズウォーカーに与えることができる。）\\nカードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486758&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'600b0000-7f31-4a8c-8b8e-024061310b05\', \'multiverseId\': 486758}, \'multiverseid\': 486758}, {\'name\': \'돌파\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물들은 턴종료까지 돌진을 얻는다. (돌진을 가진 생물은 여분의 전투피해를 공격 중인 플레이어 또는 플레인즈워커에게 입힐 수 있다.)\\n카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487017&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f62a8a05-b2ed-4957-b17b-e143125c1aee\', \'multiverseId\': 487017}, \'multiverseid\': 487017}, {\'name\': \'Irromper\', \'text\': \'As criaturas que você controla ganham atropelar até o final do turno. (Uma criatura com atropelar pode causar seu dano de combate excedente ao jogador ou planeswalker que ela estiver atacando.)\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487276&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd0c3088-48dc-44cb-8bb9-bafb2b0b2be5\', \'multiverseId\': 487276}, \'multiverseid\': 487276}, {\'name\': \'Пробиться\', \'text\': "Существа под вашим контролем получают Пробивной удар до конца хода. (Существо с Пробивным ударом может нанести избыточные боевые повреждения игроку или planeswalker\'у, которого атакует.)\\nВозьмите карту.", \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30bc311f-9e99-4b41-a5dd-fcbe95a34fd4\', \'multiverseId\': 487535}, \'multiverseid\': 487535}, {\'name\': \'全力突破\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物获得践踏异能直到回合结束。（具践踏异能的生物造成之过量战斗伤害能对所攻击的牌手或鹏洛客造成之。）\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487794&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4ce1f65-9caf-4b13-9a71-9158c73ad316\', \'multiverseId\': 487794}, \'multiverseid\': 487794}, {\'name\': \'全力突破\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物獲得踐踏異能直到回合結束。（具踐踏異能的生物造成之過量戰鬥傷害能對所攻擊的玩家或鵬洛客造成之。）\\n抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488053&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d78fc84-31f3-4e17-8492-e2680dbbd3e0\', \'multiverseId\': 488053}, \'multiverseid\': 488053}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dämonische Umarmung\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +3/+1, hat Flugfähigkeit und ist zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen ein Dämon.\\nDu kannst die Dämonische Umarmung aus deinem Friedhof wirken, indem du zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Kosten 3 Lebenspunkte bezahlst und eine Karte abwirfst.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485677&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e844e33-fcfb-433c-999f-2748a56f1617\', \'multiverseId\': 485677}, \'multiverseid\': 485677}, {\'name\': \'Abrazo demoníaco\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +3/+1, tiene la habilidad de volar y es un Demonio además de sus otros tipos.\\nPuedes lanzar el Abrazo demoníaco desde tu cementerio pagando 3 vidas y descartando una carta además de pagar sus otros costes.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485936&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59da7c04-1fec-4215-92da-ef45fd0d8330\', \'multiverseId\': 485936}, \'multiverseid\': 485936}, {\'name\': \'Étreinte démoniaque\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +3/+1, a le vol et est un démon en plus de ses autres types.\\nVous pouvez lancer l\'Étreinte démoniaque depuis votre cimetière en payant 3 points de vie et en vous défaussant d\'une carte en plus de payer ses autres coûts.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486195&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c315c1fc-a00a-4f90-b96d-d23b36f74fb6\', \'multiverseId\': 486195}, \'multiverseid\': 486195}, {\'name\': \'Abbraccio Demoniaco\', \'text\': "Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +3/+1, ha volare ed è un Demone in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi.\\nPuoi lanciare l\'Abbraccio Demoniaco dal tuo cimitero pagando 3 punti vita e scartando una carta oltre a pagare i suoi altri costi.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486454&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3c775f8-2e71-4ddd-aa6e-ae1d946e4ec6\', \'multiverseId\': 486454}, \'multiverseid\': 486454}, {\'name\': \'悪魔の抱擁\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは、＋３/＋１の修整を受け飛行を持ち、それの他のタイプに加えてデーモンでもある。\\nあなたはあなたの墓地から悪魔の抱擁を、これの他のコストの支払いに加えて、３点のライフを支払い、カード１枚を捨てることで唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486713&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eea61410-ed24-45aa-b05b-9aefdb4c3bd1\', \'multiverseId\': 486713}, \'multiverseid\': 486713}, {\'name\': \'악마의 포옹\', \'text\': \'생물에게 부여\\n부여된 생물은 +3/+1을 받고, 비행을 가지며, 자신의 다른 유형에 더불어 악마다.\\n당신은 악마의 포옹의 다른 비용을 지불하는 것에 더불어 생명 3점을 지불하고 카드 한 장을 버려서 악마의 포옹을 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=486972&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fb75da2-7372-408f-bfe5-b80eef3f8b51\', \'multiverseId\': 486972}, \'multiverseid\': 486972}, {\'name\': \'Abraço Demoníaco\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +3/+1, tem voar e é um Demônio além de seus outros tipos.\\nVocê pode conjurar Abraço Demoníaco de seu cemitério pagando 3 pontos de vida e descartando um card além de pagar seus outros custos.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68e33052-58be-4fab-a904-8566b00b6587\', \'multiverseId\': 487231}, \'multiverseid\': 487231}, {\'name\': \'Объятья Демона\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо получает +3/+1, имеет Полет и является Демоном в дополнение к своим другим типам.\\nВы можете разыграть Объятья Демона из вашего кладбища, заплатив 3 жизни и сбросив карту в дополнение к оплате других их стоимостей.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487490&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'791fc6c2-404b-43c0-a7b3-51d67f0993cc\', \'multiverseId\': 487490}, \'multiverseid\': 487490}, {\'name\': \'恶魔之拥\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得+3/+1，具有飞行异能，且额外具有恶魔此类别。\\n你可以从你的坟墓场中施放恶魔之拥，但在其他费用以外，还须额外支付3点生命并弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=487749&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dde8d9ba-62b5-4d82-8be3-86e35f62f536\', \'multiverseId\': 487749}, \'multiverseid\': 487749}, {\'name\': \'惡魔之擁\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n所結附的生物得+3/+1，具有飛行異能，且額外具有惡魔此類別。\\n你可以從你的墳墓場中施放惡魔之擁，但在其他費用以外，還須額外支付3點生命並棄一張牌。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488008&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35bb39af-c8a3-4a1c-8b34-e5277985f1af\', \'multiverseId\': 488008}, \'multiverseid\': 488008}]', "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488476&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6adbf942-550d-4274-84f7-ff3253206b5f', 'multiverseId': 488476}, 'multiverseid': 488476}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488491&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cff25fbf-3cfe-4272-9912-95b1b993a5ef', 'multiverseId': 488491}, 'multiverseid': 488491}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488506&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1ffb2f93-00c9-4726-859d-a1f8599c9811', 'multiverseId': 488506}, 'multiverseid': 488506}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488521&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd66e1eb5-1e77-48bd-aaaa-d87f9f1e1b32', 'multiverseId': 488521}, 'multiverseid': 488521}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=488536&type=card', 'langu