our library.', "When Garruk's Uprising enters the battlefield, if you control a creature with power 4 or greater, draw a card.\\nCreatures you control have trample. (They can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker they're attacking.)\\nWhenever a creature with power 4 or greater enters the battlefield under your control, draw a card.", "When Garruk's Uprising enters the battlefield, if you control a creature with power 4 or greater, draw a card.\\nCreatures you control have trample.\\nWhenever a creature with power 4 or greater enters the battlefield under your control, draw a card.", 'When Goblin Arsonist dies, you may have it deal 1 damage to any target.', 'When Idol of Endurance enters the battlefield, exile all creature cards with converted mana cost 3 or less from your graveyard until Idol of Endurance leaves the battlefield.\\n{1}{W}, {T}: Until end of turn, you may cast a creature spell from among the cards exiled with Idol of Endurance without paying its mana cost.', 'When Llanowar Visionary enters the battlefield, draw a card.\\n{T}: Add {G}.', 'When Massacre Wurm enters the battlefield, creatures your opponents control get -2/-2 until end of turn.\\nWhenever a creature an opponent controls dies, that player loses 2 life.', 'When Meteorite enters the battlefield, it deals 2 damage to any target.\\n{T}: Add one mana of any color.', 'When Pitchburn Devils dies, it deals 3 damage to any target.', "When Pridemalkin enters the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control.\\nEach creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it has trample. (They can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker they're attacking.)", 'When Pursued Whale enters the battlefield, each opponent creates a 1/1 red Pirate creature token with "This creature can\'t block" and "Creatures you control attack each combat if able."\\nSpells your opponents cast that target Pursued Whale cost {3} more to cast.', 'When Radiant Fountain enters the battlefield, you gain 2 life.\\n{T}: Add {C}.', 'When Rambunctious Mutt enters the battlefield, destroy target artifact or enchantment an opponent controls.', 'When Skeleton Archer enters the battlefield, it deals 1 damage to any target.', 'When Solemn Simulacrum enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle your library.\\nWhen Solemn Simulacrum dies, you may draw a card.', 'When Spirit of Malevolence dies, each opponent loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.', 'When Storm Caller enters the battlefield, it deals 2 damage to each opponent.', "When Teferi's Tutelage enters the battlefield, draw a card, then discard a card.\\nWhenever you draw a card, target opponent mills two cards.", "When Teferi's Tutelage enters the battlefield, draw a card, then discard a card.\\nWhenever you draw a card, target opponent mills two cards. (They put the top two cards of their library into their graveyard.)", 'When Trufflesnout enters the battlefield, choose one —\\n• Put a +1/+1 counter on Trufflesnout.\\n• You gain 4 life.', "Whenever Falconer Adept attacks, create a 1/1 white Bird creature token with flying that's tapped and attacking.", "Whenever Ghostly Pilferer becomes untapped, you may pay {2}. If you do, draw a card.\\nWhenever an opponent casts a spell from anywhere other than their hand, draw a card.\\nDiscard a card: Ghostly Pilferer can't be blocked this turn.", "Whenever Gloom Sower becomes blocked by a creature, that creature's controller loses 2 life and you gain 2 life.", 'Whenever Historian of Zhalfir attacks, if you control a Teferi planeswalker, draw a card.', 'Whenever Library Larcenist attacks, draw a card.', 'Whenever Makeshift Battalion and at least two other creatures attack, put a +1/+1 counter on Makeshift Battalion.', "Whenever a source you control deals noncombat damage to an opponent, Chandra's Pyreling gets +1/+0 and gains double strike until end of turn.", "Whenever a source you control deals noncombat damage to an opponent, Chandra's Pyreling gets +1/+0 and gains double strike until end of turn. (It deals both first-strike and regular combat damage.)", 'Whenever you activate a loyalty ability of a Chandra planeswalker, Keral Keep Disciples deals 1 damage to each opponent.', 'Whenever you cast a Dog spell, create a 1/1 green Cat creature token.\\nWhenever you cast a Cat spell, create a 1/1 white Dog creature token.\\n{R}{G}{W}, {T}: Rin and Seri, Inseparable deals damage to any target equal to the number of Dogs you control. You gain life equal to the number of Cats you control.', 'Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, put a +1/+1 counter on Spellgorger Weird.', 'Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, you may have Riddleform become a 3/3 Sphinx creature with flying in addition to its other types until end of turn.\\n{2}{U}: Scry 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put that card on the bottom of your library.)', "Whenever you cast a spell that's white, blue, black, or red, put a +1/+1 counter on Quirion Dryad.", 'Whenever you cast your first instant or sorcery spell each turn, copy that spell. You may choose new targets for the copy.', 'Whenever you draw a card, Burlfist Oak gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Whenever you draw a card, put a +1/+1 counter on Lorescale Coatl.', 'Whenever you draw a card, you may pay {1}. When you do, you may tap or untap target creature.', 'Whenever you draw your second card each turn, Mystic Skyfish gains flying until end of turn.', 'Whenever you draw your second card each turn, create a 2/2 green Cat creature token.\\n{4}{G}{G}: Until end of turn, creatures you control have base power and toughness X/X, where X is the number of cards in your hand.', 'Whenever you gain life, target opponent loses that much life.\\n{3}{B}{B}: Creatures you control gain lifelink until end of turn.', 'Whenever you sacrifice a permanent, Havoc Jester deals 1 damage to any target.', 'Wildwood Scourge enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it.\\nWhenever one or more +1/+1 counters are put on another non-Hydra creature you control, put a +1/+1 counter on Wildwood Scourge.', 'Wind-Scarred Crag enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Wind-Scarred Crag enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life.\\n{T}: Add {R} or {W}.', 'You draw two cards and each opponent discards two cards. Each player loses 2 life.', 'You gain 3 life.\\nDraw a card.', 'You gain 4 life. If a creature died this turn, you gain 8 life instead.', "You may activate loyalty abilities of Teferi, Master of Time on any player's turn any time you could cast an instant.\\n+1: Draw a card, then discard a card.\\n−3: Target creature you don't control phases out. (Treat it and anything attached to it as though they don't exist until its controller's next turn.)\\n−10: Take two extra turns after this one.", "You may activate loyalty abilities of Teferi, Master of Time on any player's turn any time you could cast an instant.\\n+1: Draw a card, then discard a card.\\n−3: Target creature you don't control phases out.\\n−10: Take two extra turns after this one.", 'You may play two additional lands on each of your turns.', 'You may spend mana as though it were mana of any color.\\n{T}: Add {C}{C}{C}{C}{C}.\\n{5}, {T}: Draw a card for each color among permanents you control.', 'Zombies you control get +1/+0.\\nAt the beginning of your end step, if a creature died this turn, you may pay {1}{B}. If you do, create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token.', '{1}, Discard a land card or Shrine card: Sanctum of Shattered Heights deals X damage to target creature or planeswalker, where X is the number of Shrines you control.', '{1}, Sacrifice Thrashing Brontodon: Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', '{1}{B}, {T}, Sacrifice a creature: You gain 1 life and draw a card.', '{1}{B}, {T}: Each opponent loses 2 life. Activate this ability only if a creature died this turn.', '{1}{R}: Igneous Cur gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', '{1}{U}, {T}: Draw a card, then discard a card.', '{1}{W}, {T}: Tap target creature. Activate this ability only if you control a creature with flying.', '{2}: Add one mana of any color.', '{2}: Put target card from your graveyard on the bottom of your library.', '{2}{U}: Target creature gains flying until end of turn.', '{4}, {T}, Sacrifice Silent Dart: It deals 3 damage to target creature.', '{5}{W}: Tap target creature. This ability costs {1} less to activate for each Shrine you control.', '{G}: Exile target card from a graveyard. If it was a creature card, put a +1/+1 counter on Scavenging Ooze and you gain 1 life.', '{T}, Pay 3 life: Flip a coin. If you win the flip, you gain 6 life.', '{T}, Put a page counter on Mazemind Tome: Scry 1.\\n{2}, {T}, Put a page counter on Mazemind Tome: Draw a card.\\nWhen there are four or more page counters on Mazemind Tome, exile it. If you do, you gain 4 life.', '{T}, Sacrifice Fabled Passage: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle your library. Then if you control four or more lands, untap that land.', "{T}, Sacrifice Liliana's Steward: Target opponent discards a card. Activate this ability only any time you could cast a sorcery.", "{T}, Sacrifice Tormod's Crypt: Exile all cards from target player's graveyard.", '{T}: Add {C}. Spend this mana only to cast an instant or sorcery spell.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on target Bird, Cat, Dog, Goat, Ox, or Snake.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}.', '{T}: Add {G} for each creature with power 4 or greater you control.\\n{7}{R}: Leafkin Avenger deals damage equal to its power to target player or planeswalker.', "{T}: Chandra's Magmutt deals 1 damage to target player or planeswalker.", '{T}: Draw a card, then discard a card.\\n{2}{U}{B}, {T}, Sacrifice Obsessive Stitcher: Return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield.', '{W}, {T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature with a +1/+1 counter on it.\\n{4}{W}{W}, {T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.']
